<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Aposel</para>
  <para style="toc3">Aposel</para>
  <para style="toc2">Aposel</para>
  <para style="toc1">Aposel</para>
  <para style="mt">Aposel</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1" />
  <para style="s">Jisas ere mogl, God Murubuglo unabedi ka kaima di te paduglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1-2" />Agra Teofilus yo, na buk ta erme boglka i, ene bogl teiga. Na buk ta ama okna boglka i mina yegl pre boglka, Jisas kogon siragl mere mabuno bogl erukwa i, ya te, yoba ka siragl mere beke tedre, taragl kane kane ere kodugo, okuo God ye agre i ede heven ibo ogwa i pre boglka. Jisas ede heven ibo ogwa i, okuo ogwa ba okna kana God Murubuglo ye nomane togo, Jisas ye yagl tau kere idre, dedugwa ikra ka kidine tau di togwa. Di te kodugo, okuo God ye agre i ede heven ibo ogwa. <verse eid="ACT 1:1-2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3" />Jisas giugl podo prisre, gogl, adigl u kor pidre, ye ege 40-pela de makandigle moglkwa. Moglsre, ege tau mere ye dedugwa yoba i meglmara plau didre, ye ka kaima u kor omedi kanaiglkwa pre taragl tau mere obuno di tedre, God yoba kingno mogl, ye suglno morabuka i pre ye ka tau ama di togwa.<verse eid="ACT 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4" />Ana aglke ta Jisas ye dedugwa yoba bogl akie meglko, Jisas ye ka giglede di te, yegl dugwa, Ene dumo Jerusalem kide kodokre, na Nina ene taragl wakai ta tenagledi ka kaima di te paduglkwa ikra pre sugl molo! dugwa. Na ye siragl taragl ene tenabuka i, ene di te kodiga. <verse eid="ACT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5" />Jon yoba ake nigl atne ede, nigl bugl togwa ba na Nina kuri ta mogl, kogon ere ta ede Mudu Murubuglo ene tenabuka pre sugl molo di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6" />Ana ege ta Jisas ye dedugwa yoba i bogl akie meglko, yagl wagle i ere mogl, Jisas kira pogl, yegl di prikwa, Yagl Kade, erme ene Rom yoba no Israel yoba bitno meglkwa i sedidre, okna Israel yoba keme ye no bitno meglmere yegl, ene no Israel yoba munga i, kingno moratno? digwa. <verse eid="ACT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7" />Yegl di priko, Jisas ye di ikne ede te, yegl dugwa, Ene na king moratne digwa i, na kaima king moraglka ba na king moraglka ege i, Nina yene taragl mudu bitno moglsre, ege ta ere paduglkwa pre ye moglmara swara i pame dugwa. Ye ege ta ere paduglkwa i, ene praiglkwa ta kuno erekrume dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8" />Yegl paugwa ba ene prio! dugwa. God Murubuglo i ene meglmara udre, yobuglo tenan, ene na kana i pi yoba di tenaiglkwa. Ene yoba Jerusalem meglkwa i ya distrik Judia mudu suna meglkwa i di tedre, te yoba distrik Samaria we dimara meglkwa i ya te, yoba bage bage uglo koglo koglo meglkwa i, di tenaiglmiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas ede ikne heven ibo ogwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9" />
    <figure style="fig" file="FM 196 Ascension_6inches_BW.jpg" size="col" copy="Foundation Matters" ref="1.9" />Ana Jisas ka yegl di kodugo, God ye agre i ede heven ibo ogwa. God ye agre i ede heven ibo ogo, ye dedugwa yoba ikra kan meglkwa. Kan meglko, ye ede kamun kua mina ede atne ogo, kamun kua si torua eruko, ye ta kankrikwa. <verse eid="ACT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10" />Ana ye Jisas kanamnedi ye omara i toro kan mina ibo ede meglko, yagl suo kugugl gagl kruo eribrika tabre u, ye meglmara plau dibriko, ye kandre, nagino keglkwa. Kandre, nagino keglko, yagl suo i adigl moglsre, <verse eid="ACT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11" />ye yegl di pribrika, Yagl wagle, ene distrik Galili nem meglkwa i, ene siragl pre adigl mogl, kan mina ibo ede meglme? dibrika. God ye Jisas agre i ede heven ibo ogo, ene kan meglkwa. Ege swara ta ye omere kuno yegl mere, Jisas aglke kor ikne unabiwe di, yegl dibrika.<verse eid="ACT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yagl ta Judas agaimo inabedi kere igwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12" />Ana angelo suo ye Jisas dedugwa yoba yegl di te kodibriko, Jisas dedugwa yoba i, ye muglo Oliv we dimara meglkwa i kide kodo, aglke ede ikne u dumo Jerusalem wigwa. Muglo i, Jerusalem yomara magigl, 1 kilomita mere yegl yogwa. <verse eid="ACT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13" />Ye aglke ede ikne pi Jerusalem suna pidre, ye ede yugu ta yomara yugugl pidre, bogl mitna ibo kiule ta ye pai pai erimara i, eigwa. Yagl meglkwa i, kagno Pita ya Jon ya Jems ya Andru ya Filip ya Tomas ya Bartolomyu ya Matyu ya Jems, ye Alfius wam moglkwa i, ya te, Saimon, ye Selot yoba ta moglkwa i<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Juda yoba tau ye yugobono ta i nogugl ede, ye kagno Selot we digwa yoba i ye Juda yoba mogl pere edinamndi pre, Rom yoba kuda bogl tenamnedi prikwa yoba meglkwa. Saimon i ye okna yugobono i mina suna moglkwa ba erme ye Jisas dedugwa yoba ta moglkwa.</char></note> ya te, Judas, ye yagl ta Jems we digwa wam moglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14" />Yagl i mudu deno muduno swara yedre, ege ege makai si mogl, kamage ere meglkwa. Yagl i yeigo, abu tau ama yeigo, Jisas mam Maria ya Jisas agiglema ama yeigo, ye ege ege makai si, yegl kede erikwa.<verse eid="ACT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15" />Ana igne i Jisas pre mediglkwa yoba i, 120 mere yegl ege swara ta akie makai si meglkwa. Makai si meglko, Pita ye meglmara suna i adigl moglsre, ka ta yegl dugwa, <verse eid="ACT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16" />Na agrama wagle, na yagl Judas, ye yoba Jisas si kane sinaiglmedi agre yugwa i pre dinaglka, ene prio! dugwa. God kamo okna Judas pre beglkwa i, pai inabuka keme paugwa. Siragl ta Judas moglmara okuo plau dinabuka i God Murubuglo okna kana ka i Devit di togo, Devit boglkwa, pramga. <verse eid="ACT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17" />Na Judas pre diga i, no Jisas dedugwa yoba munara suna i, Jisas ye yagl Judas ama kogonmo erabedi ye kere yugo, okna akie muniwe di, Pita yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18" />Ana okna yagl Judas mabuno kide ere, topo yugwa i, ye mige i pi dumo makan ta topo sugwa. Ye makan ta topo sumara i pidre, yage si, dane si bla dugo, dem kane ede meda ogwa. <verse eid="ACT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19" />Ana Judas yegl ere, yage si goglko, ka wai dugo, yoba mudu dumo Jerusalem kipai meglkwa i prisre, yene kano mina dumo i kagie Akeldama we digwa. Ye kano mina Akeldama we digwa i, mabuno yegl mere, bormai dumo we digwa.<verse eid="ACT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20" />Ana Pita ye Judas pre ka ta ama aglke kor yegl dugwa, Yoba ta okna ibo buk Giglage mina yegl boglme dugwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">Yagl i yugumo toglmo wau yenan, yoba okuo ta kipaikraiglme<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 69.25</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 1:20">di, yegl boglkwa. Ana Judas goglmara ka i plau dume dugwa. Te, buk Giglage mina ama ta boglkwa i,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">Yagl i kogon ta erukwa i, yoba pere ta ye agaimo idre, erabiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 109.8</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 1:20">di, yegl boglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 1:20" /><verse number="21-22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21-22" />Ka yegl bogl atne edugo, paugwa pre nono erme magigl munga i yagl swara ta Judas agaimo inabedi kere inamga pamiwe dugwa. Yagl ta kere inamga i, Yagl Kade Jisas bogl akie mogl pai erumga igne, yagl ta ye ege ege no munara akie mogl pai erumga i ta kan, kere inamniwe dugwa. Okna John ye Jisas ake nigl atne ede, nigl bugl togwa igne, ede u erme God ye Jisas nono munara kide kodo, ede heven ibo enabedi agre i ede ogwa igne pra, suna i ege ege yagl ta akie wan mogl erumga ta morabuka i pre die dugwa. Yoba swara yegl ta morabuka kere yumun, yagl i no yagl tau bogl akie Jisas u kor ogwa i, yoba di tenamga pamiwe di, Pita yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 1:21-22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23" />Ana Pita yegl dugwa pre ye ere mogl, yagl suo miurka ye swarano ta kere inamnedi di padiglkwa. Yagl ta kagie suota paugwa. Yoba ye kagie Josep we didre, Barsabas we didre, te, Jastus ama we digwa. Te, yagl ta kagie Matias we digwa. <verse eid="ACT 1:23" /><verse number="24-25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24-25" />Ye yagl suo i swarano ta kere i suna edinamnedi ye ere mogl, kamage ere, yegl digwa, Yagl Kade yo, yoba mudu ene deno muduno kan pogl si kodinga pre ene yagl swara ta Judas agaimo inabedi kere inga i, i nogugl ede noro digwa. Ene yagl Judas okna kere idre, kogon tenga i, ye kide kodidre, ede pi dumo kide enabara i, pi kodugwa pre dumniwe digwa. <verse eid="ACT 1:24-25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26" />Ye kamage yegl ersre, Yagl Kade ye ira kere yugwa i kanamnedi ere mogl, kobuglo suo mina mak pere pere ta ere padigl, ede atne edigwa. Ede atne edidre, swara ta i meda ede, kanigwa i, Matias pre mak sigwa ikra paugo, kanigwa. Kanigwa pre yagl Matias i ye Jisas dedugwa yoba 11-pela meglmara suna i dedigo, ye Judas agaimo yugo, kogon akie erikwa.<verse eid="ACT 1:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2" />
  <para style="s">God Murubuglo Ugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Day of Pentecost" file="FM 197 Day of Pentecost_6inches_BW.jpg" size="col" copy="Foundation Matters" ref="2.1" />Ana ege kade Pentikos<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka Grik mina ka Pentikos mabuno paugwa, 50-pela De. I siragl pre Israel yoba ye Pasova nedre, wakan 7-pela mo 50-pela de mogl, kaya mokna podo i ama neigwa.</char></note>yogo, Jisas pre mediglkwa yoba mudu yugu swara ta yugugl makai si meglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2" />Makai si meglko, ir waga podo kide ta mu dumere mere yegl, mu ta heven ibo di ede atne ugwa. Ede atne u ye yugugl ame didre, makai si meglmara i mu podo kaima dugo, ye mudu prikwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3" />Prisre, ye kanigwa i, taragl ta doga drabie mere yegl, udre, ede pere pere pi, ye swara swarade meglmara pi tebe de paigwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4" />De paigo, God Murubuglo ye mudu si kau si tedre, ere edugo, yene kano dikre, ka pere pere digwa.<verse eid="ACT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5" />Ana ege kade yogwa pre Juda yoba tau God kuduglmo geglkwa Jerusalem mogl pai meglkwa. Yoba i, kantri pere pere uglo koglo koglo kipai meglkwa i ede Jerusalem wigwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6" />Pai meglko, mu podo ikra dugo, yob mere kide prisre, ede wigwa. Wigo, Jisas pre mediglkwa yoba ikra ye drano yake togo, ka pere pere di meglko, yoba wigwa ikra prisre, ye prikwa i, yoba ta ye yoba tau wigwa i, kano pamere i dugo, te yoba ta ye yoba tau wigwa i, kano pamere i dugo, yoba ye kantri pere pere aglo mogl wigwa i, kano pamere i digo, prikwa. Ye swarade yoba kano pere pere pamere i digo, ye no kano pere pere pamere i dimedi prisre, nagino podo keglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7" />Ye nagino podo kogl, yene di ikne ikne ede, yegl digwa, Yoba i, ye mudu distrik Galili nem mam meglkwa ba <verse eid="ACT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8" />siragl eruko, ye nono kano pere pere pamere i dime? digwa.<verse eid="ACT 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Map, places mentioned in Acts 2" file="Map_Tongues_Kuman.jpg" size="span" copy="FMOsoft" ref="2.9" />Yoba ye u ka digo pre meglkwa i, tau dumo makan Partia ya Midia ya Elam kipai mogl, wigo, te tau dumo makan Mesopotemia ya distrik Judia kipai mogl wigo, tau provins Kapadosia ya Pontus ya Esia ama kipai mogl, wigwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10" />Te, tau dumo makan Frigia ya Pamfilia kipai mogl, wigo, tau kantri Isip kipai mogl, wigo, te tau dumo makan Libia we dimara suna, taun ta Sairini yomara i magigl kipai mogl wigwa. Te, tau ama dumo Rom mogl, okna kana ede u Jerusalem ege sugunagle ta moramnedi wigwa. Ye tau Juda yoba meglko, tau Juda yoba moglkrikwa ba ye Juda yoba mabunono duglo bogl, ye pra, Juda yoba mere yegl meglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11" />Te, tau dumo makan ta mudi nigl suna yogwa, Krit we digwa i, kipai mogl wigo, tau dumo makan Arebia ama kipai mogl, wigwa. Yoba mudu makai sigwa i ere mogl, yegl digwa, Yoba i, ye God yobuglo ere, taragl kane kane erukwa i ye nono kano pere pere pamere i mina ka digo, prumne digwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12" />Yegl didre, ye wai kugl, nagino koglsre, yene di ikne ikne ede pre, yegl digwa, Aya, taragl podo plau dugwa i, mabuno siragl mere pame? di, yegl digwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13" />Ba yoba tau ere mogl, pre mediglkwa yoba kenaglno si, Ye wain nuglo mere kide nedre, spak erime di, yegl digwa.<verse eid="ACT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pita yoba ka mabuno di togwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14" />Ana yoba tau yegl digo, Pita ere mogl, Jisas dedugwa yoba 11-pela ikra bogl akie adigl meglko, Pita ka podo didre, ye yoba mere kide makai si meglkwa ikra yegl di togwa, Ene Juda yoba meglkwa ya te, ene yoba mudu dumo Jerusalem kipai meglkwa i, ene prio! dugwa. Taragl ta plau dugo, ene kanigwa i, mabunomo ene di tebo, praiglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15" />Yagl i, ene tau ye spak erimedi prikwa i, ye spak ta erekrikwa. Siragl pre erme i, 9 klok tagna mogl yogwa pre tagna mogl i wain nuglo nenaiglkwa i ta kuno erekrumiwe dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16" />Taragl ta plau dugo, ene kanigwa i, God kamo kep yoba ta kagie Joel we digwa i, ka ta okna boglkwa i pai yumiwe dugwa. Ye ka yegl di boglkwa,<verse eid="ACT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17" />God yegl dugwa, Ege okuo, taragl mudu dudinagledi erabuka igne,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">Na ere mogl, Murubuglona yoba mudu meglmara dedenagle dugwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">Na dedibo, yoba mudu meglmara enan, ene wanoma ya abroma na kana kep ere dinaiglkwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">Dibi, te ene yagl kulu meglkwa i, gumuglnomugl eran, kanibi, te, ene yagl kidagl meglkwa i ugl kubu kane kane kanaiglmiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Joel 2.28-32</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 2:17">di, God yegl dume dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18" />Yegl didre, ama God yegl dume dugwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:18">Igne i, na ere mogl, na Murubuglona dedibo, na niglna kogona yoba mudu meglmara ka kaima enabuka. Dedibo, na niglna kogona yagl ya abu meglmara enan, ye na kana kep ere, yoba di tenaiglmiwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19" />Te, na ama diu tau kamun mitna ibo ya dumo makan mina eraglka. Eribo, yoba ye bormai ya doga ya te, ede inge podo kide kaima plau dinan, kanaiglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20" />Te, ade mim eran, ba ake bormai ede, ede u gogl enabuka. Yegl eran, okuo i na Yagl Kade moglka i, egena podo kide kaima, na yoba ka tage tenaglka ege i, unabuka. <verse eid="ACT 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21" />Ana yoba ta ere mogl, na Yagl Kade moglka i, ye na ere inabedi agle ta dinan, na ye ere inaluwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Joel 2.28-32</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 2:21">di, God yegl di togo, yagl Joel ikra boglmiwe di, Pita yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22" />Ana Pita ka yegl didre, ye ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Ene Israel yoba meglkwa i, na ka ta dinaglka i, ene prio! dugwa. Na Jisas, ye dumo Nasaret nem moglkwa i pre dinaglka. God ye Jisas yobuglo togo, Jisas okna ene meglmara suna kimagl ya diu kane kane eruko, enene pre kan erikwa. Ye kimagl ya diu kane kane erukwa i, ene God ye dedugo, umedi kan pogl sinaiglkwa pre kimagl yegl erume dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23" />Ana Jisas goglkwa i, God yene oknayene ibo pre kan ersre, siragl eragledi di paduglmere i, ye ersre, Jisas ene ogono mina yogwa. Ene ogono mina yogo, ene Jisas si goraiglmedi ye i pi Rom yoba, ye God lomo pre kan erekrikwa meglmara teigo, ye ogo kagle ede prak mina padigl, nil sidre, si geglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24" />Ye Jisas si geglkwa i, ye giugl podo kide prisre, goglkwa ba ye aimadi gorabuka ka kaima ta kuno erekrukwa. Yegl pre God ye ere i kor edugo, adigl u kor omiwe di, Pita yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25" />Pita yegl didre, ka ta ama yegl dugwa, King Devit i, okna ibo Jisas ka dinabere ye dra idre, ka ta yegl boglme dugwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:25">Yagl Kade ege ege na moglmara magigl moglko, na kanie dugwa. Ye na moglmara mogl narukwa pre na yoba mo taragl kane kane ta kudugl gogl tekragle dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26" />Te, ye na moglmara mogl narukwa pre na dena muduna mina gun yei tedre, ye di wakai yei teiwe dugwa. Ye ama na ogona nagna mina ere wakai ere narabuka i, pre gi die dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27" />Yegl didre, ye ama agle di, yegl dugwa, God yo, na pre gi diga i, mabuno yegl pamiwe dugwa. Na ene kogonen eraglka pre ene na i pere edingo, moglka i, na goraglka ba ene na ta kanige etn, na kiana yoba geglkwa pai meglmara aimadi ta pai moglkrabuka. Te, na ogona gagna maugl sinaiglkwa ba maugl sinaiglmara i ta buglkrabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28" />Na goglbo, ene na ere i kor edinatnga i, ene obuno di nare kodinga pre na adigl u kor pidre, ene bogl akie morabuglka i, gun podo yenaluwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 16.8-11</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 2:28">di, Devit ye Jisas dinabere dra idre, okna ibo yegl boglme dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29" />Ana Pita ka tau yegl didre, ye ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Na agrama wagle, na ene ka kaima di teiwe dugwa. Nono kowano awano Devit ka yegl bogl atne edugwa i, ye yene pre dikrukwa i nogugl paugo, nono kamniwe dugwa. Devit goglko, yoba okna ye maugl sigwa i, ye giglmo pene erme yogo, kamniwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30" />Yegl pre Devit ye God kamo kep yoba ta moglkwa pre ye ka boglkwa i yene pre boglkrukwa ba ye gawamo ta unabuka i pre boglkwa. God ye Devit di te padigl, Devit gawamo ta okuo ye king moglmere yegl, king morabedi ka giglede di te paduglkwa i, Devit pre kan ersre, ka yegl boglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31" />Ye boglkwa i, taragl okuo plau dinabuka i pre kan ersre, God Kere Yugwa Yagl goglsre, adigl u kor enabuka i pre dugwa. Jisas gorabuka ba God ye kiamo yoba geglkwa pai meglmara aimadi pai morabedi kanige erekrabuka i, ya te, ye ogo nagie buglkrabuka i pre Devit okna yegl boglme dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32" />Pita ka yegl di kodidre, ama yegl dugwa, Ana yagl Jisas i, God ye ere i kor edugo, no mudu kadre, ene di tomniwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33" />God ye ere i kor edidre, agre i ede heven ibo ogwa. Agre i pidre, kagie kade te, ye ogo wo kra ame di morabedi dedugwa. Dedidre, ye okna ka kaima di te paduglmere i ere mogl, God Murubuglo yoba tenabedi Jisas tome dugwa. Togo, Jisas ere mogl, God Murubuglo no munara si kau si norabedi noruko, taragl mudu erme ene kanigwa ya prikwa i, God Murubuglo taragl i erumiwe dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 2:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34" />Yegl didre, Pita ama yegl dugwa, God Devit ta agre i ede heven ibo pikrukwa ba Devit ka ta okna boglkwa i, Jisas pre yegl boglkwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34">Neno Kade ere mogl, na Yaglna Kade yegl di togwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:34">Ene ogona wo kra ame di moglo.<verse eid="ACT 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35" />Na ene kudanen ikne yobuglo ere tedre,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:35">kagln mina atne edinaluwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 110.1</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 2:35">di, God ye Jisas pre yegl dugo, Devit ye God dumere bogl atne edumiwe dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36" />Pita ka yegl didre, ka di pi dudumara i yegl dugwa, Yegl pre ene ya Israel yoba mudu pre pogl sinaiglmiwe dugwa. Yagl Jisas, ene ede prak mina si geglkwa i, God ye Kere Yugwa Yagle moglsre, nono Yaglno Kade morabedi kagie kade tomiwe di, Pita yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoba mere kide Jisas pre mediglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37" />Ana Pita ka yegl di kodugo, yoba makai si mogl, ye kamo prikwa ikra, ye deno muduno mina boglko, ye kide pre, nomane podo sidre, ye Pita ya Jisas dedugwa yoba mudu ikra di pre, yegl digwa, Agroma wagle, no siragl eramne? digwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38" />Yegl digo, Pita di ikne ede te, Ene swara swarade God ene tadaglmeno gugl ede norabedi nomano yake teo. Jisas kaima God Kere Yugwa Yagl moglmedi nomano tedre, nigl biglbi, God ye Murubuglomo yoko kaima tenabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39" />Yagl Kade, nono Godno moglkwa i, ye Murubuglomo yoba tenagledi ka kaima di te paduglkwa i, yoba mudu ira ta God agle dinabuka, pre, unabuka i, ye Murubuglomo tenabuka pre dumiwe dugwa. Na erme diga i, ene ya ene gawanoma ya te, yoba mudu dumo eglke pere pere kipai meglkwa, i pre diwe di, Pita yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 2:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40" />Ana Pita ka yegl di kodidre, ye ka kidine tau mere ama didre, yoba makai si meglkwa i ka giglede di te, Ene kan kun erio! dugwa. Juda yoba yugobuno erme meglkwa i, mabuno kide kaima boglsre, u kide pi kodigwa. God ye ka tage tenabara i, ene ama akie ka tage te dinabiwa! Ene teke ede eglke wio dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41" />Pita yegl di togo, yoba mere kide ye kamo i prisre, pre mediglkwa. Pre mediglsre, nigl biglkwa. Yegl erikwa pre ege swara i mina yoba 3,000 mere yegl, Jisas pre mediglkwa yoba yugobuno meglmara i ede suna wigwa.<verse eid="ACT 2:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas pre mediglkwa yoba i, deno muduno swara yei, meglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42" />Ana Jisas pre mediglkwa yoba i, ege ege Jisas dedugwa yoba ka mabuno di teigwa i prisre, akie makai sidre, Jisas goglkwa poglo di pramnedi bret akie buko di nedre, akie kamage ere mogl, erikwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43" />Yegl eriko, Jisas dedugwa yoba ikra ama God yobuglomo mina kimagl ya diu kane kane ere meglkwa pre yoba mudu Jerusalem kipai meglkwa i, God kuduglmo geglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44" />Te, yoba Jisas pre mediglkwa i, deno muduno swara yedre, mudu akie makai si meglkwa. Yegl ersre, ye ama ye yene ake ple di ikne ikne ede, taragl ere neigwa i, te ikne ikne ede, erikwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45" />Yegl ersre, te ye meglmara suna i, yoba tau kaya mokna mo taragl ta ye meglmara yeikrukwa igne i yoba tau ye ere mogl, makano ya bonaganano ki mige boglsre, mige i pi yoba i ta idre, ere nenaiglkwa pamere yegl teigwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46" />Yegl ersre, ye ege ege tawa teigwa yugu yomara i makai sidre, te yoba kipai meglmara i ama makai si mogl, Jisas goglkwa poglo di pramnedi bret buko di neigwa. Yegl ersre, kaya mokna ki ama swara mogl nedre, gun yei, deno muduno swara yedre, erikwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47" />Ye yegl ersre, ye ege ege God kagie kade te meglko, Juda yoba mudu ye wakai kanigwa. Te, yoba kor ege ege Jisas pre mediglko, Yagl Kade ye ere idre, ye Jisas yugobunomo meglmara i, i suna edugo, meglkwa.<verse eid="ACT 2:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3" />
  <para style="s">Yagl ta kagle mawa sugwa i, ede u kor ogwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1" />Ana aglke ta poko dugo, ade kia 3 klok yogwa. 3 klok yogo, Pita ya Jon ede pi tawa teigwa yugu yomara togl suna enabugledi ebrika. Poko dugwa 3 klok i, Israel yoba tawa teigwa yugu yomara togl suna pi kamage ere teigwa ege yogwa. <verse eid="ACT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2" />Ana ye ede pi tawa teigwa yugu enabugledi ebrika ege i, yoba tau ama ere mogl, yagl ta kagle mawa sugwa ede padigl, boglo ere i pi tawa teigwa yugu yomara togl dra, yoba ede suna eimara i bina edigwa. Togl dra yoba ede suna eimara i, kagie Togl Dra Wakai we digwa. Yagl i ye mam kugl yogwa ege i, kagle mawa sugwa. Yegl erukwa pre yoba ege ege ye mige yana dinabedi boglo ere i pi tawa teigwa yugu yomara yoba ede togl suna pi, pi erimara i edigo, ye mige ta naraiglmedi ogo kugl, yana di moglkwa.<verse eid="ACT 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3" />Ana yagl kagle mawa sugwa ikra togl dra yomara yoba ede suna unaiglmara ikra moglsre, kanugwa i, Pita ya Jon ede u togl suna unabugledi eribriko, kanugwa. Kandre, ye mige ta narabredi yana dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4" />Ye mige narabredi yana dugo, Pita ya Jon ye toro kanibrika. Ye toro kanibriko, Pita ka yegl di, yagl kagle mawa sugwa i di togwa, No kano! dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5" />Yegl dugo, yagl kagle mawa sugwa ikra ye mige mo ki ta nara pre dibredi prisre, kan mina ede, ye kanugwa. <verse eid="ACT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6" />Kan mina ede, ye kanugo, Pita ye di te, yegl dugwa, Na mige gol mo silva ta panan, ene ake ple dinaglka ta paikrukwa ba na ake moglmere tebo, inatnga. Na Jisas God Kere Yugwa yagl, dumo Nasaret nem moglkwa i, ye dra idre, ene yegl di teiga, Ene adigl, konbauna ede po! dugwa..<figure style="fig" alt="Peter, John and lame man in front of temple" file="FM 199 Peter Heals the Lame Man_6inches_BW.jpg" size="col" loc="3.6" copy="Foundation Matters" ref="3.6" /> <verse eid="ACT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7" />Pita ka yegl didre, ye yagl ikra ogo wo kra ake aduglko, yagl i tabre kaima kagle u wakai ogwa.<verse eid="ACT 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8" />Yagl kagle mawa sugwa i kagle u wakai ogo, ye tabre puglo di adiglsre, konbauna ede ogwa. Konbauna ede ogo, ye Pita ya Jon bogl akie ede pi tawa teigwa yugu yomara togl suna eigwa. Ye togl suna i, ede eigo, yagl ikra ye konbauna pidre, puglo di, God kagie kade te, ede ogwa. <verse eid="ACT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9" />Ana yagl i yegl eruko, yoba mudu togl suna meglkwa i, yagl i konbauna pi God kagie kade te, ede ogo, kanigwa. <verse eid="ACT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10" />Yoba mudu yagl i kandre, kinano gudu, yegl di prikwa, Yagl i okna Togl Dra Wakai we dimara iro ege ege bina ame di moglsre, yoba mige naraiglmedi yana di moglko, kamgra we di prikwa. Yoba mudu yegl prisre, ye yagl i kagle erme u wakai ogo, kandre, wai kugl, nagino podo kide keglkwa.<verse eid="ACT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pita tawa teigwa yugu yomara yoba Jisas kamo di togwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11" />Ana togl suna i, yugu teka ta si yeigwa. Yugu teka i, kagie Solomon Yugumo Teka we digwa. Ana Pita ya Jon yugu teka i mina adigl miurko, yagl kagle u wakai ogwa ikra ye gun yedre, ye kugro, di wakai yei togwa. Yegl eruko, yoba mudu nagino podo koglsre, ye muku di ede pi yagl ikra Pita ya Jon bogl meglmara eigwa.<verse eid="ACT 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12" />Yoba mudu muku di ede eigo, Pita yoba i muku di wigwa i kandre, ye yoba mudu i di te, yegl dugwa, Israel yoba, ene siragl pre nagino koglsre, no toro kan meglme? dugwa. Ene prikwa, no yagl suo i, no yobro podo paugo, no mabuno wakai keme buglka pre yagl i ere wakai ere tebredi primo? dugwa. Yegl ta manugwa, ba God kogonmo yagl Jisas ye ere wakai ere tomiwe dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13" />Yegl didre, ye ama yegl dugwa, God, ye Abraham ya Aisak ya Jekop Godno moglsre, te, nono kowano awano mudu Godno moglkwa i, ye kogonmo yagl Jisas i, ye kagie kade tome dugwa. Ene ere mogl, yagl Jisas i, i pi Rom yoba meglmara ye si goraiglmedi ogono mina yeigo, yagl Pailat ye Jisas kotmo prisre, Jisas kane yugu i meda edenagledi prukwa. Ye i meda edenagledi prukwa ba ene ere mogl, Jisas mokono tedre, mane dimiwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14" />God ere mogl, yagl Jisas i, ye kogonmo erabedi kere i pere edugo, yagl Jisas i mabuno wakai ya du keme erukwa ba ene ye mokono tedre, yagl Pailat ye Jisas i meda edekrabedi mane didre, yagl ta yoba si goglkwa pre si kane sigwa i, i meda ede noro digwa. <verse eid="ACT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15" />Yegl didre, ene Jisas, ye kor munga norukwa i, si geglme dugwa. Si geglkwa ba God ye ere i kor edugo, ye adigl u kor ogwa pre no kandre, ene di tobuluwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16" />Yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Ene yagl magigl kagle u wakai ogo, ene kan pogl sigwa i, Jisas yene yagl i kagle ere wakai ere te kodume dugwa. Jisas ye kagle ere wakai ere togwa i, no Jisas pre meduglka pre ye ene gumanomugl kimagl podo ere, ye ere wakai ere togo, ene kanimiwe di, Pita yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17" />Ana Pita ka yegl di kodidre, ye ka ta yegl dugwa, Na agrama wagle, ene yaglno kade bogl Jisas si geglkwa i, ene siragl erikwa pre pogl sikrikwa pre ye si geglkwa i, na priwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18" />Ene siragl erikwa pre pogl sikre, Jisas si geglkwa ba God ye Jisas gorabedi kanige erukwa. Ye siragl pre kanige erukwa i, ye okna ibo kamo kep erikwa yoba mudu di te, God Kere Yugwa Yagl giugl pre, gorabuka pre di togo, ye bogl atne edigwa, ka i pai inabuka pre God ye ene Jisas si geglkwa i kanige erumiwe dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19" />Yegl erukwa pre ene nomane kor idre, Jisas no Ere Yugwa Yagle moglmedi pre medilo! dugwa. Ene yegl eribi, God ye ene tadaglmeno gugl ede tenabuka. <verse eid="ACT 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20" />Gugl ede tenan, ye ene bogl akie meglbi, kamin wakai tage ene meglmara tenabiwe dugwa. Kamun wakai tage tenan, Jisas, God no ere inabedi Kere Yugwa Yagl i, dedenan, unabuka. <verse eid="ACT 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21" />Jisas heven ibo kan moran, God taragl mudu ere i kor edenabuka ege i unan, Jisas unabuka keme paugwa. God ege i pre okna kaima ibo yene kamo kep yoba di togo, bogl atne edigwa, pamiwe di, Pita yegl dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22" />Pita ka yegl di kodidre, ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Moses okna ibo ye God Kere Yugwa Yagl unabuka i pre ka yegl bogl atne edugwa, Yagl Kade God ere mogl, Yagl ta dedenan, ye nono yugobunono i mina u, ene moraiglmara unabuka. Ye udre, na ka kep yoba moglmere yegl mere morabuka. Ka Kep Yagl i ene moraiglmara u plau didre, ye ka siragl mere ene ta di tenabuka i, ene wakai ere pre, duglo boraiglkwa paugwa. <verse eid="ACT 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23" />Duglo boraiglkwa paugwa ba yoba ta ere mogl, Ka Kep Yagl i ye kamo ta prikran, God yobama moraiglmara suna i ta moglkrabuka. God ye ere kide kaima ere tenabiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lo 18.15-19</char></note> di, Moses okna ibo Jisas pre ka yegl boglme di, Pita ka yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24" />Pita ka yegl didre, ye ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Taragl plau dugo, nono erme mogl, kamga i, God ka kep yobamo Samuel ya te, tau Samuel mokomugl wigwa i, ege erme plau dugo, kamga i pre ye mudu ama okna ibo ka bogl atne edime dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25" />God kamo kep yoba ka digwa ya te, God okna ibo ka kaima ta Abraham di te paduglkwa i, ene meglmara erme magigl i plau dugwa. God okna ibo Abraham di te padigl, yegl dugwa, Yoba yugobuno pere pere moglsre, uglo koglo koglo moraiglkwa i, na ene gawan ta morabuka i, ye mina na yoba mudu ere wakai ere tenaluwe di, God yegl dume di,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Oknayene Ibo 22.18, 26.4</char></note> Pita yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26" />Ana God ye Kogonmo Yagl Jisas dedugwa i, ye ene Israel yoba meglkwa i komono kana ere wakai ere tedre, yugobuno pere pere meglkwa i ama ere wakai ere tenabedi dedugwa. Ye ene ere wakai ere tenabuka pre diga i, God ene nomane kor tenan, ene mabuno kide erimara nomane kor inaiglkwa pre diwe di, yoba mudu makai si meglkwa i, Pita yegl di togwa.<verse eid="ACT 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4" />
  <para style="s">Pita ya Jon si kane sigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1" />Ana yagl suo Pita ya Jon ye yoba ka di te pai miurko, tawa teigwa yoba ya Sadyusi yoba yeigo, te yagl swara ta ye soldia tau tawa teigwa yugu sugl meglkwa bitno moglkwa i yogo, ye u, Pita ya Jon ka di miurara i, wigwa. <verse eid="ACT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2" />Pita ya Jon ye yoba ka beke te, yegl dibrika, Jisas goglsre, adigl u kor omere mere yegl, nono ama adigl u kor enamniwe di, ka yegl beke tebrika. Ka yegl beke tebrika pre yoba ikra kide kaima pre, ye miurara wigwa. <verse eid="ACT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3" />Ye miurara udre, ye Pita ya Jon i pi kot ere tenamnedi si kane sigwa. Ye kot ere tenamnedi si kane sigwa ba min pai kodugwa pre ye padre, tagna kot ere tenamnedi Pita ya Jon i pi kane yugu edigo, pabrika. <verse eid="ACT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4" />Yegl erikwa ba yoba mere kide pre mediglkwa. Yagl kerikwa i, 5,000 mere yegl meglkwa.<verse eid="ACT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaunsil ere mogl, Pita ya Jon kot ere teigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Peter and John before the Sanhedrin" file="CN01912B.TIF" size="col" copy="David C Cook" ref="4.5" />Ana tagugo i, Israel yoba bitno wagle ya yobano kade wagle yeigo, te God lomo beke teigwa yoba yeigo, akie Jerusalem suna i Pita ya Jon kotno pramnedi makai sigwa. <verse eid="ACT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6" />Ye suna makai si meglmara i, yagl ta kagie Anas we digwa i, ye tawa teigwa yoba bitno moglkwa, yagl i yogo, yagl ta Kaiafas we digwa ya Jon ya te Aleksander yeigo, te, Anas nem agiglema ta meglkwa i, mudu ama makai si meglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7" />Kaunsil mudu makai si meglko, yoba tau ere mogl, Pita ya Jon ya te, yagl kagle mawa sugwa ere wakai eribrika ikra agre i ede suna u yagl kade wagle i meglmara suna edigwa. Edigo, Kaunsil wagle ere mogl, Pita ya Jon yegl di prikwa, Ene ira yobuglo tedre, Kogon yegl eriro dugo, ene kogon yegl ere, yagl kagle mawa sugwa i ere wakai ere tebre? di, yegl di prikwa.<verse eid="ACT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8" />Ana yagl kade wagle ikra yegl kira pogl priko, God Murubuglo Pita moglmara si kau si togo, Pita ere mogl, ka yegl dugwa, Yagl kade wagle, ya ene Israel yoba bitno meglkwa i, <verse eid="ACT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9" />no yagl kagle mawa sugwa ake ple di tobuglka i pre ene kot ere norimo? dugwa. Ene yagl i siragl mere u kor ogwa i pramnedi pribi, <verse eid="ACT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10" />na ene di tenagle dugwa. Na ene di tebo, ene ya Israel yoba mudu pre pogl sinaiglmiwe dugwa. Jisas, God Kere Yugwa Yagl, ye dumo Nasaret nem moglkwa i, ye yene yobuglo mina yagl i kagle ere wakai eruko, ye erme ede u ene gumanomugl adigl moglmiwe dugwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 4:10">Pita ka yegl didre, ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Jisas i, ene ede prak mina si geglkwa ba God ye ere i kor edugwa. <verse eid="ACT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11" />God kamo mina ka ebrie ta dugwa i, yegl paugwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:11">Kobuglo yugu keigwa yoba i, ye kobuglo swara ta kide yomedi kandre, kide kodigwa. Kide kodigwa ba God yugu ta kenagledi kobuglo kide yomedi kide kodigwa i idre, kobuglo yugu guglo bogl, kei ede mina enabara mabunomugl mabuno bogl paduglme<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 118.22</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 4:11">di, God kamo yegl dume dugwa. God kamo ka ebrie ta yegl dugwa i siragl pre God ye Jisas swara dedugwa ba ene Israel bitno yoba Jisas kide kandre, mokono teigwa pre ka ebrie yegl dume dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12" />Ana yagl Jisas i, ye swara nono ere inabuka kuno kaima erukwa. God ye Jisas swara nono ere inabedi dedugwa pre uglo koglo koglo dumo aglo mere yogwa i, nono ere inabuka yoba pere ta moglkrikwa. Jisas swara kaima moglmiwe di, Pita yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13" />Ana Pita ka yegl di kodugo, yagl kade wagle makai si meglkwa ikra nagino kogl, kinano gudu meglkwa. I siragl pre ye kanigwa i, Pita ya Jon sule kade ta dikribrika. Yagl yoko miurka ba ye ka dibrika i, kudugl goglkre, ka dibriko, kanigwa. Ye yegl kandre, ye prikwa i, Yagl suo i Jisas bogl akie wan meglkwa pamiwedi prikwa. <verse eid="ACT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14" />Te, yagl ta kagle u wakai ogwa ikra ye gumanomugl adigl moglko, kanigwa pre ye ka di ikne edenaiglkwa ta paikrukwa.<verse eid="ACT 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15" />Ana yagl kade wagle i ka di ikne edenaiglkwa ta paikrukwa pre ye ere mogl, Pita ya Jon kaunsil makai simara i kide kodo, pi meda morabredi dedigo, ede pi meda miurka. Meda miurko, Kaunsil yene di ikne ikne ede, <verse eid="ACT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16" />yegl digwa, Yagl suo i, nono siragl ere tenamne? digwa. Ye kimagl podo ta eribrika i, yoba mudu Jerusalem kipai meglkwa i, pre kan ere kodigwa. Yegl pre nono ere mogl, Ta erekribre di, yegl dinamga ta kuno erekrukwa. <verse eid="ACT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17" />Yegl dinamga ta kuno erekrukwa ba ye yoba ka di tebrika i, ka i wai dinan yoba mere pre dinaiglmedi, nono yagl suo i ere mogl, yagl Jisas kamo i, yoba di tekrabredi ka giglede di tedre, mane dinamniwe digwa. <verse eid="ACT 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18" />Yegl didre, Pita ya Jon aglke kor agle digo, ubrika. Ubriko, yagl kade wagle i ye ka giglede di te, yegl digwa, Ene Jisas kamo i yoba swara ta di tekriro di, yegl digwa.<verse eid="ACT 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19" />Ana Kaunsil wagle i ka yegl digwa ba Pita ya Jon ere mogl, ka di ikne ede te, yegl dibrika, Enene pre yubu sinaiglkwa paugwa. No ene kano duglo borabuglka i, God gumuglo mina kuno erabo mo God kamo duglo borabuglka kuno erabe? di, yegl dibrika. <verse eid="ACT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20" />Jisas kogon siragl mere erukwa ya ka siragl mere dugo, no pre kan erubuglka i, di nogugl edenabuglka keme paugwa. No ka i ta kide kodokrabuglka. Di pai morabuglka keme pamiwe di, yegl dibrika.<verse eid="ACT 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21" />Ana Pita ya Jon ka yegl dibriko, yagl kade wagle ikra, ye ka giglede tau di tedre, okuo ye di meda edigwa. I siragl pre God yagl kagle mawa sugwa ikra ere wakai ere togo, yoba mere kide pre kan ersre, God kagie kade teigwa pre yagl kade wagle i yoba kuduglno goglsre, Pita ya Jon ere sinamga i, yoba kide praiglkwa pre kuno erekrumedi kandre, di meda edigwa. <verse eid="ACT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22" />Yagl ta kagle mawa sugo, God ye ere wakai ere togwa i, ye mam kugl meda edumara kagle mawa sugwa pre ye bugla yugu 40 ne ede mitna ogwa. Bugla yugu 40 mere yegl ne ede mitna ogo, God ye kagle ere wakai ere togwa pre yoba kandre, God kagie kade teigwa.<verse eid="ACT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pre mediglkwa yoba kamage erikwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23" />Ana yagl kade wagle ikra ere mogl, Pita ya Jon ye di meda edigo, ye ede ikne pi Jisas pre mediglkwa yoba meglmara ebrika. Ye pidre, yagl kade wagle ya tawa teigwa yoba bitno meglkwa ikra, ye Jisas kamo dikriro didre, ka giglede di teimere i pi boglo si tebrika. <verse eid="ACT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24" />Boglo si tebriko, yoba Jisas pre mediglkwa mudu makai si meglkwa ikra prisre, ye deno muduno swara yei, God kamage ere te, yegl digwa, Yagl Kade God yo, ene kamun mitna ibo ya dumo makan ya te, mudi nigl ere yedre, te taragl mudu kamun mitna ya dumo makan ya mudi nigl mina meglkwa ya paigwa i, ene ere yeniwe digwa.<verse eid="ACT 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25" />Yegl didre, ama kamage ere, yegl digwa, God, ene Mudu Murubuglo mina ene no kowano awano Devit, ene nigl kogenen yoba moglkwa i, ka di tengo, ye yegl boglkwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">Yoba tau Israel yoba moglkrikwa ba yugobuno pere pere meglkwa i,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">ye deno kubro God Kere Yugwa Yagl teigwa ba i ta kuno erekrabiwe di, yegl boglkwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">Te, Israel yoba ama ere mogl, mabuno paikrumara ersre,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">God Kere Yugwa Yagl mabuno kide ere tenamnedi ka di kogl yeigwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">ba i ama ta kuno erekrabiwe di, Devit yegl boglme digwa.<verse eid="ACT 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26" />Yoba yugobuno pere pere kingno ya yoba kade tau bitno meglkwa i ere mogl,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:26">Yagl Kade God ya te, ye Kere Yugwa Yagl kuda bogl tenamnedi makai sigwa pre diwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 2.1-2</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 4:26">di, Devit yegl boglme digwa.<verse eid="ACT 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27" />Ye kamage ere yegl didre, kamage ere ama yegl digwa, Devit ka yegl boglkwa i, ka kaima erme magigl i plau dumiwe digwa. Dumo Jerusalem suna magigl i, King Herot ya te Pontius Pailat yebriko, yoba tau Israel yoba moglkrikwa i ya te, Israel yoba ama yeigo, ye mudu u swara pidre, ene Wan Jisas, ene kere i pere edinga i, si goramnedi ka di keglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28" />Yegl erikwa ba God ene yobugln podo paugo, taragl okuo Jisas mina plau dinabuka i enene komnai di padiglnga. Enene komanai di padiglnga pre Jisas kudamo ikne ka di kogl yedre, Jisas si geglkwa i, ene ka di padiglnara kuno yegl keme ere kodime di, yegl digwa.<verse eid="ACT 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29" />Yegl didre, ama yegl digwa, Yagl Kade yo, erme yoba no ere sinamniwe digwa i, ene pitnga. Yegl pre ene yobuglo bogl notn, no ene nigl kogonen yoba munga i, kudugl goglkre, ene kanen i, yoba di tenamniwe digwa. <verse eid="ACT 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30" />Te, ene ama yobuglo bogl notn, no ene Wan Jisas, ene kere i pere edinga i, ye kagie mina yoba kide sigwa ere wakai ere tedre, te kimagl ya diu kane kane eramniwe di, kamage yegl erikwa.<verse eid="ACT 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31" />Ana Jisas pre mediglkwa yoba i kamage yegl ere kodigo, God ye yugu ta makai si meglmara i piga dinabedi eruko, piga dugwa. Piga dugo, God Murubuglo ye mudu meglmara si kau si togo, ye kudugl goglkre, God kamo yoba di te pai meglkwa.<verse eid="ACT 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pre mediglkwa yoba ake ple di ikne ikne edigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32" />Jisas pre mediglkwa yoba mudu ye deno muduno swara yei, wakai meglkwa. Ye taragl ere neigwa i, Na nana pre yome dikre, no pre medunga yoba mudu pre yomedi kandre, ye ake ple di ikne ikne edigwa. <verse eid="ACT 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33" />Jisas pre mediglkwa yoba mudu yegl ere meglko, te Jisas dedugwa yoba meglkwa i, ye yoba ka giglede di tedre, Jisas adigl u kor ogwa i, di te meglkwa. Yegl erikwa pre yoba ye mudu wakai kanigwa. <verse eid="ACT 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34" />Te, Jisas pre mediglkwa yoba meglmara suna i, yoba swara ta goduglme moglkrukwa. I siragl pre ye tau yuguno ya dumo makano i tau topo boglsre, mige moni idre, i pi <verse eid="ACT 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35" />Jisas dedugwa yoba ikra teigo, ye i pi yoba ta tenaiglkwa pamere yegl mere kandre, yubu si yoba teigwa.<verse eid="ACT 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36" />Ana pre mediglkwa yoba meglmara suna i, yagl swara ta moglkwa, kagie Josep we digwa. Ana Jisas dedugwa yoba, ye ere mogl, yagl Josep i kagie kor ta yei te, Barnabas we digwa. Kagie Barnabas i, mabuno paugwa, yoba deno muduno mina si gigle di togwa yagle moglkwa. Yagl Barnabas i, yugobuno Livai mina moglsre, dumo ta mudi nigl suna yogwa, kagie Saiprus we digwa i, nem ta moglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37" />Aglke ta Barnabas i ye makanmo ta topo boglsre, migemo yubu si yoba tenaiglmedi i pi Jisas dedugwa yoba meglmara togwa.<verse eid="ACT 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5" />
  <para style="s">Ananaias ya Safaira God bakagl tenabugledi eribrika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Peter talking to Ananias" file="cn01905B.tif" size="col" copy="David C Cook" ref="5.1" />Ana yagl ta moglkwa, kagie Ananaias we digwa. Te, ye ebie kagie Safaira we digwa. Yagl abu suo i ere mogl, ye makano ta topo bogl ibrika. <verse eid="ACT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2" />Top bogl ibriko, Ananaias mige ikne yene pre i atne ede, ikne yogwa i pi Jisas dedugwa yoba meglmara pidre, makan topo bogl imere mudu yomiwedi togwa. Ye yegl erukwa i, ye ebie kidagl ama pre kan erukwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3" />Ana ye mige ikne i pi Jisas dedugwa yoba meglmara togo, Pita ere mogl, ye yegl di togwa, Ananaias yo, ene siragl pre mabuno yegl etne? dugwa. Satan ene nomane giglede togo, ene God Murubuglo ye no munara suna moglkwa i bakagl tenagledi etniwe dugwa. Ene makanen topo boglsre, mige ikne ake atne ede, ikne keme yudre, mige mudu imere yomiwedi notnga i pre na diwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4" />Ene makanen i ta topo boglkitnga igne, makan i, enene pre yogwa. Te, ene topo bogl inga i, ene mige idre, kogon enene pitnere eratnga i, wakai paugwa. Yegl paugwa ba siragl pre ene nomanen mina mabuno kide yegl eragledi pitne? dugwa. Ene yoba keme ka kibi di teie di prikratnga. Ba ene God ama ka kibi te teniwe di, Pita yegl dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5" />Ana Pita ka yegl dugo, yagl Ananaias i pre moglsre, yage makandigle sidre, goglkwa. Yegl erukwa pre yoba mudu ka i digo, prikwa i, kudugl podo geglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6" />Ana Ananaias goglko, kumugl gak tau udre, ye ogo gagie lap mina were, boglo ere i pi maugl sigwa.<verse eid="ACT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7" />Ana yagl Ananaias ikra goglko, i pi maugl sigo, ade kwia suota mere yegl ede ogo, Ananaias ebie kidagl ikra ede u Pita yugugl moglmara ugwa. Ye wie goglkwa i ta digo, prikrukwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8" />Ana Ananaias ebie ikra ede u Pita moglmara ugo, Pita ere mogl, Ananaias ebie di pre, yegl dugwa, Ene win kidagl bogl makano topo biurka i, ene mige moni ibrika i, yegl ibro? dugwa. Yegl dugo, abu i di ikne ede, No kaima, makano topo bogl, kuno yegl yubuluwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9" />Yegl dugo, Pita ye di pre, yegl dugwa, Siragl eruko, ene win bogl Yagl Kade Murubuglomo ta pre kan erekrukwa mere yegl pre, ere kanabugledi ka di kogl, yegl eribre? dugwa. Pro! Kumugl gak tau ene win kidagl i pi maugl sigwa i, yugu dua wagle ede magigl u kodigwa. Ene ama akie i pi maugl sinaiglmiwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10" />Pita ka yegl di kodugo, abu ikra tabre kana yage makandigle sidre, goglkwa. Yegl ere, goglko, kumugl gak ikra ede yugugl udre, abu i makandigle gogl pai moglko, kanigwa. Kandre, ye ama boglo ere i pi, wie kidagl maugl simara magigl i ama akie maugl sigwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11" />Yegl eriko, ana yoba mudu Jisas yugobunomo mina meglkwa i, ye taragl plau dugwa i prisre, kudugl podo geglkwa. Te, yoba meda ama yagl abu suo kano digo, prikwa i, ama mudu kudugl podo geglkwa.<verse eid="ACT 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas dedugwa yoba i, kimagl kane kane erikwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12" />Ana igne i Jisas dedugwa yoba ye ere mogl, kimagl ya diu mere kide yoba gumuglnomugl erikwa. Te, Jisas pre mediglkwa yoba mudu i, ye ege mere tawa teigwa yugu yomara togl suna pidre, yugu teka ta Solomon yugumo teka we digwa togl suna yomara i, akie makai sigwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13" />Ana yoba tau pre mediglkrikwa ye Jisas pre mediglkwa yoba kanigwa i, yoba wakai ta meglmedi kanigwa, ba ye pre mediglkwa yoba i bogl akie makai sinaiglkwa i, kudugl geglkwa pre ye meglmara i suna moglkre, kudugl gogl, meda meglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14" />Meda meglkwa ba yoba tau mere kide kaima ama yagl ya abu akie, Yagl Kade pre mediglko, God ye Jisas pre mediglkwa yoba meglmara i, i suna edugo, akie meglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15" />Te, Jisas dedugwa yoba i kimagl mere kide erikwa pre yoba tau kide sigwa i, ye boglno mina ya kuguglno mina ki ede, boglo ere i pi konbauna bina edigwa. Edidre, ye ta prikwa i, Pita wonabara i, kiamo yoba kide sigwa i bre eran, ye kideno aragan erabedi prisre, yegl erikwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16" />Yegl eriko, yoba tau taun pere pere Jerusalem yomara magigl kipai meglkwa i ama ere mogl, yoba kide sigwa ya murubuglo kide ye meglmara suna mogl, ye ere kide ere teigwa i, ye mudu agre i ede u Jisas dedugwa yoba meglmara i yudre, makai sigwa. Yu makai sigo, yoba kide sigwa ya murubuglo kide ye meglmara suna meglkwa i, mudu ye ere wakai ere te kodigwa.<verse eid="ACT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas dedugwa yoba kane yugu paimara angelo ta u, i meda edugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17" />Ana Jisas dedugwa yoba i, taragl tau mere yegl ere meglkwa pre tawa teigwa yoba bitno moglkwa i yogo, te, yoba tau ye kogon akie erikwa, Sadyusi yoba meglkwa i, ye deno muduno u kide kaima ogwa. Ye deno muduno u kide kaima ogo, ye ere mogl, <verse eid="ACT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18" />Jisas dedugwa yoba i, ye si kane sigwa. Si kane si i pi kane yugu kunogl gogl yoba si kane sigo, paimara dumo i edigwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19" />Kane yugu i edigwa pai meglkwa ba eduer suna, Yagl Kade angelomo ta u kane yugu dua yauro ede, Jisas dedugwa yoba ikra agre i ede meda pidre, yegl di togwa, <verse eid="ACT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20" />Ene ede ikne pi tawa teigwa yugu yomara togl suna pidre, God kamo yoba aimadi kor moraiglkwa pre dugwa i, mudu yoba di te pai molo dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21" />Yegl dugo, ye prisre, tagna kide kana ye ede pi tawa teigwa yugu yomara togl suna pidre, yoba God kamo di teigwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:21">Ana tawa teigwa yoba bitno moglkwa i ya yoba ye akie kogon erikwa ikra, ye ere mogl, Kaunsil mudu yagl kade mogl, ye Israel yoba sugl meglkwa i, Jisas dedugwa yoba kot ere tenamnedi di makai sigo, wigwa. Wigo, ye soldia tau Jisas dedugwa yoba agre yunaiglmedi dedigwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22" />Dedigo, ye eigwa ba ye ede kane yugu eigo, Jisas dedugwa yoba ikra moglkrikwa. Moglkriko, ye kandre, aglke ede ikne u yagl kade wagle ikra makai si meglmara udre, <verse eid="ACT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23" />yegl di teigwa, No pi kane yugu kamga i, kane yugu dua lok giglede simere i pai moglko, te kane yugu dua wagle sugl meglkwa yagl i, adigl meglko, kamga. Kandre, no dua yauro, ede yugugl pi kamga i, yagl wagle ikra yugugl pai moglkrimiwe di, yegl digwa.<verse eid="ACT 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24" />Ana soldia i ka yegl di kodigo, yagl ta soldia tau tawa teigwa yugu sugl meglkwa bitno moglkwa ikra ya tawa teigwa yoba kade meglkwa i, ye kinano gudu pre, Ana erme siragl taragl plau dinabe? di, yegl digwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25" />Yegl digo, yoba ta udre, ye yegl di togwa, Ene yagl tau ye si kane sigwa ikra we, ye ede pi tawa teigwa yugu yomara togl suna mogl, yoba ka mabuno beke te meglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26" />Yegl dugwa pre yagl ta soldia tau tawa teigwa yugu sugl meglkwa bitno moglkwa ikra, ye soldiamo bogl pidre, Jisas dedugwa yoba ikra agre yuigwa. Ye pi agre i ede ikne wigwa, ba ye ta ere sikrikwa. Siragl pre yoba mere kide kan meglkwa pre ye prikwa i, No yagl wagle i ere sumun, yoba kan meglkwa i, no kobuglo no si, no si goraiglmedi kuduglno gogl, yoko agre i ede ikne wigwa.<verse eid="ACT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas dedugwa yoba kudugl goglkre, Kaunsil ka di teigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27" />Ana soldia wagle ikra ye Jisas dedugwa yoba agre i ede u Kaunsil makai si meglmara suna edigwa. Edigo, tawa teigwa yoba bitno moglkwa i ere mogl, ye di te, yegl dugwa, <verse eid="ACT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28" />Okna no ene ka giglede di te, yagl i kamo ene yoba di tekrio di, mane dumga. Yegl dumga ba ene Jerusalem yoba mudu aimadi di te meglkwa. Ene yegl erikwa i, yagl goglkwa i, no ka inamga mere yegl ene erimiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29" />Ana tawa teigwa yoba bitno moglkwa i yegl dugwa ba Pita ya Jisas dedugwa yoba i, ye mudu ere mogl, di ikne ede te, yegl digwa, No God kamo sedidre, yoba kano duglo boramga i, kuno erekrukwa. No God swara kamo duglo boramga pamiwe digwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30" />Ene Jisas ede prak mina si geglkwa ba nono kowano awano Godno i, ye ere i kor edumiwe digwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31" />God ye yagl Jisas swara i agre i ede heven ibo pidre, ye ogo wo kra ame dinabedi kagie kade tedre, ye yoba bitno moglsre, Ere Yugwa yagl morabedi erukwa. Ye yegl erukwa i siragl pre Israel yoba nomane kor ibi, ye tadeglmeno gugl edenabuka pre erumiwe digwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32" />Jisas ye adigl u kor ogwa kamo i, no yoba di tomgo, Mudu Murubuglo ama yoba koglo di te moglkwa. Mudu Murubuglo pre dumga i, ene Israel bitno yoba God kamo sedigwa pre Mudu Murubuglo ikrikwa. Ene ikrikwa ba yoba ye God kamo sedekre, ye dumere erikwa i, God ye Murubuglo tomiwe di, Jisas dedugwa yoba i yegl digwa.<verse eid="ACT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gamaliel ere mogl, Kaunsil di te, Yagl i si goglkrio dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33" />Ana Jisas dedugwa yoba i ka yegl di kodigo, Kaunsil ye kano prisre, Jisas dedugwa yoba ikra deno podo kubro tedre, si goramnedi prikwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34" />Yegl prikwa ba Farisi yagl ta moglkwa, kagie Gamaliel we digwa i, ye Kaunsil wagle ka ta di tenagledi ye meglmara suna adigl mogl, soldia tau di togo, ye Jisas dedugwa yoba i agre i ede meda eigo, kuri ta meda sugl meglkwa. Yagl Gamaliel i, God lomo beke togwa yagl ta moglko, Juda yoba mudu ye yagl wakai ta moglmedi kanigwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35" />Ana soldia tau Jisas dedugwa yoba i agre i ede meda eigo, Gamaliel ere mogl, Kaunsil wagle mudu di te, yegl dugwa, Na agrama, ene Israel yoba meglkwa i, ene Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl i ere kide ere tenamnedi prikwa ba ene kan kun erio! dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36" />Bugla yugu suom ta ede ogwa ibor, nono kamga. Yagl ta kagie Teudas we digwa, ye Yagl kade mole dugo, yagl 400 mere yegl ye duglo beglkwa. Duglo boglsre, Rom yoba kuda bogl tenamnedi erikwa i, nono pre kan erumga. Yegl erikwa ba Rom yoba ere mogl, yagl i si geglko, ye duglo beglkwa yagl i mudu teke ede pere pere pidre, kide kodigwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37" />Ana Rom yoba yagl i si geglko, mokomugl i, yagl ta kagie Judas, Galili nem ikra ama ere mogl, Rom gavman ye nono yoba mudu kagno eratne dugwa igne i Rom yoba kuda bogl tenagledi erukwa. Yegl ersre, yoba tau ye kinano sugo, ye duglo beglkwa ba Rom yoba ere mogl, yagl i ama si geglko, ye duglo beglkwa yoba i ama ede pere pere eigwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38" />Yegl pre na ene erme di teiga, Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl i, kanige ersre, ye i meda edio! dugwa. Yagl wagle i ye yene nomano primere ka di kogl, kogon eribi, kogono i u wakai ta pikrabiwa. Dudunabuka. <verse eid="ACT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39" />Ba God ta dedenan, eribi, ene ye kogono i si kegl dinamnedi eribi, ta kuno erekrabuka. Te, ene si kegl dinamnedi eraiglkwa, ba aglau eran, ene God kuda bogl teigwa mere yegl panabiwa. Kide kodio! di, Gamaliel yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 5:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40" />Ana yagl Gamaliel ka yegl dugwa pre Kaunsil wagle ere mogl, ye kamo prisre, Jisas dedugwa yoba i si goglkrikwa. Ye si goglkrikwa ba yoba ta ye agre yunabedi dedigo, ye pi agre yugo, Kaunsil ere mogl, ye di tedre, yegl digwa, Ene Jisas kamo i, yoba ta di tekrio! digwa. Ka yegl didre, ye duglnai ere sidre, i meda edigwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41" />Ye i meda edigo, Jisas dedugwa yoba i gun yeigwa. Ye prikwa i, Nono Jisas duglo bunga pre yubun yumga i, God nono kogon wakai yegl eraiglmedi kere yugwa pre yubun yumnedi prisre, gun yei, Kaunsil meglmara kide kodo, ede eigwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42" />Ana ye ere mogl, ege ege tawa teigwa yugu yomara togl suna i ya yoba kipaimara i, yoba aimadi God kamo beke te, Jisas ye God Kere Yugwa yagl moglmiwe digwa.<verse eid="ACT 5:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6" />
  <para style="s">Jisas pre mediglkwa yoba ere mogl, yagl 7-pela Jisas dedugwa yoba ake ple dinaiglmedi kere igwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1" />Ana igne i yoba kor tau mere Jisas pre mediglko, Jisas gagiglma i, u mere kide eigwa. U mere kide pi meglko, kigl nonga ta ye meglmara suna i plau dugwa. Kigl nonga ta plau dugwa i, yegl mere paugwa, Jisas pre mediglkwa yoba i, tau yene Israel yoba kano pamere ka Aram digo, tau ka Grik digwa. Ana tau ka Grik digwa i ye ere mogl, kide prisre, yoba ka Aram digwa i ka te, yegl digwa, Ene ege ege kaya mokna yubu si, abu werai teigwa i, abu werai ka Grik digwa i, ene kaya mokna mere tekre, abu werai ka Aram digwa i keme kaya mokna mere temiwe di, yegl digwa. <verse eid="ACT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2" />Yegl digwa pre Jisas dedugwa yoba 12-pela i ye ere mogl, Jisas gagiglma i mudu agle digo, wigwa. Wigo, ye di te, yegl digwa, No God kamo yoba di tomga i kide kodo, kaya mokna yubu si tenamga i, kuno erekrume digwa. <verse eid="ACT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3" />Yegl pre ene agroma wagle, enene meglmara suna i, yagl 7-pela kere inaiglmiwe digwa. Ene yagl kere inaiglkwa i, yoba ye wakai kanigo, God Murubuglo ye meglmara kau si moglko, ye nomano wakai panabuka yoba i, kere inaiglkwa. Ene yagl 7-pela yegl ta moraiglkwa i kere ibi, ye kaya mokna yubu sinaiglkwa kogon i, no ye ogono mina yenamga. <verse eid="ACT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4" />Yegl ersre, no ege ege kamage ere, God kamo yoba di te moramniwe di, yegl digwa.<verse eid="ACT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5" />Ana Jisas dedugwa yoba i ka yegl digo, yoba mudu ye makai si meglkwa i, wakai prikwa. Wakai prisre, ye dimere yegl ere, yagl 7-pela kere igwa. Ye yagl 7-pela kere imara i, yagl ta kagie Stiven we digwa. Yagl Stiven i, ye God kamo pre meduglkwa gigle dugo, God Murubuglo ye moglmara kau si moglkwa. Te, ye ama Filip ya Prokorus ya Nikanor ya Timon ya Parmenas ya Nikolas kere igwa. Yagl Nikolas i, ye dumo Antiok nem ta moglkwa. Ye Juda yoba ta moglkrukwa, ba okna ye Juda yoba mabunono i duglo boglsre, ye u Juda yoba paugwa. <verse eid="ACT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6" />Ye yagl i kere idre, ye mudu yu Jisas dedugwa yoba meglmara gumanomugl edigo, Jisas dedugwa yoba i ye kamage ere tedre, kogon eraiglkwa i nogugl ede, ogono i pi ye akigwa.<verse eid="ACT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7" />Ana Jisas dedugwa yoba ye yegl ere kodigo, God kamo Jerusalem suna i pare wai dugwa. Pare wai dugo, yoba mere kide Jisas pre medigl, u ye gagiglma meglkwa. Ana yoba Jisas pre mediglkwa i, u mere kide eigo, tawa teigwa yoba i, tau mere kide ama Jisas kamo prisre, pre mediglkwa.<verse eid="ACT 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Juda yoba yagl Stiven kot ere teigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8" />Ana igne i yagl Stiven ikra God ere wakai kaima ere tedre, yobuglo podo togwa. Yobuglo togo, ye kimagl podo yoba gumuglnomugl erukwa. <verse eid="ACT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9" />Yegl erukwa pre Juda yagl tau ye ere mogl, Stiven ka tau dugwa i, ka kibi dumedi ka teigo, ye ka drano digwa. Juda yagl tau ye Stiven ka teigwa i, yene ka mabuno yugu pere ta makai sigwa yagl meglkwa. Yagl i, ye kowano awano okna kane padre, ede meda wigwa pre ye ka mabuno yugu makai simara i, kagie Kane pai, ede meda wigwa yugu we di, yegl digwa. Ana yagl i, ye dumo pere pere nem meglkwa ba mudu Juda yagl meglkwa. Tau dumo Sairini ya Aleksandria nem meglko, tau provins Silisia ya Esia nem meglko, erukwa. <verse eid="ACT 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10" />Yagl i ye Stiven bogl ka drano digwa ba God Murubuglo ere mogl, Stiven nomane togo, ye ka wakai keme dugwa pre yagl i ere mogl, Stiven ka kibi dume dinaiglkwa i, kuno erekrukwa. <verse eid="ACT 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11" />Kuno erekrukwa pre yagl wagle i, ye pi atne teke mogl, yoba tau kinano si, ka kibi dinaiglmedi di teigwa. Ye ka kibi dinaiglmedi di te, ene yegl dinaiglmiwe digwa, Yagl Stiven, ye ka dumara God ya Moses akie kagno ere kide ere togo, prumniwe di, yegl dio digwa. <verse eid="ACT 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12" />Yegl digo, yoba ikra ye dinaiglmedi kinano simere ikra, pi, yoba di te wan meglko, ka i mudu wai dugo, Juda yoba kade meglkwa i ya God lomo beke teigwa yoba ya te, Juda yoba yoko meglkwa i pra, ka i prisre, deno kubro Stiven teigwa. Ye deno kubro tedre, Stiven si kane si yu Kaunsil meglmara edigwa. <verse eid="ACT 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13" />Edidre, yoba tau ka kibi dinaiglmedi beke teigo, di wan meglkwa ikra auro yuigo, ye Kaunsil wagle di te, yegl digwa, Yagl i, ye ege ege ka dumara i, tawa tomga yugu ya God lomo i, di kide keme yei tomiwe digwa. <verse eid="ACT 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14" />Ye ka ta dugo, no prumga i, Jisas, dumo Nasaret nem moglkwa i, tawa tomga yugu si kide ersre, te Moses nono mabuno eraiglmedi di norukwa, mabuno i kide kodo, mabuno kor, pere ta eraiglmedi, Jisas norabiwe di, Stiven yegl dume digwa. <verse eid="ACT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15" />Yegl digo, yoba mudu Kaunsil yuguno yugugl meglkwa i, kan Stiven moglmara edidre, nagino keglkwa. Stiven guma dra angelo guma dra mere yegl pogl di yogwa pre ye toro kan moglsre, nagino keglkwa.<verse eid="ACT 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7" />
  <para style="s">Stiven Kaunsil ka di togwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1" />Ana tawa teigwa yoba bitno moglkwa i ere mogl, Stiven di pre, yegl dugwa, Yagl wagle i ene tawa teigwa yugu ya God lomo di kide yei teniwe digwa i, kaima dimo? dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2" />Yegl di pruko, Stiven di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Nina agrama wagle, ene prio! dugwa. Nono kowano awano Abraham ye terke ede dumo Haran pikre, ye Mesopotemia mogl pai moglkwa igne, God, ye i ta ede moglkwa i, Abraham moglmara plau didre, <verse eid="ACT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3" />yegl di togwa, Ene dumonen i ya yobanma meglkwa i kide kodo, ede dumo kor ta na pogl si, ene i nogugl ede tenaglmara i, po!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Okanayene Ibo 12.1</char></note> di, God yegl di tomiwe di, Stiven yegl dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4" />Ana God yegl dugo, Abraham ye Mesopotemia moglmara, Kaldia yoba dumono i kide kodo, terke ede pi dumo Haran kipai moglkwa. Ye dumo Haran kipai moglko, nem kidagl goglkwa. Goglko, God ye Abraham aglke kor di te, ye terke ede u dumo magigl, nono erme suna kipai munara i, unabedi dedugo, ugwa. <verse eid="ACT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5" />Ye ede magigl i ugwa ba God ere mogl, dumo magigl i swara ta, mo makan bage kebra kide kaima ta Abraham makanmo yenabedi ta tekrukwa. Tekrukwa ba Abraham okna gak kuglkrukwa igne i God ye ka kaima di te padigl, Na dumo makan magigl i, ene ya ene gawanma okuo moraiglkwa i, makano aimadi yenabuka pre tenaluwe di, God yegl di te paduglme di, Stiven yegl dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6" />Te, God ka ta ama Abraham di te, yegl dugwa, Ene gawanma okuo ede kantri ta yoba pere makano mina pi moraiglkwa. Meglbi, makan nem ere mogl, ene gawanma i, ye niglno kogono eraiglmedi si kane sidre, bugla yugu 400 mere yubun te, mabuno kide ere tenaiglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7" />Yegl ere tenaiglkwa ba nana ere mogl, makan nem ye si kane sinaiglkwa i yubun podo tenaluwe dugwa. God yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Mokomugl i, Israel yoba ye dumo i kide kodo, ede meda u dumo magigl igle mogl, na kagna kade naraiglmiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Oknayene Ibo 15.13-14</char></note> dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8" />God ka yegl didre, Abraham ka kaima ta ama di te padigl, yegl dugwa, Ene yobanen yagl ta moraiglkwa i, gagno puduo gagie boraiglmiwe dugwa. Ye dugwa i, ye ka kaima di te paduglkwa i mina atne meglkwa i, i nogugl edinaiglmedi gagno puduo gagie boraiglmedi di togwa. Yegl dugwa pre Abraham okuo Aisak kuglkwa, 8-pela de moglko, Abraham ye gagie puduo gagie bogl togwa. Ana okuo Aisak ere mogl, Jekop kuglko, Jekop ama ere mogl, yagl 12-pela, nono kowano awano ikra, kuglmiwe di, yoba mudu meglkwa i, Stiven yegl di togwa.<verse eid="ACT 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9" />Ana Stiven ka yegl di kodidre, ye ka ta ama yegl di togwa, Nono kowano awano 12-pela Jekop kuglkwa ikra tau ere mogl, ye agro Josep kide kandre, ye ede dumo Isip pi nigl kogon yoba morabedi topo beglkwa. Ye mabuno yegl erikwa ba God ye Josep moglmara mogl tedre, <verse eid="ACT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10" />yoba ye yubun kane kane teigwa i, ere wakai ere togwa. Ye ere wakai ere tedre, ama Isip king gumuglomugl moglkwa igne i ama nomane wakai tedre, Isip king ye wakai kanabedi ere edugwa. Yegl erukwa pre king ere mogl, Josep dumo Isip mudu sugl morabedi dedidre, ye yugumo toglmo ya taraglmo i mudu ama sugl morabedi dedumiwe di, Stiven ka yegl di, yoba mudu meglkwa i togwa.<verse eid="ACT 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11" />Stiven ka yegl didre, ye ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Ana Josep pi Isip moglko, okuo dumo Isip ya Kenan akie kidan podo kide yogwa. Igne i yoba yubun podo kide kaima igo, te nono kowano awano ama kaya mokna wan doko i nenaiglkwa ta yeikrukwa. <verse eid="ACT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12" />Kaya mokna wan doko i nenaiglkwa ta yeikrukwa ba Jekop prukwa i, Isip kugl mogo yome digo, prisre, ye wama tau nono kowano awano ikra dedugo, ye komono kana ta pi topo si idre, ede ikne wigwa. <verse eid="ACT 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13" />Ede ikne u ne meglkwa, dudugo, aglke kor topo sinamnedi ikne eigwa. Ikne pi Isip eigo, Josep ye agro moglkwa i, agiglema kan pogl sinaiglmedi di togwa. Di togo, yoba tau ama ere mogl, Josep agiglema kugl mogo topo sinamnedi wigwa i kandre, pi Isip king di teigo, prukwa. <verse eid="ACT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14" />Te, Josep ama ere mogl, ye nem ya agiglema ya bormai swara meglkwa i mudu yoba 75-pela meglkwa i ede u ye Isip moglmara unaiglmedi dedugo, <verse eid="ACT 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15" />ye nem kidagl Jekop wama bogl mudu ede dumo Isip eigwa. Nono kowano awano i ede dumo Isip pi, kipai moglsre, geglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16" />Geglko, yoba ye i pi dumo ta Sekem we dimara, kobuglo mur ta Abraham okna ibo yagl Hamor wama mige silva tau tedre, topo sumara i, i pi yeimiwe dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17" />Ana okuo God ye ka kaima ta Abraham di te paduglkwa ikra plau dinabuka magigl eruko, Israel yoba ye dumo Isip mogl, u mere kide kaima eigwa. <verse eid="ACT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18" />U mere kide kaima pi meglko, king kor ta dumo Isip sugl moglkwa. King i, Josep okna siragl mere ere, Isip yoba ake ple di togwa i, king i ta pre kan erekrukwa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isip Kide Kodigwa 1.8</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19" />Yegl erukwa pre king i ere mogl, nono kowano awano i ye bakagl te, ere kide ere tedre, ye gak kebra ta kuraiglkwa i, i pi, pia si meda ede, si goraiglmedi, ka giglede yegl dume dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20" />Ana igne i Moses ye nem mam kiurko, ye gak wakai kaima ta moglkwa. Ye gak wakai kaima ta moglkwa pre mogl, nem mam ye yugugl teke padigl, ere kugl miurka. Ere kugl miurka, ba suota ede ogo, <verse eid="ACT 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21" />ye i meda edibrika. I meda edibriko, Isip king abuglo ye u kan idre, yene wam morabedi i pi ere kuglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22" />Ye ere kuglkwa kade moglko, Isip yoba ere mogl, Moses sule di teigo, Moses ye Isip yoba bitno pamere yegl paugo, ye ka giglede didre, kogon kane kane erukwa ama giglede erumiwe di, Stiven yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23" />Stiven ka yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Moses bugla yugu 40 nogwa igne, ye ere mogl, yegl di prukwa, Na nina agrama Israel yoba meglmara i, pi kanaluwe di, nomane mina yegl di prisre, <verse eid="ACT 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24" />ye ede ogwa. Ye pidre, kanugwa i, Isip yagl ta ere mogl, Israel yagl ta ere kide ere te, ye ere sugwa. Ere sugo, Moses ye kandre, Israel yagl i kubun ere idre, Isip yagl ikra ye mabuno kide erumara i, ere ikne ede te, si goglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25" />Si goglsre, ye prukwa i, God na mina Israel yoba ere inabuka i, Israel yoba pre kan eraiglkwa pamiwe di, yegl prukwa. Yegl prukwa ba Israel yoba ye pre kan erekrime dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26" />Ana Moses Isip yagl ikra si goglsre, tagugo i, ye pi kanugwa i, Israel yagl suo yene yene kuda biurko, ye kanugwa. Kandre, ye kubun eragledi ere, yegl dugwa, Yagl suo, ene agigle agigle miurka, siragl pre ene kuda biure? di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27" />Yegl dugwa ba yagl ta ye agigle ere kide ere togwa i, ye Moses ake nu si eglke ede, yegl dugwa, Ene we, ene ira no bitno moglsre, jasno moratnedi dedume? dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28" />Ene eduedi Isip yagl ta si goglnere ikra mere na yegl na si goragledi pitno?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isip Kide Kodigwa 2.14</char></note> dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29" />Yegl dugo, Moses prisre, teke ede pi dumo makan pere ta, Midian we dimara enagledi ede ogwa. Pi dumo i kipai mogl, abu idre, yagl gak suo kuglmiwe di, Stiven yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30" />Ana Stiven yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Moses bugla yugu 40-pela dumo Midian moglsre, aglke ta dumo wau yomara, muglo Sainai we dimara magigl i ta pi wan moglkwa. Wan moglko, angelo ta Moses moglmara doga bauglo mina suna mogl, u ede kebra pamara ta plau di, bauglo ere pai moglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31" />Yegl eruko, Moses ye ede kebra ikra doga dogwa ba de tege erekrumedi kandre, nagie kogl, pi kanagledi ede magigl ogwa. Ye pi kanagledi ede magigl ogo, Yagl Kade ye agle di, yegl di togwa, <verse eid="ACT 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32" />Na ene awanen Abraham ya Aisak ya Jekop i, Godno moluwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isip Kide Kodigwa 3.6</char></note> di, yegl dugwa. Yegl dugo, Moses ogo nagie nuglo didre, God kanabuka kudugl podo gogl, kankrukwa. <verse eid="ACT 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33" />Yegl eruko, Yagl Kade ye di te, yegl dugwa, Ene adigl motnara magigl i, na makanana yei kodugwa pre ene kagln towo gugl edo! dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34" />Na yobanama dumo Isip meglkwa i, Isip yoba ye ere kide ere teigwa i, na kan kuno ersre, te ye gign akin di, ere meglkwa i, ama prika. Prika pre na erme ye ere inagledi ede atne wiwe dugwa. Yegl pre na ene erme dediga i, ene ede Isip enatnga pre dediwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isip Kide Kodigwa 3.5-10</char></note> di, God yegl dume dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35" />Ana Stiven ka yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, God ye yene ere mogl, Moses dede, ye Israel yoba bitno mogl, ye ere inabedi dedidre, te ama angelo ta ege swara ede kebra domara mina Moses moglmara plau dugwa ikra ye Moses ake ple di tenabedi dedugwa. Yegl erukwa ba Israel yoba ye Moses mokono tedre, Ene ira no bitno moglsre, jasno moratnedi dedume? digwa. <verse eid="ACT 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36" />Ana God ye yene Moses dedugo, Moses ere mogl, dumo Isip suna i kimagl ya diu kane kane ersre, Israel yoba agre i ede meda ogwa. Agre i ede meda ogo, mudi nigl Retsi we dimara meglkwa igne i ya dumo wau yomara suna i, bugla yugu 40-pela wan meglkwa igne i, Moses ama kimagl tau mere erumiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37" />Ana Moses yegl ersre, ye ama ere mogl, Israel yoba di te, yegl dugwa, God ere mogl, Yagl swara ta okuo dedenabe dugwa. Yagl i nono yugobunono mina udre, na ka kep yoba moglmere mere yegl morabiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lo 18.15</char></note> di, Moses yegl dume dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38" />Stiven yegl didre, Moses pre ama yegl dugwa, Nono kowano awano Israel yoba i, okna ibo dumo wau yomara wan mogl, makai si meglkwa igne, Moses ye meglmara suna i moglmiwe dugwa. Te, Moses ye ede muglo Sainai kuglo ibo ogwa igne, angelo ta ye ka di togo, Moses ye God kamo aimadi kamin yenabuka i idre, ka kep ere, nono di norukwa, erme yei pai moglmiwe di, Stiven yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39" />Stiven yegl didre, ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Okna Moses kogon yegl erukwa, ba nono kowano awano meglkwa i ye kamo prakiure, ye mokono tedre, deno muduno mina ede ikne Isip kane paimara enamnedi prikwa. <verse eid="ACT 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40" />Yegl prisre, te Moses muglo ibo mogl pai moglkwa igne ye Aron di te, yegl digwa, Moses, dumo Isip kide kodinaiglmedi no agre i ede meda ugwa i, ye erme goglmo mo ede bage ta omo mo i, no pre kan erekune digwa. Yegl pre ene no godno tau beke notn, erme nono enamnara i, ede okna enaiglmiwe digwa. <verse eid="ACT 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41" />Ana igne i nono kowano awano ka yegl didre, ye ere mogl, kau kumugl kulu moglmere kia ta ogono mina bekidre, ye taragl bekigwa i gun yei tedre, tawa gagl teigwa. <verse eid="ACT 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42" />Yegl erikwa pre mogl, God nono kowano awano ikra moko togwa. Moko tedre, ye ade ba ya kugl kuri ki kagno kade tedre, kamage ere tenaiglmedi kanige erukwa. God kamo kep yoba ta buk mina bogl atne edugwa i, ama Israel yoba god kibi kamage ere teigwa i pre yegl dugwa, God ene Israel yoba yegl di tome dugwa, Ene bugla yugu 40-pela dumo wau yomara suna wan mogl, taragl si goglsre, tawa gaiglkwa i, ene na ta gagl narekrikwa. Ene god kibi gagl teigwa. <verse eid="ACT 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43" />Tedre, ene godno kibi Molek ye sel yugumo i boglo ersre, te godno kibi ta Refan kiamo kugl kuri mere yegl ta yogwa i ama boglo ere i ede eigwa. God kibi i, ene ye kagno kade tenamnedi kwiano bekigwa. Yegl pre na ene kudano ikne ene kuda bogl tedre, yobuglo eraiglmedi eribo, ye ene si kane si i pi dumo Babilon i yade, dumo ta eglke yomara i pi edinaiglmiwe di, God ye kamo mina yegl dumiwe di, Stiven yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44" />Stiven ka yegl didre, ka tau ama yegl dugwa, Nono kowano awano dumo wau yomara suna dumo aglo mere ta wan meglkwa i, God lomo kobuglo mina bogl togwa, ye sel yugu mina yugugl yeigwa i, sel yugu i boglo ere idre, wan meglkwa. Ana sel yugu i, siragl mere yenabuka i God ye Moses di togo, siragl mere obuno di tomere i, Israel yoba bekidre, keigwa. <verse eid="ACT 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45" />Ye yegl ersre, boglo ere i wan mogl, geglko, yugobuno okuo wigwa i ama sel yugu i boglo ere igo, Josua bogl akie ede dumo Kenan suna wigwa. Ye ede suna wigo, God ye ede okna pi, nono kawano awano kudano eruko, ye yugobuno pere pere makan nem ta meglkwa i, yobuglo ere tedre, makano igwa. Nono kowano awano dumo Kenan igwa igne ede u King Devit moglkwa igne i tawa teigwa sel yugu i, yei pai moglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46" />Yei pai moglko, King Devit i, God ye wakai kanugo, King Devit ere mogl, nono kowano awano Jekop Godmo i yugu kei tenagledi God di prukwa. <verse eid="ACT 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47" />Di prukwa ba God mane dugwa pre Devit yugu ta kei tekrukwa. Okuo ye wam Solomon ere mogl, tawa teigwa yugu kei tomiwe di, Stiven yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48" />Ana Stiven yegl didre, ama ye kot ere teigwa yoba di te, yegl dugwa, Ene na tawa teigwa yugu di kide yei tene digwa ba ene prio! dugwa. God Mogl Mitna Kaima Edugwa i, ye yoba ta yugu keimara atne kipai moglkrukwa. God kamo kep yoba ta okna ka yegl boglkwa, <verse eid="ACT 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49" />Yagl Kade yegl dume dugwa. Kamun mina ibo i, na ame di moglmara siana king mere yegl yogwa. Te, dumo makan i, na katna bolamugl yeimara mere yegl yogwa. Yegl pre ene yugu siragl mere kei naribi, na yugu i mina yugugl kipadre, ir si pragle? dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50" />I siragl pre nana taragl mudu ere yeiga yomiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.50 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aisaia 66.1-2</char></note> di, God ye kamo mina yegl dumiwe di, Stiven yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51" />Ana Stiven ka yegl di kodidre, ka di pi dudumara yegl dugwa, Ene we, ene yoba yugobuno pere, ye God kamo prikrikwa erimere yegl, ene ama yegl ere, God kamo prikre, nomano gigle dumiwe dugwa. Te, ene kowano awano erimere mere yegl ere, ene Mudu Murubuglo ka dugwa i sedigwa. <verse eid="ACT 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52" />Ene kowano awano God kamo kep yoba okna meglkwa i, swara ta ye ere kide ere tekrikwa ta meglmo? dugwa. Ta manugwa. God kamo kep yoba tau okna meglkwa, ye Yagl Du Kaima ta okuo unabiwe digwa i, ene kowano awano ka kep yoba i si geglkwa. Yegl eriko, te ene erme Yagl Du Kaima i ugo, ene ama i pi Rom yoba ogono mina edidre, ye si goraiglmedi erikwa. <verse eid="ACT 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53" />Ene na God lomo di kide yei teniwe digwa ba ene prio! dugwa. God okna ere mogl, angelo tau ye lomo i pi nono kowano awano tenaiglmedi togo, ye teigwa i, erme ene ama igwa. Ene God lomo i, igwa ba ene duglo ta boglkrimiwe di, Stiven yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Stiven kobuglo sigo, goglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54" />Ana Stiven ye ka mudu i di kodugo, Kaunsil ye Stiven ka dugwa i prisre, deno podo kaima kubro Stiven tedre, signo gikr erikwa. <verse eid="ACT 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55" />Yegl erikwa ba God Murubuglo ye Stiven moglmara kau si moglko, ye kan heven ibo edidre, God abuglagemo podo kide kaima sugo, kandre, Jisas God ogo wo kra adigl moglko, kanugwa. <verse eid="ACT 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56" />Stiven yegl kandre, ye Kaunsil di tedre, yegl dugwa, Ene prio! Kamun mitna ibo u koglo koglo ogo, Yoba Wam ye God ogo wo kra adigl moglko, na kaniwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 7:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57" />Ana Stiven yegl dugo, yoba ye ka dugwa pre meglkwa i prisre, ka podo kide di, ka dugwa i prakiurikwa. Prakiuro, ye kinano ake kegl didre, ye mudu muku di ede u Stiven moglmara u, ye si ake gi di meglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58" />Ye si ake gi di moglsre, gudu i pi taun meda edidre, ye si goramnedi kobuglo sigwa. Yoba tau Stiven aglau siragl mere erume digwa i ye ir gaglno gugl i pi yagl kulu ta kagie Sol we digwa moglmara i kagle mina yeidre, kobuglo komono kana Stiven sigo, <verse eid="ACT 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59" />yoba tau ye ama Stiven kobuglo sigo, Stiven ye Jisas agle didre, yegl dugwa, Yagl Kade Jisas yo, na kiana yo! dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 7:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60" />Yegl didre, yage goglko bodugl, ka podo yegl dugwa, Yagl Kade, ye tadaglme erikwa i, ere te ikne edekro! dugwa. Stiven ka yegl didre, goglkwa.<figure style="fig" alt="Stoning of Stephen" file="cn01923B.tif" size="col" loc="7.60" copy="David C. Cook" ref="7.60" /><verse eid="ACT 7:60" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1" />Ana yoba ye Stiven si geglkwa i, yagl Sol ikra kan moglsre, wakai prukwa.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 8:1">Sol ye Jisas pre mediglkwa yoba ere kide ere tenagledi erukwa</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:1">Ana yoba i Stiven si geglkwa ade swara i mina ye ama ere mogl, Jisas yugobunomo mudu dumo Jerusalem meglkwa i ere kide kaima ere teigo, Jisas pre mediglkwa yoba mudu teke ede pere pere pi distrik Judia ya Samaria pidre, ede dumo kebra bage bage eigwa. Eigwa ba Jisas dedugwa yoba 12-pela i keme ye Jerusalem mogl pai meglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2" />Yegl eriko, ana Stiven si geglkwa ikra, God kuduglmo geglkwa yoba tau meglkwa i, ye Stiven i pi maugl sidre, kai podo ere teigwa. <verse eid="ACT 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3" />Yegl erikwa ba yagl Sol ye Jisas yugobunomo mudu si dudu kodinagledi kogon yegl ere moglkwa. Ye yoba Jisas yugobunomo mina meglkwa i yugu pere pere kipai meglmara i, ede yugugl pidre, yagl ya abu akie si kane si i pi kane yugu edugwa.<verse eid="ACT 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samaria yoba Jisas kamo wakai i prikwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4" />Ana Jisas pre mediglkwa yoba teke ede bage bage pi ede dumo aglo mere ta pi meglmara i moglsre, Jisas kamo i, yoba di teigwa. <verse eid="ACT 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5" />Ana yagl Filip i ama yegl ere, ye ede dumo Samaria we dimara i pidre, God Kere Yugwa yagl kamo i, yoba di togwa. <verse eid="ACT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6" />Di togo, yoba mere kide ye Filip ka dugwa i prisre, kimagl diu erukwa i kandre, ye mudu kinano gudu meglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7" />Te, yoba tau mere murubuglo kide ye meglmara suna moglkwa i, Filip ye di meda edugo, murubuglo kide grigle di, ede meda wigwa. Wigo, te yoba tau ogono katno mawa sugwa mo kide erukwa i, Filip ama ere wakai ere togwa. <verse eid="ACT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8" />Yegl erukwa pre yoba dumo Samaria meglkwa i, kandre, gun podo yeigwa.<verse eid="ACT 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9" />Ana yagl ta ama dumo swara i mina moglkwa, kagie Saimon we digwa. Ye yagl kade ta mole didre, kumo giai ere moglkwa. Ere moglko, Samaria yoba ye kumo giai erukwa i kandre, nagino kogl, kinano gudu meglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10" />Yoba mudu, yoba kade ya yoba yoko meglkwa i pra, yagl Saimon i kamo prisre, ama yegl digwa, Yagl Saimon God yobuglomo idre, yagl yobuglo podo paugwa moglmiwe digwa. <verse eid="ACT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11" />Siragl pre yagl i ege olto kumo giai ere moglsre, yoba nagino koraiglmedi erukwa pre ye kamo prikwa. <verse eid="ACT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12" />Samaria yoba i okna yegl prikwa ba Filip u ka mabuno wakai God yoba kingno mogl, suglno morabuka i pre didre, te Jisas ye God Kere Yugwa Yagl moglme dugo, Samaria yoba tau mere, yagl ya abu akie pre mediglsre, nigl biglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13" />Te, kumo giai yagl Saimon i ama ye Filip ka dugwa i prisre, pre meduglkwa. Pre mediglsre, nigl bugl, ye Filip wanumara ege ege mokomugl sika si wanugo, Filip ama kimagl diu podo erukwa i, yagl i kandre, nagie kogl, kina gudu moglkwa.<verse eid="ACT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14" />Ana yoba tau u Jisas dedugwa yoba dumo Jerusalem meglkwa ikra di te, yegl digwa, Samaria yoba tau mere God kamo pre mediglmiwe digo, prikwa. Prisre, ye Pita ya Jon ede pi Samaria enabredi dedigo, ebrika. <verse eid="ACT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15" />Ye pi Samaria pidre, Mudu Murubuglo pre mediglkwa yoba i meglmara unabedi kamage eribrika. <verse eid="ACT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16" />Okna Samaria yoba ye Jisas kamo pre mediglkwa i, i nogugl edinamnedi nigl biglkwa. Yegl erikwa ba Mudu Murubuglo ye meglmara ta ukrukwa. <verse eid="ACT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17" />Ana Pita ya Jon ye kamage ersre, ogono i pi Samaria yoba akibrika igne i Mudu Murubuglo ye meglmara ede suna u moglkwa.<verse eid="ACT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18" />Ana Pita ya Jon ogono i pi yoba ikra akibriko, igne swara i mina Mudu Murubuglo ye meglmara suna ugwa. Ugo, yagl Saimon ikra kandre, ye Pita ya Jon di te, yegl dugwa, Na mige moni tau ene tebo, <verse eid="ACT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19" />ene yobuglo yegl mere narabredi prie dugwa. Yobuglo yegl naribr, na ogona i pi yoba ta akenaglka i, Mudu Murubuglo ye moglmara unabuka pre diwe dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20" />Ana yagl Saimon i ka yegl dugo, Pita ye di ikne ede te, yegl dugwa, God taragl ta yene prumere yoba togwa i, ene mige moni tedre, inagledi pitno? dugwa. Yegl ta manabuka! Ene yegl eragledi pitnga i, God ene ya ene migenen bogl akie ene ere kide ere tenabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21" />God gumuglo mina ene den mudun kide yogwa pre ene no God kogonmo erumnara suna moratnga i ta kuno erekrabuka. <verse eid="ACT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22" />Ene nomane kide inga pre ene nomanen yake tedre, Yagl Kade kamage ere to! dugwa. Kamage ere ten, ye ene den mudun mina pitnga i, gugl ede tenabo mo i, ene kanatniwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23" />Siragl pre na kaniga i, ene yoba toro kide kango, te tadaglme ene si kane sumiwe di, Pita yegl dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24" />Pita yegl dugo, Saimon di ikne ede te, yegl dugwa, Yagl suo, ene na pre Yagl Kade agle di priro! dugwa. Ene agle di pribr, taragl ta na moglmara plau dinabe dibrika i, plau dikrabiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25" />Ana Pita ya Jon ye ka giglede di, Yagl Kade kamo i, Samaria yoba di te kodidre, aglke ede ikne Jerusalem enabugledi ede ebrika. Ye konbauna bage wan pidre, Samaria yoba tau dumo kebra bage bage kipai meglmara i ka mabuno wakai di te te, ede ebrika.<verse eid="ACT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Filip ere mogl, Itiopia nem ta ka mabuno di togwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Philip and the Ethiopian" file="LB00331b.tif" size="col" copy="Louise Bass, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="8.26" />Ana yagl Filip ikra moglmara, Yagl Kade angelomo ta u ye di te, yegl dugwa, Ene erme adigl ede nigl beye kra po! dugwa. Ene ede pi Jerusalem pidre, konbauna ede pi dumo wau yomara pi, ede dumo Gasa we digwa konbauna omara suna i po dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 8:26" /><verse number="27-28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27-28" />Yegl dugwa pre Filip adigl ede pi konbauna i yomara ogwa. Ogo, kantri Itiopia nem ta God kagie kade tenagledi dumo Jerusalem pidre, karismo mina aglke ede ikne ugo, Filip kanugwa. Yagl i, ye abu ta kagie Kandas we digwa, ye Itiopia yoba bitno moglkwa i yobamo kade ta moglsre, abu i mige bona sumara yagl i sugl moglkwa. Te, yagl i, ye waglkamo pogl edigwa. Ye karis mina ame di mogl, ka kep yagl ta Aisaia we digwa i, ka okna ibo boglkwa i kere moglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 8:27-28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29" />Kere moglko, God Murubuglo ye Filip di te, Ene ede pi yagl ta karis mina umara iro ede magigl po! dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30" />Yegl dugo, Filip mukudi ede magigl pidre, prukwa i, yagl i Aisaia ka boglkwa i kere moglko, prukwa. Prisre, ye di pre, yegl dugwa, Agra yo, ene ketnga i, mabunomo ene pre pogl sino mo sikitne? dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31" />Yegl dugo, yagl i ye di ikne ede te, Na ta pre pogl sikriwe dugwa. Yoba ta ka i mabunomo di naran, na pre pogl sinaglka ba ta manan, na pre pogl sikraluwe dugwa. Yegl didre, ye Filip di te, ene ede karis mina un, nono akie ame di morabugle dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32" />Ana Itiopia nem ikra ye Aisaia ka boglko, kerumara i, ka bage ta yegl paugo, kere kanugwa, Yoba sipsip si goramnedi kane kogl i ede eimere yegl, yoba ye God Kogonmo Yagl i si goramnedi si kane si i ede eigwa. Te, yoba sipsip yugo baiglko, sipsip be dikrumere mere yegl, Yagl i ama ka ta dikrukwa. <verse eid="ACT 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33" />Yoba ye agai gorabedi ersre, kot kibi ere teigwa. Yugobuno ta God Kogonmo Yagl i moglkwa igne akie meglkwa i, ye yoba siragl mere meglme dinamne? Yoba i prikwa, yagl i makandigle moglkrabedi prisre, si geglmiwe di, Aisaia yegl boglkwa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aisaia 53.7-8, Itiopa yagl ikra kerukwa.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34" />Ana Itiopia nem i ka yegl kersre, ye Filip di pre, yegl dugwa, God kamo kep yoba boglkwa i, ka kep yoba ye yene pre boglmo mo yoba pere ta pre boglme? dugwa. Ka i, ene di naratnedi priwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35" />Yegl dugo, Filip ere mogl, God kamo bage ta kerumara i mabuno siragl mere paugwa i di togwa. Di tedre, God kamo tau ama idre, Jisas kamo yagl i di togwa. <verse eid="ACT 8:35" /><verse number="36-37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36-37" />Ye karis mina konbauna pi miurko, Filip ye yagl i ka di togo, yagl i prisre, ye ere mogl, yegl dugwa, Nigl nubun ta moglkwa iro, kano! dugwa. Na nigl buragledi prika. Na nigl buglbo, kuno erabo? di, yegl kira pogl prukwa.<verse eid="ACT 8:36-37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38" />Ana Itiopia nem i ka yegl didre, ye karis guma akugwa yagl i di te, Ake paio! dugo, ake paugwa. Ake paugo, Filip ye yagl i bogl akie ede nigle ebriko, Filip ye yagl i ake nigl atne ede, nigl bugl togwa. <verse eid="ACT 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39" />Nigl bugl te kodugo, ye nigle i kide kodo, ede meda ubrika. Ede meda ubriko, Yagl Kade Murubuglomo Filip tabre i ede ogwa pre Filip imim daglkwa. Yegl eruko, Itiopia nem ikra ye Filip kankrukwa ba ye gun podo yedre, ede ogwa. <verse eid="ACT 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40" />Ana Filip ye kanugwa i, God Murubuglo ye yu taun ta Asdot we dimara i edugo, moglka pamedi kandre, ye ede pi taun bage bage magigl yeimara i pidre, ka mabuno wakai i, yoba di te, wan ede pi taun ta Sisaria we dimara ogwa.<verse eid="ACT 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9" />
  <para style="s">Sol Jisas pre meduglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1" />Ana Yagl Kade Jisas nagiglema i, yagl Sol ikra ye si goragledi ka giglede di pai mogl, ye ede pi yagl ta tawa teigwa yoba bitno moglkwa i moglmara pidre, <verse eid="ACT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2" />yagl i ye pepa tau bogl naran, ye idre, ede pi taun Damaskus we dimara i, enagledi kira pogl prukwa. Pepa i, ye i pi Juda ka mabuno yugu sugl meglkwa yoba i tedre, yoba tau Jisas konbaunamo duglo beglkwa ta moraiglkwa i, yagl ya abu pra si kane si yu dumo Jerusalem edenabuka pre kira pogl prukwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3" />Yegl kira pogl pruko, tawa teigwa yoba bitno moglkwa i pepa bogl togwa. Pepa bogl togo, Sol idre, ye yagl tau bogl akie ede dumo Damaskus enamnedi akie ede eigwa. Ye ede pi taun Damaskus magigl eigo, heven ibo abuglage podo ta si pogl di, ede makandigle u, Sol moglmara edugwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4" />Edugo, Sol yage makandigle sidre, prukwa i, yoba ta ka yegl dugo, prukwa, Sol yo, ene siragl pre na ere kide ere nare motne? dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5" />Yegl dugo, Sol ye di ikne ede, Yagl Kade yo, ene ira motne? dugwa. Yegl dugo, Yagl Kade ye di te, yegl dugwa, Na Jisas, ene ere kide ere nare motnga i, moglka. <verse eid="ACT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6" />Ba erme we, ene adigl ede taun suna po! dugwa. Ene taun suna en, yoba ta ere mogl, ene siragl mere eratnga paugwa i, ene di tenan, pratniwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7" />Ana yagl tau Sol bogl akie konbauna eigwa i, ye kudugl gogl, ka ta dikre, adigl kan meglkwa. Ye prikwa i, yoba ta ka dugo, nugu ebrie prikwa ba yoba i ta moglko, kankrikwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8" />Yegl pre ye kan meglko, Sol ye adigl, gumuglo pine dugwa ba ye gumuglo kin yogo, taragl swara ta kankrukwa. Yegl erukwa pre yagl tau ye Sol bogl akie eigwa i ye ogo ake i pi Damaskus suna edigo, <verse eid="ACT 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9" />ye ege suota dumo i pai moglko, gumuglo kin yei pai moglko, ye nigl ya kaya mokna ta nekrukwa.<verse eid="ACT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10" />Ana dumo Damaskus suna i, Jisas nagigle ta moglkwa, kagie Ananaias we digwa. Yagl Ananaias i gumuglomugl eruko, kanugwa, Yagl Kade ye gumuglomugl erumara i ye agle di, Ananaias yo dugwa. Yegl dugo, Ananaias di ikne ede, Yagl Kade yo, na moglka iwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11" />Yegl dugo, Yagl Kade ye di te, yegl dugwa, Ene adigl ede pi konbauna ta kagie Konbauna Du we dimara i pidre, yagl ta kagie Judas we digwa kipamara i po! dugwa. Yagl i kipamara pidre, yagl ta dumo Tarsus nem moglkwa, ye kagie Sol we digwa i doko kano! dugwa. Yagl Sol i erme na kamage ere narukwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12" />Ye kamage ere narsre, gumuglomugl eruko, kanugwa i, ene ye moglmara pi gumuglo kin yogwa i, aglke kor kanabedi ogon i pi ye akingo, kanugwa. Yegl pre ene ye gumuglomugl eruko, kanumere yegl pi eratniwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13" />Ana Yagl Kade ka yegl di togo, Ananaias ye di ikne ede te, yegl dugwa, Yagl Kade yo, yoba tau mere yagl Sol i pre digo, prika. Ye ene yobanma dumo Jerusalem meglkwa i ka kaima ere kide ere tome digwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14" />Te, ye ede dumo magigl ugwa i, tawa teigwa yoba bitno meglkwa i, ye dede, yoba ta ene no ere inatnedi agle dinaiglkwa i, ye si kane sinabedi dedigwa, umiwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15" />Ananaias yegl dugwa ba Yagl Kade ye aglke kor di te, yegl dugwa, Ene ede po dugwa. Na yagl Sol i na kogona erabedi kere iga, moglme dugwa. Ye na kana i pi yugobuno pere pere, ye Israel yoba moglkrikwa i di tedre, te ye kingno di tedre, Israel yoba ama di tenabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16" />Ye na kana i, yoba di tenagledi yubun tau mere inabuka paugwa. Ye yubun siragl mere inabuka i, na ye di tebo, prabiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17" />Ana Yagl Kade yegl dugwa pre Ananaias ere mogl, ye kipamara kide kodo, ede pi yagl ta kagie Judas we digwa ikra kipamara pidre, Sol yugugl moglmara ogwa. Ye Sol moglmara pidre, ye ogo i pi Sol ake, yegl dugwa, Agra Sol yo, na Yagl Kade Jisas, ene konbauna bage tegigl yei, kanga i, na dedugo, wiwe dugwa. Ye na dede, ene gumugln kin yogwa i, aglke kor kanatnga pre ya te, Mudu Murubuglo ene motnara si kau si tenabuka pre na dedugo, wiwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18" />Yegl dugo, ege swara i mina buglo bagle nagie kidine mere yegl gumuglo mina paugwa yage sugo, ye gumuglo aglke kor u wakai ogo, kanugwa. Ye kandre, adigl, ede pi nigl buglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19" />Nigl bugl kodo, ye kaya mokna tau nedre, yobuglo kor dagl yugwa.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 9:19">Sol dumo Damaskus yoba Jisas kamo di togwa</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:19">Ana Sol ege tau Jisas nagiglema dumo Damaskus meglmara i bogl akie pai meglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20" />Akie pai meglko, Sol ye Juda yoba ka mabuno yugu pere pere kei yeimara i, tabre pi Jisas kamo di te, Jisas ye God Wam moglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21" />Yegl dugo, yoba mudu prikwa i, nagino kogl, yene di ikne ikne ede, yegl digwa, Yagl i dumo Jerusalem mogl, yoba ye Jisas pre mediglkwa i ere kide kaima ere te moglkwa ikra moglmiwe digwa. Te, ye ama ede dumo magigl ugwa i, yoba Jisas pre mediglkwa i si kane si i pi tawa teigwa yoba bitno meglmara i tenagledi ugwa ba ye erme Jisas kamo dumiwe di, yegl digwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22" />Ye yegl digwa ba God ye Sol yobuglo te pai moglko, Sol ye Jisas God Kere Yugwa Yagle moglkwa i praiglmedi ka giglede dugwa. Ye ka dugwa i, gigle gigle dinagledi eruko, Juda yoba di ikne ede tedre, ene kibi dine dinaiglkwa mere yegl manga.<verse eid="ACT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Juda yoba tau Sol si goramniwe digo, Sol teke ede ogwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23" />Ana Sol ege olto dumo Damaskus mogl pai moglko, Juda yoba dumo Damaskus meglkwa i, tau ye si goramnedi ka di kogl yeigwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24" />Ye ka di kogl yei, ede pi dumo Damaskus i kobuglo togl podo ere winabo dimara togl dra mina ye etne ya eduer akie sugl mogl, Sol unan, ye si goramnedi sugl kan meglkwa. Ye yegl erikwa ba yoba tau prisre, Sol di teigwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25" /><figure style="fig" alt="Paul being lowered in a basket" file="LB00333b.tif" size="span" copy="Louise Bass, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="9.25" />Di teigo, Sol kugl nogwa yoba tau ere mogl, Sol eduer agre i ede pi windo ta kobuglo togl i mina yomara pidre, degigl gagl podo ta idre, Sol ede atne ede, kan kogl padigl, ye kobuglo togl windo yomara ikra mina ede atne edigo, ye teke ede meda pi ede ogwa.<verse eid="ACT 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sol ede Jerusalem ogwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26" />Ana Sol teke ede meda pidre, aglke ta ede pi Jerusalem ogwa. Ede Jerusalem pidre, ye ede pi Jisas nagiglema meglmara akie makai sinamnedi ogwa. Ogwa ba Jisas nagiglema ye Sol kuduglmo geglkwa. I siragl pre ye prikwa i, yagl Sol i, Jisas nagigle kaima ta moglkrumedi prisre, kuduglmo gogl, akie makai sikrikwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27" />Yegl erikwa ba yagl Barnabas we digwa ikra ye Sol agre i ede pi Jisas degugwa yoba meglmara ogwa. Pidre, ye ka tau yagl Sol ede Damaskus enagledi konbo bage ogo, Yagl Kade Jisas ye moglmara plau didre, ye ka siragl mere di togwa i, Barnabas ye Jisas dedugwa yoba meglkwa i di togwa. Di tedre, ama Sol kudugl goglkre, yoba dumo Damaskus meglkwa ye Jisas kamo di tomiwe di, Barnabas ye Jisas dedugwa yoba ama yegl di togwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28" />Di te kodugo, Jisas dedugwa yoba ye Sol di igo, Sol ye Jisas dedugwa yoba bogl akie Jerusalem suna meglkwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:28">Ana Sol ye Jisas dedugwa yoba bogl akie Jerusalem pai meglko, Sol dumo Jerusalem suna i kudugl goglkre, wan u ikne ikne pi Jisas kamo i, yoba di togwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29" />Di tedre, ye ama Juda yoba tau ka Grik digwa i Jisas kamo di togwa ba Juda yoba i Sol ka dugwa i prakiuro, di ikne edigo, Sol bogl ka drano di ikne ikne ede meglkwa. Ka drano digo, Juda yoba i okuo ere mogl, Sol si goramnedi konbo dokigwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30" />Sol si goramnedi konbo dokigwa ba Jisas pre mediglkwa yoba tau i pre kan ersre, yagl Sol agre i ede pi dumo ta mudi nigl bina, kagie Sisaria we dimara pidre, ye sip mina ede pi ye yugomugl dumo Tarsus enabedi dedigo, ye ede ogwa.<verse eid="ACT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31" />Ana Sol ede yugomugl ogo, yoba distrik Judia ya Galili ya Samaria suna Jisas yugobunomo mina atne meglkwa i, okna kudano ikne ye ere kide ere teigwa i, kide kodigwa pre ye wakai meglkwa. Wakai meglko, God Murubuglo ye ake ple di togo, ye God kuduglmo gogl, kiano mina ama yobuglo idre, erikwa. Yegl eriko, yoba kor tau mere ama Jisas pre mediglsre, ye ede suna Jisas yugobunomo mina wigwa.<verse eid="ACT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pita yagl Ainias ere wakai ere togwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32" />Ana Pita ye ede dumo bage bage pidre, aglke ta ye ede pi taun ta Lida we dimara Jisas yobama tau meglkwa kanagledi ogwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33" />Ye ede dumo Lida pidre, yagl ta ogo kagle mawa sugwa moglko, ye kanugwa. Yagl i kagie Ainias we digwa. Ye bugla yugu 8-pela ogo kagle mawa sugo, bogl mina keme pai moglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34" />Ana Pita yagl Ainias i kandre, ye di te, yegl dugwa, Ainias yo, Ene adigl, boglnen ere wakai ero. Jisas, God Kere Yugwa Yagl, ye ene ere wakai ere tomiwe dugwa. Yegl dugo, yagl i oglade adiglsre, <verse eid="ACT 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35" />wan u ikne ikne ogo, yoba mudu dumo Lida meglkwa i ya te, dumo auduno ta magigl yogwa kagie Saron we dimara meglkwa i ye yagl i kandre, nomane kor idre, Yagl Kade Jisas pre mediglkwa.<verse eid="ACT 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pita abu Tabita ere i kor edugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36" />Ana igne i Jisas nagigle ta dumo Jopa moglkwa, kagie Tabita we digwa. Te, ka Grik mina, kagie Dokas we digwa. Ana abu i ege ege yoba ki ere wakai ere tedre, te goduglme yoba meglkwa ki ama ake ple di te, erukwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37" />Ana aglke ta abu i kide sugo, goglkwa. Abu i goglko, yoba ye nigl pai tedre, ogo nagie i pi yugu mitna ta yomara kiule kra yeigwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38" />Yeigo, Jisas nagiglema dumo Jopa meglkwa i ye Pita dumo Lida moglme digo, prisre, yagl suo dede, ye ede pi Lida pidre, Pita agre yunabredi dedigwa. Dumo Jopa mogl ede Lida enaiglkwa i, magigl yogwa pre ye yagl suo i dedigwa. Dedigo, yagl suo i ye ede pi Pita dumo Lida moglmara pidre, kamage yei, Pita di te, Nono akie tabre ede pi Jopa enamga pre umbugliwe di, yegl dibrika.<verse eid="ACT 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39" />Ana yagl suo i ede u Pita yegl di tebrika pre Pita ye yagl suo ikra bogl akie ede eigwa. Ye ede pi dumo Jopa plau digo, yoba ye Pita agre i ede pi abu i ogo nagie yugu mitna ta yogwa yeimara ikra eigwa. Eigo, abu werai tau mere udre, Pita moglmara mogl winabo didre, kai erikwa. Kai ersre, abu Dokas i kor moglkwa igne ir gagl ya kugugl gagl tau ama si bogl, abu werai tau togwa i, Pita kanabedi obuno di teigwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40" />Yegl eriko, Pita yoba i mudu di meda edidre, ye goglko bodugl, kamage ere, God agle di prukwa. Yegl ersre, ye kan ake te, abu ikra pai moglmara kandre, ye di te, yegl dugwa, Abu Tabita yo, ene adiglo dugwa. Yegl dugo, abu ikra gumuglo pine di Pita kandre, adigl bogl mina ame di moglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41" />Ame di moglko, Pita u abu i ogo ake adiglsre, abu werai meglkwa ikra ya te, God yobama mudu meglkwa i agle dugo, wigwa. Ye wigo, Pita ye di te, Abu ikra kor moglma, kanio dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42" />Yegl eruko, taragl plau dugwa i ka di ede eigo, yoba dumo Jopa meglkwa i mudu prikwa. Mudu priko, yoba tau mere ka i prisre, Yagl Kade Jisas pre mediglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43" />Te, Pita ye ege olto yagl ta dumo Jopa kipaugwa, kagie Saimon we digwa i bogl akie pai miurka. Yagl Saimon i, ye agl bugla nagino kugl yauro, ere wakai erukwa yagl ta moglkwa.<verse eid="ACT 9:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10" />
  <para style="s">Angelo ta yagl Kornilius moglmara plau dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1" />Ana yagl ta taun Sisaria we dimara moglkwa, kagie Kornilius we digwa. Yagl Kornilius i, ye Rom soldia 1,000 mere yegl meglmara suna i moglkwa. Soldia 1,000 mere meglkwa i, kagno Itali nem we di, yegl digwa. Ye soldia meglmara suna i moglsre, soldia ama 100 ye suglno moglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2" />Ana yagl Kornilius i nem agiglema bogl God kuduglmo goglsre, God we di pre wan meglkwa. Te, Kornilius ama goduglme yoba ki ege ege ake ple di tedre, ege ege God kamage ere tedre, erukwa.<verse eid="ACT 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3" />
    <figure style="fig" file="cn01945B.tif" size="span" copy="David C Cook" ref="10.3" />Ana aglke ta poko dugo, 3 klok mere yegl yogo, Kornilius ye gumuglomugl eruko kanugwa i, God angelomo ta ye moglmara ugo, ye gumuglo mina kaima kanugwa. Angelo i ye moglmara udre, ye kagie dagl, Kornilius yo! dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4" />Yegl dugo, Kornilius ere mogl, angelo i toro kan moglsre, kudugl podo gogl, Yagl kade yo, ene do dugwa. Yegl dugo, angelo i ye di te, yegl dugwa, Ene God kamage ere tedre, yoba goduglme ki ake ple di te, ere motnga i, God kan moglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5" />Yegl erukwa pre ene erme yagl tau dedin, ye ede pi taun Jopa pidre, yagl ta kagie Saimon Pita we digwa i agre yu ene motnga unaiglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6" />Saimon Pita ye yagl ta mudi nigl bina kipamara i, akie pai miurka. Yagl i, ye agl bugla nagino kugl yauro, ere wakai erukwa yagl ta moglkwa. Yagl i kagie ama Saimon we dimiwe di, angelo yegl dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7" />Ana angelo i ka yegl di kodidre, ede ogo, Kornilius ere mogl, ye niglmo kogonmo yagl suo agle dugo, ubrika. Te, ye ama soldia swara ta ege ege Kornilius kogonmo ere tedre, ama God we di pre, wan moglkwa i agle dugo, ugwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8" />Ye yagl suota i agle dugo, wigo, ye taragl mudu plau dugwa i wakai ere boglo si tedre, ede dumo Jopa ikra enaiglmedi dedugo, ye ede eigwa.<verse eid="ACT 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pita gumuglomugl eruko, kanugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9" />Ana tagugo i, yagl suota ikra konbauna wan pi meglko, belo mere yegl ede dumo Jopa magigl eigwa. Ana igne i Pita ye yugu ta pamara ikra ede kuglo ibo pi, kuglo ibo mogl, kamage eragledi ede ogwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10" />Ye pi kamage ere moglsre, ye kidan gogl, kaya mokna nenagledi prukwa. Yegl prukwa ba yoba kaya mokna gaiglkwa i dekruko, Pita sugl moglko, ye gumuglomugl eruko, kanugwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11" />Ye kanugwa i, kamun mitna ibo ede u koglo koglo ogo, lap podo ta yoba lap puduo 4-pela i mudu kan kogl ake mogl, lap i ede atne makan mina edigwa mere yegl kanugwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12" />Ana lap podo yomara atne i, agl bugla ya dua kabu kane kane ya te, gur toki kane kane ya kua kane kane ama meglko, Pita kanugwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13" />Taragl yegl atne meglko, Pita kan moglko, God ka ta dugo, Pita prukwa. God ka ta dugwa i, yegl dugwa, Pita yo, ene adigl, taragl kanga i si kei no! dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14" />Yegl dugo, Pita ye di ikne ede te, yegl dugwa, Yagl Kade yo, na yegl ta erekragle dugwa. Na ege swara ta taragl ta nenaglka mawagl pamara i, ta ne kankrie dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15" />Yegl dugo, God ye aglke kor di te, Na taragl ta erme mawagl paikrume diga i, ene mawagl pame dikro! dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16" />Yegl dugo, ana Pita ya God ye ka dibrika i, Pita ye dumere di pai moglko, God ama dumere dugo, ye ege suota ka dibrere yegl di pai miurka. Ege suota dibriko, lap podo ikra tabre kana ede ikne kamun mitna ibo ogo, Pita aglke kor ta kankrukwa.<verse eid="ACT 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17" />Ana Pita ye gumuglomugl eruko, taragl ta kanugwa i, mabuno siragl mere paugwa i pragledi kina gudu moglkwa. Kina gudu pre moglko, yagl suota Kornilius dedugo, wigwa ikra, tabre kana u togl dra mina adigl meglkwa. Ye yoba kira pogl pre, yagl Saimon ikra aglo mere kipame digo, yoba ye di teigo, prisre, wigwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18" />Ye u togl dra mina adigl moglsre, yoba yugugl meglkwa i agle di pre, Yagl ta kagie Saimon Pita we digwa i, magigl i pai moglmo? digwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19" />Ana Pita ye gumuglomugl eruko, taragl ta kanugwa ikra mabuno siragl mere paugwa i pragledi kina gudu moglko, God Murubuglo ye di te, yegl dugwa, Ene pro. Yagl suota ene pre doko wimiwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20" />Ene adigl, ede atne en, yagl suota i bogl akie ede pio dugwa. Siragl pre na nana ere mogl, ye dediga pre ene ye bogl akie enaiglkwa i, kinan suo suo yekran, ede en, akie enaiglmiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21" />Ana God Murubuglo yegl dugwa pre Pita yugu kuglo ibo moglkwa i kide kodo, ede atne u yagl suota togl dra mina adigl meglmara i pidre, ye di te, yegl dugwa, Yagl wagle, ene yagl ta dokigwa i, na moliwe dugwa. Yegl didre, ye kira pogl, Ene siragl pre wime? di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22" />Yegl dugo, ye di ikne ede te, yegl digwa, Yagl ta kagie Kornilius we digwa i, no dedugo, ene motnara umniwe digwa. Yagl Kornilius i, ye Rom soldia meglkwa i, ye 100 mere yegl ye suglno moglkwa. Te, ye yagl du kaima mogl, God kuduglmo goglko, Israel yoba mudu ye wakai kanime digwa. Ege swara ta God angelomo ye moglmara pi di te, ye ene agle dinan, ene pi ye ka ta di tenatnga pre God angelomo ye di togo, no dedugo, umniwe digwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23" />Yegl digo, Pita ere mogl, yagl suota i akie panamnedi Ede yugugl wio dugo, ye ede yugugl pi Pita yugu ta pamara ikra akie paigwa. Ye padre, taganamogl akie ede ikne enamnedi eigwa. Ede eigo, Jisas pre mediglkwa yoba tau ama dumo Jopa kipaigwa i ama ye bogl akie ede eigwa.<verse eid="ACT 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pita ede pi Kornilius kipamara ogwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24" />Ana Pita ye yoba i bogl akie konbauna pi mogl, ege swara ta konbauna bage pai, ege ta mina pi dumo Sisaria plau digwa. Ana yagl Kornilius ye Pita agre yunaiglmedi kie ere moglkwa. Yegl ersre, ye okna kana nem agiglema ya ye kabaglema i nogwa ta meglkwa i agle dugo, ye ama u makai si meglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25" />Ana Pita ye yoba tau bogl akie eigwa ikra pi dumo Sisaria plau digo, Pita ye Kornilius kipamara ede yugugl ogwa. Ye ede yugugl ogo, Kornilius u Pita moglmara udre, yage kagle mina kobragai padre, kagie kade tenagledi erukwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26" />Yegl erukwa ba Pita ye ogo ake adiglsre, ye di te, Adiglo! dugwa. Didre, Na ene yoba meglmere yegl wiwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27" />Yegl dugo, yagl Kornilius i aduglko, ye Pita bogl ka kuri ta di pribriko, okuo Pita ye yoba tau bogl akie wigwa ikra mudu ede yugugl eigo, yoba tau mere yugugl makai si meglko, Pita ye pi kanugwa.<verse eid="ACT 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28" />Ana Pita ede yugugl pi mogl, yoba mere makai si meglkwa i kandre, ye ere mogl, yegl di togwa, Yagl abu wagle, no Juda yoba munga i, no yoba ta Juda yoba moglkrikwa i bogl wandre, yugugl akie moramga i, mawagl paugwa i, enene pre kan erime dugwa. Yegl paugwa ba God na obuno di narukwa i, na yoba swara ta bogl akie moramga i, mawagl ta paikrume di, na yegl obuno di narukwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29" />God mabuno yegl mere obuno di narukwa i pre ene na agle digo, na mane dikre, pra ede wiga. Yegl pre erme ene siragl pre na agle digwa i, ene dibi, na praluwe di, Pita yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30" />Ana Pita ka yegl di kodugo, Kornilius ye di te, yegl dugwa, Ege suota ede ogwa i, taragl ta na moglmara plau dumiwe dugwa. Nono erme ade kwia 3 klok munere yegl mere na kamage ere moglko, yagl ta kuguglmo gaglmo pogl di yogwa u na gumuglna mina adigl moglsre, <verse eid="ACT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31" />kagna dagl, yegl dume dugwa. Kornilius yo, ene kamage etnga i, God prisre, te, ene yoba goduglme meglkwa ake ple di te motnga i, God kandre, pre moglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32" />Yegl pre ene yoba tau dedin, ye ede dumo Jopa pi yagl ta kagie Saimon Pita we digwa i agre yunaiglmiwe dugwa. Yagl Saimon Pita i, ye yagl ta mudi nigl bina kipamara pai moglkwa. Yagl i, ye agl bugla nagino kugl yauro, ere wakai erukwa yagle moglme dugwa. Te, yagl i ye kagie ama Saimon we dimiwe di, angelo yegl dume dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33" />Angelo i yegl dugwa pre na oglade yoba ta ene agre yunaiglmedi dedie dugwa. Na ye dedigo, ye pi ene di teigo, ene unga i, wakai etniwe dugwa. Yegl pre ana erme no God gumuglo mina makai si moglsre, Yagl Kade ene ka siragl mere no di noratnga pre dugo, unga i, no pramnedi sugl muniwe di, yagl Kornilius i yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pita ere mogl, Kornilius yobama Jisas kamo di togwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34" />Ana Kornilius yegl di kodugo, Pita ere mogl, yoba makai si meglkwa i yegl di togwa, Na erme prika i, God ka kaima yoba mudu mabuno swara ere tomiwe dugwa.<figure style="fig" alt="Peter preaching to the household of Cornelius" file="cn01947B.tif" size="col" loc="10.34-43" copy="David C. Cook" ref="10.34" /> <verse eid="ACT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35" />Yoba yugobuno pere pere mudu meglmara suna i, yoba ta God kuduglmo gogl, ye yoba eraiglmedi prumere erabuka i, God ye wakai kanabuka. <verse eid="ACT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36" />Ana God kamo ye no Israel yoba praiglmedi di norukwa i, ene yoba yugobuno pere magigl meglkwa i ama tau pre kan erime dugwa. Ye kamo i mina yegl di norume dugwa, Jisas, ye yoba mudu Yaglno Kade moglkwa i, yoba ta Jisas pre mediglbi, ye God bogl deno muduno swara yenaiglmiwe di, God ye kamo mina no yegl di norumiwe dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37" />Te, taragl podo mere kide, distrik Judia suna plau dugwa i, ene ama pre kan erikwa. Yagl Jon i ye komono kana u yoba ake nigl atne ede, nigl bugl tenagle didre, kogonmo dumere yegl erukwa. Ana Jon kogon eruko, mokomugl i taragl podo tau distrik Galili suna i plau dugo, te distrik Judia suna bage bage ama plau dugo, ene pre kan erimiwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38" />Na ka diga i, Jisas, dumo Nasaret nem moglkwa i, taragl kane kane erukwa pre diga. God ere mogl, Jisas kere i pere ede, ye Murubuglomo tedre, yobuglo togwa. Tedre, ye moglmara ama mogl tedre, eruko, Jisas wan ede bage bage pidre, yoba ere wakai ere tedre, te, Satan yoba tau ake gi di moglsre, ere kide ere togwa i, ye ake wakai ere tomiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39" />No tau Jisas duglo bunga yoba munga i, no ye taragl kane kane dumo Jerusalem ya te, Juda yoba dumono mudu suna erukwa i, no kadre, yoba di te wan muniwe dugwa. Ana Juda yoba ere mogl, Jisas ede prak mina si geglko, <verse eid="ACT 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40" />ege suota atne pai moglko, God ye ere i kor edugo, aduglkwa. Ye aduglko, God ama yoba tau ye kanaiglmedi erukwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41" />Yoba mudu ye kankrikwa, ba no yoba tau God no okna kana ye kandre, kamo i pi yoba di tenaiglmedi kere i pere edugwa i, no ye kamga. Ye goglsre, adigl u kor ogo, no ege tau ye bogl akie moglsre, kaya mokna ki akie nomga.<verse eid="ACT 10:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42" />Te, Jisas ama no yoba di tedre, yoba yegl di teo dugwa. God ere mogl, Jisas swara yoba Jasno morabedi dedugwa. Yoba kor meglkwa ya te, yoba geglkwa i, ye swara Jasno morabedi dedumiwe di, yegl di teo di, di norukwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43" />Te, God kamo kep yoba okna meglkwa i, ye mudu Jisas pre didre, yegl digwa, Yoba ta Jisas pre medran, God ye Jisas kogon erumara i mina tadaglmemo gugl ede tenabiwe di, ka kep yoba okna yegl dimiwe di, Pita yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoba tau Juda yoba moglkrikwa i, God Murubuglo igwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44" />Ana Pita ka yegl didre, ka tau ama di pai moglko, Mudu Murubuglo ede atne u yoba ye Pita ka dugwa pre meglkwa ikra, meglmara ugwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:44" /><verse number="45-46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45-46" />Mudu Murubuglo ede atne u yoba i meglmara ugo, yoba i ka pere pere didre, God kagie kade teigo, Juda yoba tau Jisas pre mediglkwa, ye Pita bogl akie wigwa ikra prisre, nagino kogl, yegl di prikwa, God yoba yugobuno pere ta ye Juda yoba moglkrikwa i ye Mudu Murubuglo yoko kaima tomiwedi prisre, nagino keglkwa. Nagino keglko, Pita ye ere mogl, Juda yoba akie wigwa ikra yegl di togwa, <verse eid="ACT 10:45-46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47" />Yoba i nono Mudu Murubuglo yumnere mere yegl ama igwa pre ye nigl buraiglkwa i, nono mane ta dikramniwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48" />Pita ka yegl didre, ye Kornilius yobama bogl di te, yegl dugwa, Ene Jisas, God Kere Yugwa Yagle pre mediglkwa i, i nogugl edinamnedi nigl buraiglmiwe dugwa. Pita yegl dugo, yoba ikra nigl buglsre, ye Pita di te, yegl digwa, Nono kuri ta pai mun, ene okuo ede ikne enaiglmiwe di, yegl digwa. Yegl digo, Pita pra we dugo, ye ege tau akie meglkwa.<verse eid="ACT 10:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11" />
  <para style="s">Pita ede Jerusalem pidre, Kornilius kamo boglo si togwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1" />Ana yagl Kornilius i, ye nem agiglema bogl Juda yoba moglkrikwa, ye Rom yoba meglkwa. Kornilius ye nem agiglema bogl yugobuno pere meglkwa ba God kamo pre mediglkwa i, Juda yoba tau prisre, nagino kogl, yoba tau di teigo, ka i wai dugwa. Ka wai dugo, Jisas dedugwa yoba ya Juda yoba tau Jisas pre mediglkwa ye distrik Judia suna bage bage meglkwa i ama prikwa. <verse eid="ACT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2" />Ye prisre, Pita okuo ede Jerusalem ugo, pre mediglkwa yoba tau u Pita ka teigwa. Yoba Pita ka teigwa i, ye prikwa, yoba mudu Juda yoba erumnere mere yegl ere, gagno puduo gagie boraiglkwa keme pamedi prikwa. <verse eid="ACT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3" />Yegl prikwa pre ye Pita ka te, yegl digwa, Ene yoba gagno puduo gagie boglkrikwa i kipaimara ede yugugl engo, kaya mokna akie neigwa i, aglau pamiwe di, yegl di, ka teigwa.<verse eid="ACT 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4" />Ana yoba tau ye Pita erukwa i, aglau erumiwe digwa pre Pita ye siragl mere erukwa i kamo mabuno boglmara ede pi dudumara i boglo si te, yegl dugwa, <verse eid="ACT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5" />Na aglke ta dumo Jopa we dimara moglsre, kamage ere moglka. Kamage ere moglmara i gumuglnamugl eruko, kaniga, lap podo ta yoba ta kamun mina ibo mogl, puduo 4-pela i mudu kan kogl, ake mogl, lap i ede atne na moglmara edugwa mere yegl kaniwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6" />Na taragl i kandre, kan atne ede, toro kan moglka i, taragl kane kane atne meglko, kaniga. Agl bugla kane kane meglko, dua kabu kane kane meglko, te gur toki ya kua kane kane ki ama meglko, kaniga. <verse eid="ACT 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7" />Kanigo, God ka ta na di naruko, na pre moglka i, yegl dugwa, Pita yo, ene adigl, taragl i si kei no dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8" />Yegl dugwa ba na ere mogl, di ikne ede te, yegl diga, Yagl Kade yo, na ka kaima yegl ta erekraglka. Siragl pre na ege swara ta taragl ta nenaglka mawagl pamara i, ta ne kankrie diga. <verse eid="ACT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9" />Yegl digo, ye aglke kor heven ibo mogl, ka di atne ede, yegl dugwa, Na taragl ta erme mawagl paikrume diga i, ene mawagl pame dikro! dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10" />Ana na God bogl ka di ikne ikne edubuglka i, ege suota na dimere di pai moglko, God ama dumere di pai moglko, yegl mere dubuglka. Ege suota ka yegl di kodubuglko, lap podo ikra ya taragl kane kane atne meglkwa i, aglke ede ikne kamun mitna ibo ogo, kaniwe di, Pita yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11" />Ana Pita ka yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Lap ikra aglke ede ikne kamun mitna ibo ogo, kan moglko, yagl suota na doko u yugu ta na paimara i plau digwa. Yagl ta ye na moglmara unaiglmedi dedugo, ye dumo Sisaria kide kodidre, ede u na moglmara wigwa. <verse eid="ACT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12" />U na moglmara wigo, God Murubuglo na di nare, yegl dugwa, Ene kinan suo yekre, yagl suota i bogl akie ede pio dugwa. Yegl dugwa pre na agrama 6-pela nono erme akie munga i bogl akie ede pi yagl ta ye yoba suota dedugo, pi no agre yeigwa i kipamara ede yugugl omniwe dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13" />Ana Pita yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, No ede yugugl omgo, yugu nem ye yagl suota i dedugo, no agre yuigwa i no di noro, yegl dugwa, angelo ta ye kipamara plau didre, ka ta di tomere i, no di norukwa. Angelo ye ka yegl di narume dugwa, Ene yoba tau dedin, ye ede pi dumo Jopa pidre, yagl ta kagie Saimon Pita we digwa i agre yu ene motnga unaiglmiwe dume dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14" />Agre yuibi, yagl Pita i ere mogl, God ene ya ene nen agiglnma siragl mere ere inabuka i, kamo i ene di tenan, praiglmiwe di, angelo yegl dumiwe di, yugu nem no yegl di norume di, Pita yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15" />Ana Pita ka yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Yugu nem yagl i ka yegl di kodugo, na ere mogl, God kamo tau ye di teiga. Tau di teiga ba na ka tau di ede suna eigo, God Murubuglo okna ibo nono munara umere mere kuno yegl, ede atne u ye meglmara umiwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16" />Ugo, na kandre, Yagl Kade Jisas ka ta okna dugwa i poglo di prika. Ye yegl dugwa, Jon yoba ake nigl atne ede, nigl bugl togwa, ba God kogon pere ta erabuka i, ye Murubuglomo ene tenabiwe di, ka yegl dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17" />Ana nono okna Yagl Kade Jisas, God Kere Yugwa Yagl i pre medungo, God Murubuglo yoko kaima nono norumere kuno yegl mere, ye ere mogl, yoba i ama togwa. Yegl pre na yoba i yugobuno pere meglmedi God mane di tenaglka ta kuno erekrumiwe di, Pita yegl dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18" />Pita ka yegl di kodugo, yoba okna Pita ka teigwa ikra prisre, ye ka i kide kodo, God kagie kade te, yegl digwa, God ye yoba Juda yoba moglkrikwa ba yugobuno pere ta meglkwa i ama nomane kor idre, aimadi kamin kor moraiglmedi prukwa pamiwe di, yegl digwa.<verse eid="ACT 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dumo Antiok yoba tau mere Jisas pre mediglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19" />Ana okna yoba ere mogl, yagl Stiven i si goglsre, te Jisas pre mediglkwa yoba mudu ere kide ere teigwa pre ye teke ede bage bage eigwa. Tau ede pi distrik Fonisia eigo, tau dumo ta mudi nigl suna yogwa, Saiprus we dimara i eigo, tau ama ede taun ta Antiok we dimara i eigwa. Ye ede bage bage yegl pidre, Juda yoba ta bage bage meglkwa i keme Jisas kamo di te wan meglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20" />Yegl erikwa ba Jisas pre mediglkwa yoba tau dumo Saiprus ya Sairini nem meglkwa i ede pi taun Antiok ikra pidre, Juda yoba meglkwa i keme Jisas kamo di tekrikwa ba yoba yugobuno pere meglkwa i ama Yagl Kade Jisas kamo i di teigwa. <verse eid="ACT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21" />Di teigo, Yagl Kade yobuglo podo ere, yoba Jisas kamo di teigwa i ake ple di togo, yoba tau mere nomane kor idre, Yagl Kade Jisas pre mediglkwa.<verse eid="ACT 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22" />Ana yoba tau mere dumo Antiok meglkwa i ye Jisas pre mediglkwa. Ye Jisas pre mediglkwa i, ka wai dugo, Jisas yugobunomo Jerusalem meglkwa i ama prikwa. Prisre, ye yagl ta Barnabas we digwa ikra ede Antiok pi kanabedi dedigo, ogwa. <verse eid="ACT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23" />Ye ede pi dumo Antiok pidre, kanugwa i, God ye Jisas pre mediglkwa yoba dumo i meglkwa i ake ple di te, ye ere wakai ere togwa. Ye ere wakai ere togo, yagl Barnabas ikra kandre, gun yei, yoba i deno muduno mina si gigle di tedre, te ye ege ege deno muduno bogl Yagl Kade pre medigl pai moraiglmedi di togwa. <verse eid="ACT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24" />Yagl Barnabas i, ye yagl wakai ta moglko, God Murubuglo ye moglmara kau si moglkwa. Te, ye pre meduglkwa ama gigle dugwa. Yegl eruko, ye dumo Antiok suna i yoba kor tau ama Jisas kamo di togo, yoba mere kide ka dugwa i prisre, Yagl Kade Jisas pre mediglkwa.<verse eid="ACT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25" />Ana Barnabas ere mogl, ye dumo Antiok i kide kodo, yagl Sol ikra dokinagledi ede Tarsus ogwa. <verse eid="ACT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26" />Ye pi Tarsus pidre, yagl Sol ikra doko kan yugwa. Ye doko kan yugo, ye akie ede ikne u dumo Antiok ubrika. Yagl suo Barnabas ya Sol ede Antiok udre, ye Jisas yugobunomo dumo Antiok meglkwa i bogl ege ege makai si meglko, yagl suo i bugla yugu swara mere yegl yoba mere ka mabuno di tebrika. Yegl eribriko, yoba tau ere mogl, Jisas nagiglema i kagno Kristen we digwa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kagno Kristen we digwa mem paugwa i, Krais Yobama mere yegl digwa. Te, Krais we digwa i, nono ka yoko mina God Kere Yugwa Yagl we dumga.</char></note> Kagno Kristen we di yeigwa i, dumo Antiok i mabuno bogl yeigwa.<verse eid="ACT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27" />Ana igne i God kamo kep yoba tau dumo Jerusalem kide kodo, ede u dumo Antiok wigwa. <verse eid="ACT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28" />Ana ka kep yagl swara ta kagie Agabus we digwa i, ye ere mogl, yoba makai si meglmara suna i adigl moglsre, God Murubuglo ye ka di tomere i ka kep ere di, Kidan podo ta ka kaima dumo mudu uglo koglo koglo yenabiwe dugwa. Ye ka kep ere dugwa i, Rom yoba ta kagie Klodius we digwa i king moglkwa igne, ka dugwa i, plau dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29" />Ana Agabus ka kep ere, yegl dugwa pre Jisas nagiglema dumo Antiok meglkwa i prisre, ye agroma abaroma pre mediglkwa yoba tau distrik Judia meglkwa i kidan pai dinaiglmedi pre, ye swara swarade yoba ake ple dinaiglkwa kuno erabere mige i makai sidre, ye tenamnedi ka di padiglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30" />Ka yegl di padiglsre, ye dimere ere, mige yu makai sidre, Barnabas ya Sol tedre, i pi tenabredi dedigo, ye i pi Jisas pre mediglkwa yoba distrik Judia suna meglmara i yoba tau ye suglno meglkwa i tebrika.<verse eid="ACT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12" />
  <para style="s">Herot ere mogl, Jems si goglsre, Pita si kane sugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1" />Ana igne i king Herot ere mogl, yoba tau Jisas yugobunomo mina meglkwa i ere kide ere tenagledi prisre, ye si kane sugwa. <verse eid="ACT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2" />Ye si kane sidre, soldiamo tau di togo, ye ere mogl, Jisas duglo boglkwa yagl ta Jon agigle Jems ikra ye bainet wagle si geglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3" />Si geglko, Juda yoba meglkwa i ye digo prisre, wakai prikwa. Ana Herot soldiamo ye Jems si geglko, Juda yoba wakai prikwa i, Herot kandre, ye aglke kor wakai praiglmedi Pita ama si kane sugwa. Ye Pita si kane sugwa igne i ege kade Juda yoba bret yis edekre, gagl neigwa ege ikra yogwa. <verse eid="ACT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4" />Ege i yogo, Herot ye Pita si kane si i pi kane yugu edidre, soldia 16-pela buno di i bage 4-pela ede, ye sugl moraiglmedi dedugwa. Soldia 4-pela komono kana ye sugl mogl ede ebi, egeno dudinan, 4-pela kor u sugl meglbi, yegl aimadi ere moraiglmedi dedugwa. Herot prukwa i, ye Pita sugl mogl ebi, ege kade God okna ibo ye Israel yoba oglo sidre, ede pi Isip yoba wano komono si goglkwa ege yogwa i dudinan, Herot ye i meda ede, yoba gumuglnomugl kot ere tenagledi prukwa. <verse eid="ACT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5" />Yegl pre ye Pita si kane si i pi kane yugu edugo, pai moglkwa. Pita ye kane yugu pai moglkwa ba God yugobunomo meglkwa i ye deno muduno bogl God ye Pita ake ple di tenabedi kamage ere meglkwa.<verse eid="ACT 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Angelo ta u, Pita kane yugu pamara i meda edugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Peter and John released from prison" file="C097 bw NT.tif" size="span" copy="New Tribes Mission" ref="12.6" />Ana tagna Herot ye Pita i meda ede, kot ere tenabuka paugo, eduer i Pita ye sen suo ogo koglo koglo kogl, ikne i pi soldia suo ogono mina koglo koglo kogl padiglko, ye soldia suo i miurara suna mogl, ugl pai moglkwa. Te, soldia suo ama dua meda Pita kane yugu pamara sugl miurka. <verse eid="ACT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7" />Soldia yegl ere, Pita sugl meglko, Yagl Kade angelomo ta Pita kane yugu pai moglmara i oglade u plau dugo, kane yugu abuglage sugwa. Abuglage sugo, angelo i ye ere mogl, Pita dagigle wagle sidre, uglo yokugwa. Uglo yokidre, ye di te, Ene tabre adiglo dugwa. Dugo, sen suo ye ogo mina koglo koglo kogl padiglkwa ikra, yene poko, yage atne sibrika. <verse eid="ACT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8" />Yage atne sibriko, angelo i aglke kor di te, yegl dugwa, Ene kumaglnen dedre, kagln towo i edo dugwa. Dugo, Pita ye dumere erukwa. Yegl eruko, angelo ye ama di te, Ene ir gaglnen olto i, edidre, na enaglmara moknamugl wo! dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9" />Dugo, Pita ye kane yugu kide kodo, angelo omara moko mina ogwa ba ye kaima obugledi prikrukwa. Ye prukwa i, Na ugl kubu kanie di prukwa. <verse eid="ACT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10" />Yegl pre moglko, ye angelo bogl akie ede ebrika. Ye soldia ta yugu sugl moglkwa i ya te, soldia ta ama moglmara i kide kodo, kuri ta ede ido pidre, kane yugu togl dua ain mina ere padiglkwa pamara i ebrika. Togl dua i mina ede meda pi ede taun suna enaiglkwa yogwa. Ana ye ede pi togl dua yomara ebriko, dua i yene yauruko, Pita ye angelo bogl ede meda pidre, konbauna yomara ede ebrika. Ede pi konbauna nogagle yomara plau dibriko, angelo oglade Pita kide kodo, ede ogwa.<verse eid="ACT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11" />Ana Pita ere mogl, siragl taragl ye moglmara plau dugwa i ka kaima plau dugwa pamedi kan pogl sidre, yegl dugwa, Erme ka kaima na pre pogl siga i, Herot na ake gi dinan, Juda yoba ere kide ere naramnedi prikwa i, God ye ere dinaiglmedi ye angelomo dedidre, na ere yumiwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12" />Ye prukwa i, God kaima yegl erumedi pre pogl sidre, yagl ta kagie Jon Mak we digwa i, mam Maria kipamara enagledi ogwa. Yugu i mina Jisas pre mediglkwa yoba mere yugugl akie makai si mogl, kamage ere meglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13" />Ana Pita ede u yugu yomara meda kra togl dra mina udre, togl dra mina si kegigle dugwa. Si kegigle dugo, nigl kogon abai ta kagie Roda we digwa i, yoba ira umedi kanagledi ede togl dra mina ogwa. <verse eid="ACT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14" />Ye togl dra mina ogo, Pita ka ta dugo, abai i prisre, Pita umedi pre, gun podo yogwa. Ye gun podo yomara i, dua yauranabuka i kina yogo, ye muku di ede ikne yugugl pidre, yoba makai si meglkwa i di te, Pita u togl dra mina adigl moglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15" />Abai i yegl dugwa ba yoba makai sigwa i ere mogl, ye di ikne ede te, Ene du etniwe digwa. Yegl digwa ba ye ka digwa i prikre, Pita ka kaima umiwe di, ka yegl di pai moglkwa. Yegl di pai moglko, yoba makai sigwa i ere mogl, God angelomo ta ye Pita suglmo moglkwa i ugo, abai i kanda kanumiwe di, yegl digwa.<verse eid="ACT 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16" />Ana yoba yugugl makai sigwa i ka yegl di meglko, Pita aimadi meda mogl, togl dra mina si kegigle di moglkwa. Si kegigle di moglko, yoba u togl dra yaursre, Pita adigl moglko, kanigwa. Kandre, nagino keglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17" />Ye nagino keglkwa ba Pita ere mogl, ye ka dikraiglmedi ogo wermane ere, Yagl Kade ye siragl mere kane yugu kide kodinabedi ere, agre i ede meda ogwa i, boglo si togwa. Boglo si te kodidre, ye ama di te, yegl dugwa, Na ka diga i, ene Jems ta i ya nono agroma abaroma tau di teo didre, ye yugu i kide kodo, ede bage ta ogwa.<verse eid="ACT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18" />Ana tagugo i we, soldia tau kane yugu sugl meglkwa i, Pita pai moglkrumedi kandre, nagino podo kogl, nomane podo kide sigwa. <verse eid="ACT 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19" />Nomane podo sigo, king Herot ere mogl, ye soldia tau Pita dokinaiglmedi di togo, dokigwa. Ye Pita dokigwa ba kankrikwa. Kankrikwa pre Herot ere mogl, soldia tau Pita sugl meglkwa ikra kira pogl prisre, yoba tau soldia i ye si goraiglmedi di togwa. Herot yegl ersre, ye distrik Judia kide kodo, ede pi taun Sisaria moglkwa.<verse eid="ACT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Herot goglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20" />Ana igne i Herot ye dem kubro, yoba taun suo Tair ya Saidon meglkwa i togwa. Yegl erukwa pre yoba kade tau dumo suo i meglkwa i, u swara pi mogl, Herot bogl deno muduno swara yenamnedi ye moglmara eigwa. Ye komono kana pi yagl ta kagie Blastus we digwa, Herot nigl kogonmo yagl ta moglkwa i, di prikwa. Yagl i ye Herot mogl pai erumara i sugl moglkwa. Yoba i u ye no ake ple di norabedi kina sigo, yagl i pra we dugwa. Pra we dugo, ye mudu Herot moglmara pidre, deno muduno swara yenamnedi prumne digwa. Ye ka yegl digwa i, i siragl pre, yoba dumo suo Tair ya Saidon kipai meglkwa i, ye kaya mokna Herot dumo sugl moglmara paugwa i, ege ege topo si neigwa pre ye kaya mokna topo si nenamga konbo i Herot si kegl di dinabedi prisre, yegl digwa.<verse eid="ACT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21" />Ana Herot ye ere mogl, ege swara ta yoba ikra bogl makai sinamnedi di padiglsre, ege i ye king kugugl gagl wakai yogwa i edidre, sia king mina ame di mogl, yoba i ka di te moglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22" />Ka di te moglko, yoba ye kamo prikwa i ere mogl, ye gun yenabedi ka podo didre, Yagl ka di norukwa i, yoba yoko ta moglkrume digwa. Ye god ta moglmiwe di, ka podo di, yegl digwa. <verse eid="ACT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23" />Yegl di meglko, Herot yoba ka digwa i mane dikre, God kagie kade tekrukwa pre Yagl Kade angelomo ta u ye dem toki kau sinaiglmedi eruko, dem toki kau si, ye dem kane neigo, ye kuri ta mogl, goglkwa.<verse eid="ACT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24" />Ana Herot gogl dudugwa ba God kamo dudukrukwa. God kamo pare wai dugo, yoba tau mere prisre, pre mediglkwa.<verse eid="ACT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25" />Ana Barnabas ya Sol, ye mige i pi Jerusalem yoba tenabugledi yubrika ikra, te kodidre, aglke ede ikne Antiok enabugledi ede ebrika. Ye ede ikne Antiok enabugledi ebrika igne i ye yagl ta kagie Jon Mak we digwa i akie ede enamnedi agre idre, ede ebrika.<verse eid="ACT 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13" />
  <para style="s">Barnabas ya Sol kere i pere edigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1" />Ana Jisas yugobunomo dumo Antiok meglmara suna i, ka kep yoba ya ka mabuno beke teigwa yoba tau meglkwa. Ye kagno, Barnabas, ya Simeon yoba ye kagie ta Niger we digwa i, ya te taun Sairini nem ta moglkwa kagie Lusius we digwa i, ya Sol, ya te Manaim we digwa. Yagl Manaim i, ye yagl kade ta Herot we digwa, ye okna distrik Galili ya ki sugl moglkwa i, ye yagl kunamo kunamo miurka. Ye gak miurka igne akie mogl, yakibrika. <verse eid="ACT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2" />Ana ka kep yoba ya ka mabuno beke teigwa yoba dumo Antiok meglkwa i, ye aglke ta kaya mokna mawagl ersre, Yagl Kade kagie kade te, ere meglko, God Murubuglo ye di te, yegl dugwa, Ene meglmara suna i na Barnabas ya Sol kogon ta erabredi kere iga pre ene tau ere mogl, ye dedibi, na kogona erabriwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3" />Yegl dugwa pre yagl wagle i kaya mokna mawagl ere, kamage erikwa i, dudugo, ye Barnabas ya Sol God kogon dedumara i, ye pi erabrika pre ogono i pi yagl suo i akidre, ye dedigwa.<verse eid="ACT 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Barnabas ya Sol ede Saiprus pidre, yoba Jisas kamo di tebrika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4-5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4-5" />Ana God Murubuglo yagl wagle i yegl di togo, ye yagl suo Barnabas ya Sol dedigwa. Dedigo, ebriko, yagl Jon Mak we digwa i, ye ake ple di tenagledi ye ebrara mokono koglko, akie dumo Antiok kide kodo, ede eigwa. Ye akie ede pi taun ta nigle bina yogwa, kagie Selusia we dimara i pidre, sip idre, ede pi dumo ta mudi nigl suna yogwa, kagie Saiprus we dimara i eigwa. Ede Saiprus pidre, taun ta Saiprus suna i yogwa, kagie Salamis we dimara i plau didre, ye Juda yoba tau taun i kipai meglkwa i, ka mabuno yugu kei yeimara wan u ikne ikne eigo, yagl suo Barnabas ya Sol yoba ka mabuno yugu swara swarade meglkwa i God kamo di tebrika.<verse eid="ACT 13:4-5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6" />Ana ye dumo Saiprus suna i wan u ikne ikne pidre, ede pi taun ta ama Saiprus suna yogwa i, kagie Pafos we dimara eigwa. Ana taun i eigwa igne i Juda yagl ta kagie Barjisas we digwa dumo igle moglko, kanigwa. Yagl Barjisas i, ye kumo giai yagl moglsre, ka kibi di, God kamo kep yoba ta mole dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7" />Te, yagl i ye ama dumo Saiprus bitno moglkwa yagle, ye kagie Sergius Polus we digwa i, kogonmo ere togwa yagl ta moglkwa pre ye ege ege akie miurka. Ana Sergius Polus i, ye nomane podo paugwa yagle moglkwa. Ye ere mogl, God kamo pragledi Barnabas ya Sol agle dugo, ebrika. <verse eid="ACT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8" />Ye ede yugugl ebriko, kumo giai yagl ikra ama moglkwa. Yagl i kagie ka Grik wagle Elimas we digwa. Ana ye ere mogl, yagl suo i ka dikrabredi mane di tedre, ama Saiprus bitno yagl ikra Jisas kamo prisre, pre medigl dinabedi mane dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9" />Ana kumo giai yagl i yagl suo ka dinabrika i si kegl dinagledi erukwa ba yagl Sol, kagie ta Pol we digwa i, God Murubuglo ye moglmara kau si moglko, ye Elimas moglmara toro kan gigle gogl, <verse eid="ACT 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10" />yegl dugwa, Ene we, Satan gagigle ta motniwe dugwa. Ene ka kibi kane kane di, yoba bakagl tedre, te ene mabuno wakai ya mabuno du kudano ikne motniwe dugwa. Te, Yagl Kade kamo du kaima yogwa i, ene idre, ake yake make te motnga i, ene aunake mabuno yegl kide kodinatne? di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11" />Pol yegl didre, ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Ene pro! God ene erme ere kide ere tenabiwe dugwa. Ye ene gumugln kin yenabedi eran, ene ege tau mim mogl, ade abuglage sinabuka i ta kankratniwe dugwa. Yegl dugo, yagl i gumuglo mina taragl ta kamun kua kama mere yegl ta sidre, gumuglo si kegl dugwa mere yegl eruko, ye taragl swara ta kankrukwa. Kanrukwa pre ye yoba ta na ogona akenaiglmedi agaga di wan moglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12" />Yegl eruko, dumo Saiprus bitno yagle Sergius Polus ikra we, ye kandre, Sol ya Barnabas ye Yagl Kade Jisas kamo di tebrika i prisre, nagie kogl, Jisas kamo pre meduglkwa.<verse eid="ACT 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Barnabas ya Pol dumo Antiok ta, distrik Pisidia suna yomara i pidre, yoba Jisas kamo di tebrika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13" />Ana Pol yogo, Barnabas ya Jon Mak yebriko, ye taun ta Pafos we digwa, Saiprus suna i yogwa kide kodo, sip mina ede pi provins ta Pamfilia we dimara eigwa. Pidre, taun suna i ta yogwa, Perga we dimara i, eigwa. Eigwa ba Jon Mak ere mogl, yagl suo i kide kodo, aglke ede ikne Jerusalem ogwa.<figure style="fig" alt="Map - Paul's first journey" file="Map_Paul 1_Kuman.jpg" size="span" loc="13.13-43" copy="FMOsoft" ref="13.13" /> <verse eid="ACT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14" />Ede ikne ogo, Pol ya Barnabas ye suo keme ere mogl, dumo Perga i kide kodo, ede pi taun ta distrik Pisidia suna yogwa, ama Antiok we dimara i, ebrika. Pi plau didre, wakan kade yogwa igne ye ede pi Juda yoba ka mabuno yugu kei yeimara ede yugugl pi, yugugl i ame di miurka.<verse eid="ACT 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15" />Ana Pol ya Barnabas ye Juda yoba ka mabuno yugu kei yeimara i, yugugl pi, ame di miurko, yagl ta God lomo okna Moses boglkwa i tau kere tedre, te God kamo kep yoba okna beglkwa i tau yoba makai si meglkwa i kere togwa. Kere kodugo, ka mabuno yugu yoba bitno meglkwa i yoba ta dedigo, yoba i, pi yagl suo i di tedre, yegl dugwa, Agra suo, ene ka tau di, yoba deno muduno mina si gigle di tenabrika ta panan, diro dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16" />Ana yagl i u yegl dugo, Pol adiglsre, yoba ka di dinaiglmedi ogo wermane ere, yegl dugwa, Ene Israel yoba meglkwa i ya, yoba meda meglkwa ba God kuduglmo geglkwa ta moraiglkwa i, prio dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17" />Nono Israel yoba Godno i okna ibo ere mogl, nono kowano awano ye yobama moraiglmedi kere idre, te ye dumo Isip meglkwa igne ye ede u mere kide enaiglmedi erume dugwa. Yegl ersre, ye ama yobuglo podo kaima ere, ye dumo Isip kide kodinaiglmedi agre i ede meda omiwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18" />Agre i ede meda ogo, ye bugla yugu 40-pela mere dumo wau yomara wan meglkwa. Dumo wau yomara wan meglkwa igne i ye ege mere kide God kamo prikre, sedigwa ba God ye suglno mogl pai moglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19" />Ana God ye dumo wau yomara Israel yoba suglno moglsre, aglke ye agre i ede pi dumo Kenan suna pidre, dumo Kenan suna i, makan nem yoba yugobuno 7-pela meglkwa i mudu si dudu kodo, ye makano mudu yubu si, Israel yoba makano aimadi yenabedi tomiwe dugwa. Nono kowano awano ede pi dumo Isip eigwa igne, ya te Isip mogl, aglke ede u Kenan igwa ege i, i swara ede bugla yugu 450 mere ede ogwa. <verse eid="ACT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20" />Ana Israel yoba dumo makan i kodigo, God ere mogl, yagl kade pere pere ye king moglkraiglkwa ba Israel yoba suglno moraiglmedi kere i pere edugo, meglme dugwa. Israel suglno yoba i mogl eigo, eigo, okuo kaima ime God ye kamo kep yoba ta kagie Samuel we digwa i, Israel yoba suglno yoba meglmere yegl ta morabedi kere yugo, Samuel ye Israel suglno yoba okuo kaima moglmiwe di, Pol yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21" />Ana Pol yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, God kamo kep yoba Samuel i moglkwa igne, nono kowano awano God di te, Yoba ta no kingno morabuka pre noro! digwa. Yegl digo, God ere mogl, yagl Sol ye kingno morabedi kere yume dugwa. Sol i, ye yagl ta kagie Kis we digwa i wam moglsre, Benjamin yugobunomo mina ugwa. God ye king morabedi kere i pere edugo, Sol bugla yugu 40-pela mere king moglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22" />Ana God ye Sol king morabedi ere edugo, ye king moglko, okuo God ye Sol king moglkrabedi mane didre, Devit ye king morabedi kere yume dugwa. Ye Devit kere idre, ye pre ka ta yegl dugwa, Na Devit, yagl Jesi wam kaniga i, ye mabuno wakai kanimere duglo boglko, kaniga. Te, na ye siragl ta erabedi praglka i, ye mudu erabiwe di, God yegl dume di, Pol yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23" />Ana Pol ka yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, God ye Devit king morabedi ere edugo, moglko, God ka kaima ta ama di te paduglme dugwa. Ye Devit gawamo ta okuo unabuka i, Israel yoba ere inabedi di te paduglkwa. Ana erme we, ye ka kaima ta okna ibo di te paduglkwa i, i nogugl edugo, nono munara kade plau dume dugwa. God ye Devit gawamo ta Israel yoba ere inabedi dedugo, u kodugwa. Yoba i na Jisas pre diwe di, Pol yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24" />Ana Jisas u mabuno bogl kogon eragledi erukwa i, yagl Jon komono kana u Israel yoba mudu di te, ye nomane kor idre, nigl buraiglmedi di togo, Jisas okuo kogon erume dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25" />Te, Jon we, ye Jisas pre ka nogugl dume dugwa. Ye kogonmo mudu ere kodinagledi erukwa igne, ye ege mere yoba di pre, Na ira moglmedi prime? dugwa. Na God Kere Yugwa Yagle i ta moglkrika. Ta manugwa. Ba Yagl ta na moknamugl unabuka i, ye God Kere Yuwa Yagl moglkwa. Ye yagl wakai kaima moglkwa pre na niglmo kogonmo yoba mere mogl, ye kagle towo kan pokinaglka i, ta kuno erekrumiwe di, Jon ye Jisas pre ka yegl dume di, Pol yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26" />Ana Pol ka yegl di kodidre, ka tau ama di te, yegl dugwa, Agrama wagle, ene Abraham gawama meglkwa i ya te, Juda yoba moglkrikwa ba God kuduglmo geglkwa yoba meglkwa i, ene prio dugwa. God nono ere inabuka kamo i, nono pramga pre dedumiwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27" />Jerusalem yoba ye yobano kade bogl Jisas si goramnedi ka di keglkwa i, ye God nono ere inabuka kamo i pai inabuka pre erime dugwa. Jerusalem yoba i ye Jisas ira moglkwa i, ye ta pre kan erekrikwa. Te, ye wakan kade igne ege ege God kamo kep yoba ka okna beglkwa i kerikwa ba ye ka i ama pre pogl sikrime dugwa. Ye ka i pre pogl sikre, ye Jisas si goramnedi ka di keglkwa ba ye ka kep yoba okna beglkwa i, pai inabuka pre erime dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28" />Ye Jisas aglau podo ta eran, Rom yoba di tomun, ye si goraiglmedi prisre, Jisas aglaumo dokigwa ba ye aglau swara ta eruko, kankrikwa. Ta kankrikwa ba ye mabuno ta paikrumara yagl Pailat i ye si gorabedi di priko, ye si goglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29" />Ana yoba Jisas si geglkwa i, ka kep yoba okna yoba yegl eraiglmedi, bogl atne edimere i, ye mudu ersre, Jisas ede prak mina sidre, si geglkwa. Si geglko, yoba tau ye ogo nagie ede prak mina i atne edidre, i pi kobuglo mur yeimiwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30" />Ye kobuglo mur yeigwa ba God ye ere i kor edugo, ye adigl u kor ogwa. <verse eid="ACT 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31" />Ye adigl u kor pidre, ye duglo beglkwa yoba okna ye bogl akie distrik Galili kide kodo, ede Jerusalem wigwa i meglmara ege tau plau dugwa. Plau didre, ege olto dagl makandigle wan moglmiwe dugwa. Yegl erukwa pre Jisas duglo beglkwa yoba i ye erme Jisas kamo idre, yoba di te wan meglmiwe di, Pol yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32-33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32-33" />Ana Pol yegl didre, ka tau ama yegl dugwa, No erme ka wakai ta ene di tomniwe dugwa. God ye Jisas ere i kor edugwa i, ye okna nono kowano awano ka kaima di te paduglkwa i, nono erme munara i, ere noro kodumiwe dugwa. Ana Jisas goglko, God ye ere i kor edugwa i, kuno erukwa. I siragl pre buk Giglage, numa 2 mina okna beglkwa pamiwe dugwa, God ere mogl, ye Kere Yugwa Yagl i di te,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:32-33">Ene na Wana motnga pre Na Wana motnga i, erme i nogugl ediwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.32-33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 2.7</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 13:32-33">di, ye Jisas ere i kor edenabuka pre yegl dugo, beglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 13:32-33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34" />Ana erme we, God ye Jisas ere i kor ede kodugwa pre ye aglke kor ta goran, ogo nagie ta buglkrabiwe dugwa. Yegl ta erekrabuka pre God okna ye Wam yegl di tomiwe dugwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:34">Okna na nana Devit ere wakai ere tenaluwe diga i, ene mina na dimere ka kaima mudu ere tenaluwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aisaia 55.3</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 13:34">dume di, Pol yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35" />Te, God kamo bage ta, Devit ye God Wam dra idre, yegl boglme dugwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:35">Na ene kogonen erabedi na i pere edingo, moglka i, na ogona gagna maugl sinaiglkwa ba maugl sinaiglmara i ta buglkrabiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 16.10</char></note> dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36" />Ana Devit ka yegl boglkwa i, yene pre ta dikrukwa. I siragl pre Devit okna ibo goglko, ye ogo nagie buglkwa. Ye kunama bogl meglmara suna i, God ye Devit kogon erabedi prumere i, Devit ye ere kodidre, goglkwa. Goglko, yoba ye kowane awamo kobuglo mur yeimere mere yegl, ye ama Devit kobuglo mur yeigo, ye ogo nagie buglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37" />Yegl erukwa ba Yagl ta erme God ere i kor edugwa i, ye ogo nagie ta buglkrume di, Pol yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38" />Ana Pol yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Na agrama wagle, Jisas goglsre, adigl u kor ogwa pre ene prio! dugwa. No ene di tomga i, Jisas kogon erukwa i mina God ene tadaglmeno gugl edenabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39" />Jisas kogon erumara i, yoba ta ye pre mediglbi, God ye tadaglmeno mudu gugl edidre, yoba du meglmedi kanabuka. Ene ere mogl, Moses lo norukwa i duglo boramnedi erikwa i, God ene yoba du meglmedi kankrukwa. Te, lo duglo boramnedi erimara i, God ene tadaglmeno ta gugl edekrukwa. Ba ye Jisas swara kogon erumara i mina ene tadaglmeno gugl edenabiwe, di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 13:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40" />Ana Jisas kogon erumara swara i mina God ene tadaglmeno gugl edenabuka paugwa pre ene kan kun erio! dugwa. Ene Jisas pre mediglkribi, God kamo kep yoba okna beglkwa i, ene meglmara plau dinabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41" />God yegl dugwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:41">Ene prio! Ene na kana pre mediglkre, na gauglna erikwa meglkwa i, na yubun podo ene tebo, ene kan, nagino kogl, goraiglmiwa! Ene kor mogl, wan meglmara suna i, na taragl podo ere, yubun podo kide ene tenaluwa. Na yubun podo ene tenaglka i, yoba ta ene boglo kugl tenabuka ba ene ka kibi dumedi praiglmiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Habakuk 1.5</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 13:41">di, God yegl dume di, Pol yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 13:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42" />Ana Pol ka yegl di kodugo, ye Barnabas bogl ka mabuno yugu kide kodo, ede meda enabugledi eribrika. Ede meda enabugledi eribriko, yoba ere mogl, Pol ka dugwa i wakai pre, ye kamage yei, wakan kade ta ka kor u di noratnedi di te meglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43" />Di te kodigo, ye ka mabuno yugu kide kodo, ede meda eigwa. Eigo, Juda yoba mere yeigo, te Juda yoba ta moglkrikwa ba ye Juda yoba mabunono pamere duglo bogl, God kuduglmo geglkwa yoba i ama tau mere Pol ya Barnabas ebrara sika si eigwa. Eigo, Pol ya Barnabas ye di te, God nono mitno gogl, yoko kaima nono ere yugwa, pre mediglkwa i, ake gi di moraiglmedi ka tau di, ake gigle di tebrika.<verse eid="ACT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44" />Ana wakan kade ta yogo, yoba dumo Antiok kipai meglkwa tau mere kide u Pol ye Yagl Kade kamo dinan pramnedi wigwa. <verse eid="ACT 13:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45" />Wigo, Juda yoba ere mogl, yoba mere kide wigwa i kandre, ye deno muduno mina Pol ya Barnabas kide pre tedre, Pol kenaglmo sidre, ye ka dugwa i kibi dumiwe digwa. <verse eid="ACT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46" />Yegl digwa ba Pol ya Barnabas ye kudugl goglkre, di ikne ede te, yegl dibrika, No God kamo i ene Juda yoba komono kana di tenabuglka paugwa pre di tobuglka. Ba ene God kamo erme prakiurikwa i mina kor aimadi meglkwa i, ene inaiglkwa i kuno erekrumedi, enene i nogugl edimiwe dibrika. Ene yegl erikwa pre no erme ene kide kodo, God kamo i pi, yoba meda, Juda yoba moglkrikwa i, di tenabuglka. <verse eid="ACT 13:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47" />Yoba yugobuno pere pere God kamo di tenabuglka i, kuno erume dibrika. I siragl pre God ye kamo mina no yegl di norume dibrika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:47">Na ene abuglage si, yoba meda, yugobuno pere meglmara i tenatnedi dedidre, Na yoba ere inaglka ka i, ene i pi yoba mudu uglo koglo koglo di tenatnedi dediwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.47 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aisaia 49.6</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 13:47">di, God ka dugwa i, no ama pre dumiwe di, Pol ya Barnabas yegl dibrika.<verse eid="ACT 13:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48" />Ana Pol ya Barnabas ka yegl di kodibriko, Juda yoba ta moglkrikwa ba yugobuno pere u ye ka dibrika pre meglkwa i, gun yedre, Yagl Kade kamo i wakai yomiwe di, pre i mitna edigwa. Te, God yoba ta aimadi kamin kor moraiglmedi kere i pere edugwa i, ye Jisas pre mediglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49" />Ye Jisas pre mediglko, te Yagl Kade kamo i ama distrik ta meglmara suna i mudu wai dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 13:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50" />Ana Yagl Kade kamo pare wai dugo, Juda yoba tau ye Jisas pre mediglkrikwa i ere mogl, yoba kade dumo Antiok meglkwa i ya te, abu kade tau Juda yoba ka mabuno primere prikwa i meglmara pidre, yoba kade i ye Pol ya Barnabas ere kide ere tenaiglmedi kinano sigwa. Kinano sigo, yoba kade i ye Pol ya Barnabas ere kide ere tedre, distrik ta sugl meglmara i, yagl suo i mogl dinabredi si pi meda edigwa. <verse eid="ACT 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51" />Yegl erikwa pre Pol ya Barnabas ye mabuno kide erikwa i, i nogugl edenabugledi makan gaba kaglno wagle moglkwa tama bagl ede, dumo i kide kodo, ede pi dumo Aikoniam we dimara ebrika. <verse eid="ACT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52" />Ye ede ebrika ba Jisas nagiglema dumo Antiok meglkwa i, God Murubuglo ye meglmara si kau si togo, ye gun podo yei meglkwa.<verse eid="ACT 13:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14" />
  <para style="s">Pol Barnabas bogl dumo Aikoniam Jisas kamo di tebrika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1" />Ana Pol ya Barnabas ede pi dumo Aikoniam pi mogl, wakan kade igne ye Juda yoba ka mabuno yugu kei yeimara yugugl pidre, yoba God kamo pramnedi makai si meglkwa i, ye God kamo di tebrika. Ye God kamo dibrika i, wakai kaima dibrika pre yoba mere kide, Juda yoba ya yoba pere tau suna mogl, prikwa i pre mediglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2" />Yoba mere kide pre mediglkwa ba Juda yoba tau ye Pol ya Barnabas ka dibrika i prisre, pre medrakiurikwa. Pre medrakiuro, ye ede meda pi Aikoniam yoba makan nem meglmara i kinano sidre, pre mediglkwa yoba ta meglkwa i deno kubro tenaiglmedi kinano sigwa. Kinano sigo, ye deno kubro pre mediglkwa yoba teigwa. <verse eid="ACT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3" />Yegl erikwa ba yagl suo Pol ya Barnabas dumo Aikoniam i ege olto mogl, kudugl goglkre, Yagl Kade yobuglo mina medigl moglsre, yoba ka mabuno di te pai miurka.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 14:3">Ana Pol ya Barnabas ye Yagl Kade yoba yoko kaima ere yugwa ka i, di te miurko, Yagl Kade ye ka dibrika i, yoba kaima dibredi praiglkwa pre ye kimagl tau erabredi yobuglo togo, eribrika. <verse eid="ACT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4" />Yegl eribrika ba yoba mudu dumo Aikoniam kipai meglkwa i we, ye nomano pere pere yogwa. Yoba tau Juda yoba ye kinano sigwa ikra prikwa i, Juda yoba i kaima dimedi priko, te yoba tau Jisas dedugwa yoba suo kano prikwa i, ye yagl suo i kaima dibredi priko, yegl erikwa. <verse eid="ACT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5" />Yegl eriko, Juda yoba ye yoba kinano sigwa ikra yeigo, makan nem yoba tau yeigo, ye yobano kade bogl akie u makai sidre, ka di kogl, yagl suo i ere kide ere tedre, kobuglo si, ye si goramniwe digwa. <verse eid="ACT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6" />Si goramniwe digwa ba yoba ta prisre, pi Pol ya Barnabas di togo, ye teke ede pi distrik Likonia pidre, ede taun suo Listra ya Derbe yebrara i pidre, ede dumo kebra kebra taun suo i magigl yeimara i, pi wan mogl, <verse eid="ACT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7" />Jisas kamo wakai i, yoba di te wan miurka.<verse eid="ACT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pol ya Barnabas ede dumo Listra ebrika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8-9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8-9" />Ana aglke ta Pol ya Barnabas ye wan ede pi taun Listra suna ebriko, Pol ere mogl, yoba ka mabuno di te moglkwa. Ye di te moglko, yagl kagle mawa sugwa ta ama suna i mogl, Pol ka dugwa i pre moglkwa. Yagl i, ye mam kugl edumara kagle mawa sugo, ye ege swara ta konbauna wan kankrukwa. Ye Pol ka dugwa i pre moglko, Pol ye kanugwa. Kandre, yagl i Yagl Kade ye kagle ere wakai erabuka kuno erabedi pre meduglkwa mere kandre, <verse eid="ACT 14:8-9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10" />ye ka muglkude di, yegl dugwa, Ene adiglo! dugo, ye si puglo di, tabre kaima adiglsre, konbauna ede ogwa.<verse eid="ACT 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11" />Ana Pol ye yagl kagle mawa sugwa i ere wakai ere togo, Likonia yoba i, mere kide kan meglkwa. Likonia yoba i kandre, yene kano pamere ka kade di, yegl digwa, Nono godno erme u yoba mere yegl pidre, ede atne u nono munara ubriwe di, yegl digwa. <verse eid="ACT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12" />Yegl didre, Barnabas ye god ta Sus we digwa i moglme didre, te Pol ka tau mere dugwa pre ye god ta Hermes we digwa i moglme digwa. <verse eid="ACT 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13" />Ana taun Listra bina i, god Sus i tawa teigwa yugu ta yogwa. Yegl pre yoba i ere mogl, yagl suo i ye godno suo i miuriwe digo, yagl ta god Sus tawa te, te erukwa yagle moglkwa i, ye yoba bogl akie tawa gagl, yagl suo i tenamnedi prikwa. Yegl prikwa pre tawa togwa yagl i, ye pi kau kumugl tau kane kogl idre, eken gagl tenamnedi taragl kwie tau kan mina din edigwa i idre, ede u togl dra yoba ede taun suna pi pi erimara i, ugwa.<verse eid="ACT 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14" />Ana yoba yegl ere, Pol ya Barnabas tawa gagl tenamnedi erikwa ba okuo yagl suo i ye yoba erikwa i pre kan ere, mane didre, ye kide pribrika i nogugl edenabugledi gaglno suna ake argla dibrika. Gaglno suna ake argla didre, yoba makai si meglmara suna i tabre u ikne ikne pi, ka podo di, <verse eid="ACT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15" />yegl dibrika, Yagl wagle, ene siragl pre yegl erime? Kodio! dibrika. No muglka i, ene yoba meglmere yegl, muluwe dibrika. No ene ka mabuno wakai di tedre, ene god kibi pre mediglkwa i kide kodo, God kaima kor moglkwa i ene pre medraiglkwa pre di tobuglka. God kaima pre dubuglka i, ye kamun mitna ya kamun atne ya mudi nigl ya te, taragl mudu kamun mitna ya atne ya mudi nigl paigwa ya meglkwa i ye ere yomiwe dibrika.<verse eid="ACT 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16" />Ana Pol ya Barnabas ka yegl didre, ama yegl dibrika, Okna yoba yugobuno pere pere ta mogl, siragl mere ta eramnedi prikwa i okna God ye eraiglmedi kanige erukwa. <verse eid="ACT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17" />Ye kanige erukwa ba igne i, yoba ye God kaima ta moglmedi praiglkwa pre God siragl kane kane te pai moglmiwe dibrika. Ye kamun sinabedi dedidre, kaya mokna yene egeno pere pere mina bogl yenaiglmedi ersre, ene kaya mokna mere ne, gun yenaiglmedi ere te pai moglmiwe di, Pol ya Barnabas ka yegl dibrika. <verse eid="ACT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18" />Ye ka yegl dibrika ba Listra yoba i nomano gigle dugo, tawa gagl tenamnedi pre pai meglkwa pre Pol ya Barnabas ka tau mere ama didre, ye Tawa gagl norokrio! di mane di pai miurka. Mane di gigle dibrika pre yoba i tawa gagl tekrikwa.<verse eid="ACT 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19" />Ana okuo Juda yoba tau taun suo Antiok ya Aikoniam kide kodo, ede taun Listra suna i udre, yoba ye deno kubro Pol tenaiglmedi yoba kinano sigwa. Ye kinano sigo, Listra yoba Pol deno kubro teigo, ye Juda yoba i bogl Pol kobuglo si, si goramnedi ere sigwa. Ye ere sidre, si gunedi pre, ye gudu i pi taun meda edigwa, pai moglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20" />Pai moglkwa ba Jisas nagiglema u Pol pai moglmara mogl winabo di kan meglko, Pol aduglkwa. Ye adiglsre, ede taun suna pi eduer ugl pai, tagugo i ye aduglko, ye Barnabas bogl dumo i kide kodo ede pi dumo Derbe ebrika.<verse eid="ACT 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pol Baranabas bogl wan pi Jisas pre mediglkwa yoba deno muduno si gi di tebrika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21" />Ana Pol ya Barnabas ye ede dumo Derbe pi moglsre, Jisas kamo wakai i yoba di te miurko, yoba tau mere pre, Jisas pre medigl, u ye nagiglema meglkwa. Meglko, ye aglke dumo i kide kodo, ede ikne pi Listra ya Aikoniam ya Antiok pidre, <verse eid="ACT 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22" />Jisas nagiglema dumo suota meglkwa i ka tau di, ye deno muduno si gigle di tedre, ka wakai prikwa i ake gi di moraiglmedi ka di tebrika. Ka yegl di tedre, ye ama ere mogl, yegl dibrika, Nono we, yubun kane kane i, inamga keme paugwa. Yubun tau yegl idre, okuo ede pi God yoba kingno mogl, ye suglno morabara enamniwe dibrika. <verse eid="ACT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23" />Ana Pol ya Barnabas ye yoba taun suota meglkwa i ka yegl di tedre, kogon swara ta ama yegl eribrika, ye Jisas yugobunomo dumo swara ta akie makai si meglmara i, yoba tau ye suglno moraiglmedi i nogugl ede tebrika. Yegl ersre, ye kaya mokna mawagl ere, kamage ersre, Jisas pre mediglkwa yoba dumo swara ta meglkwa i, Yagl Kade Jisas ye swara bitno morabedi ogo mina yedre, ede ebrika.<verse eid="ACT 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pol ya Barnabas aglke ede ikne pi, dumo Antiok, ye komono kana miurara i ebrika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24" />Ana Pol ya Barnabas ede pi distrik Pisidia pidre, wan ede pi provins ta Pamfilia we dimara i ebrika. Pidre, suna i wan <verse eid="ACT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25" />ede pi taun Perga plau dibrika. Pi plau didre, Jisas kamo i yoba di tedre, wan ede pi mudi nigl bina taun ta Atalia we dimara ebrika. <verse eid="ACT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26" />Atalia pidre, sip mina ede ikne pi dumo Antiok, ye komono kana miurara i ebrika. Dumo Antiok i, provins Siria suna i yogwa. Okna ye dumo Antiok i miurko, Jisas pre mediglkwa yoba ere mogl, God yene wakai prumere yagl suo i ere wakai ere tenan, ye kogonmo erabredi ye God ogo mina yeigo, yagl suo i ede bage bage pi, God kogonmo i ere kodidre, ede ikne Antiok ubrika.<verse eid="ACT 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27" />Ana Pol ya Barnabas ye ede ikne dumo Antiok udre, ye Jisas yugubonomo di makai sibriko, u makai si meglkwa. Makai si meglko, Pol ya Barnabas ye wanibrara God kogon siragl mere erukwa ya te, ye konbo yauro togo, yugobuno pere pere, Juda yoba moglkrikwa i ama Jisas pre mediglkwa i, ye boglo kugl tebrika. <verse eid="ACT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28" />Boglo kugl te kodibriko, ye ege olto dumo Antiok, Jisas nagiglema bogl akie meglkwa.<verse eid="ACT 14:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15" />
  <para style="s">Jisas pre mediglkwa yoba Jerusalem makai sigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1" />Ana igne i yoba tau distrik Judia meglkwa ye ede pi dumo Antiok pidre, Jisas pre mediglkwa yoba meglmara i di te, yegl digwa, Ene Moses okna beke norumere ere, gagno puduo gagie beglbi keme God ene ere inabiwe digwa. <verse eid="ACT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2" />Yegl digwa ba Pol ya Barnabas di ikne ede, mabuno yegl ta mane dibriko, ye ka drano podo didre, nonga digwa. Yegl digwa pre Jisas pre mediglkwa yoba dumo Antiok meglkwa i ere mogl, Pol ya Barnabas yagl tau bogl dede, ye ede Jerusalem pidre, Jisas dedugwa yoba ya Jisas pre mediglkwa yoba meglmara yoba tau ye suglno meglkwa i, ye bogl akie makai si, yoba u ka digwa i, di ere wakai eraiglmedi dedigwa.<verse eid="ACT 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3" />Ana yoba Jisas yugobunomo mina meglkwa i ye yagl tau Pol ya Barnabas bogl akie enaiglmedi dedigo, ye ede eigwa. Ye pi distrik Fonisia ya Samaria suna konbauna wan eigo, Pol ya Barnabas pre mediglkwa yoba bage bage meglmara i yegl di te, Yoba meda, Juda yoba moglkrikwa i tau mere Jisas pre mediglmiwe di, di te ede ebriko, ye mudu prisre, gun podo yeigwa.<verse eid="ACT 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4" />Ana ye distrik Fonisia ya Samaria pidre, wan ede pi Jerusalem plau digwa. Jerusalem plau digo, Jisas dedugwa yoba ikra yeigo, yoba tau ye pre mediglkwa yoba suglno meglkwa i yeigo, Jisas yugobunomo mudu bogl akie ye Pol ya Barnabas ye yoba kogl idre, ubrika ikra bogl kogl kare di igwa. Yegl eriko, Pol ya Barnabas ye ka tau di te, God ye miurara kogon siragl mere erukwa i, di tebriko, pre meglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5" />Pre meglkwa ba yoba tau okna ye Farisi yoba mogl, erme Jisas pre mediglkwa i, ye meglmara suna i adiglsre, ka yegl digwa, Yoba yugobuno pere, Juda yoba moglkrikwa i, Moses lo okna norukwa i duglo boglsre, ye gagno puduo gagie boraiglkwa pamiwe digwa.<verse eid="ACT 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6" />Ana yoba tau ka yegl digwa pre Jisas dedugwa yoba yeigo, pre mediglkwa yoba suglno meglkwa i bogl, ye ka i di pramnedi pere makai sigwa. <verse eid="ACT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7" />Makai sidre, ka i drano di, ka olto di meglko, Pita ye meglmara suna i adigl mogl, yoba makai si meglkwa i ka yegl di togwa, Agrama wagle, nono munara suna i, God okna na kere i pere edugwa i, ene pre kan erime dugwa. Ye na kere i pere edugwa i, na yoba yugobuno pere, Juda yoba moglkrikwa i Jisas kamo wakai yogwa i di tebo, ye pre medraiglmedi na kere i pere edume dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8" />Na Jisas kamo i, yoba yugobuno pere meglkwa i di teigo, God, ye yoba mudu deno muduno suna kan pogl sugwa i, ye Murubuglomo norumere kuno yegl mere ye ama tomiwe dugwa. Ye Murubuglomo tomara i, ye nono wakai kanumere yegl, yoba i ama wakai kanugwa i, i nogugl edumiwe di, Pita yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9" />Ana Pita ka yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, God nono Juda yoba munga i mabuno pere ta ere norsre, yugobuno pere meglkwa i mabuno pere ta ere te, yegl ta erekrume dugwa. Yoba yugobuno pere meda meglkwa i ye Jisas pre mediglko, God nono ere norumere kuno yegl ye tadaglmeno gugl ede tedre, ye deno muduno pe si yomedi kanugwa. <verse eid="ACT 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10" />Yegl erukwa pre ene Jisas nagiglema meglkwa i, siragl pre lo duglo boraiglkwa pame dime? dugwa. Ene siragl pre ye yubun podo yegl tenamnedi prime? dugwa. Nono kowano awano yeigo, nono erme munga i yomgo, God lomo duglo boramnedi erumga ba kuno ta erekrukwa. God konbo pere ta obuno di noro kodugwa pre ene siragl pre ye konbauna si norukwa i mane didre, God dem kubrabedi erime? dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11" />Nono pre medunga i, Yagl Kade Jisas nono yoko kaima ere idre, yoba yugobuno pere meglkwa i ama kuno yegl ere, yoko kaima ere yumiwe di, Pita yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12" />Ana Pita ka yegl di kodugo, yoba ka ta di ikne edekrikwa. Yegl eruko, Barnabas ya Pol ere mogl, ye yoba makai si meglkwa i di te, God ye yobuglo togo, ye kimagl ya diu kane kane yoba yugobuno pere pere meglmara eribrika i, di tebriko, yoba i mudu prikwa.<verse eid="ACT 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13" />Ana Barnabas ya Pol ka yegl di kodibriko, yagl ta Jems we digwa i, yegl dugwa, Agrama wagle, na ka ta erme dinaglka i, ene prio! dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14" />Saimon Pita nono erme di norukwa i, God yene komono kana ere mogl, yoba yugobuno pere, Juda yoba moglkrikwa i dem muduo tedre, ye meglmara suna i yoba tau ye yobama moraiglmedi ere yugwa i pre di noro kodumiwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15" />Ana Pita ka dugwa i ya God kamo kep yoba okna ibo ka beglkwa i mudu u swara omiwe dugwa. Ye ka yegl beglkwa,<verse eid="ACT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16" />Devit yugobunomo, Israel yoba i, ye sel yugu ta kide ere, yage sugwa mere yegl meglme dugwa. Ba nana okuo ede ikne u sel yugu kide erukwa i ere wakai ersre, kor kenaglka. <verse eid="ACT 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17" />Na sel yugu kor kenaglka i, yoba mudu uglo koglo koglo meglkwa i na doko kanaiglkwa pre eraglka. Yoba yugobuno pere pere meda meglmara i na ye yobanama moraiglmedi agle diga i pre diwe di, <verse eid="ACT 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18" />Yagl Kade yegl dugwa. Ye okna kaima ibo, taragl yegl plau dinabedi i nogugl edumiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amos 9.11-12</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 15:18">di, God kamo kep yoba okna yegl beglme di, Jems yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19" />Ana Jems ka yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Pita ka dugwa i ya te ka kep yoba okna beglkwa i nogugl paugwa pre na prika i, Yoba yugobuno pere pere moglsre, ede God moglmara wigwa i, nono ye Moses lomo duglo boraiglme didre, yubun ta tekramnedi priwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20" />Yubun ta tekramga ba nono yegl eramne dugwa, Nono pepa ta bogl yoba i tedre, ye yegl di tenamga, Ye taragl mie ta yoba god kibi tawa teigwa i nekre, bormai nekre, te mie ta bormai dage pai moran, nekraiglkwa pre di tedre, te, yagl abu ta bogl kunogl nekrio! di, yegl di tenamne dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21" />I siragl pre okna kaima ibo ede u erme pra, taun mudu bage bage yeimara i, Juda yoba wakan kade igne ege ege ka mabuno yugu makai si, Moses ka boglkwa i kersre, te yoba pere di tedre, eriko, yoba mere prikwa. Yegl pre Jisas pre mediglkwa yoba mabuno ta erekrio diga i, ye ta eribi, Juda yoba ya te, yoba tau ye ka beke teigwa i kandre, kide pre dinaiglkwa pre diwe di, Jems yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jerusalem yoba makai sigwa i, pepa ta beglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22" />Ana Jems ka yegl di kodugo, Jisas dedugwa yoba yeigo, pre mediglkwa yoba suglno tau meglkwa i yeigo, Jisas yugobunomo mudu meglkwa i ama makai si mogl, ye yoba suo ye meglmara suna i kere idre, dedumun, ye Pol ya Barnabas bogl akie ede dumo Antiok enaiglme digwa. Yegl didre, ye meglmara suna i, yagl suo ede okna ebrika i kere idre, dedigwa. Yagl ta kagie Judas we digwa. Te, ye kagie ta ama Barsabas we digwa. Te, yagl ta kere igwa i, kagie Sailas we digwa.<verse eid="ACT 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23" />Ana yoba Jerusalem makai sigwa i ye yagl suo Judas ya Sailas kere idre, ye Pol ya Barnabas bogl akie enaiglmedi dedidre, pepa ta ye i pi tenaiglmedi bogl teigwa. Ye pepa i mina yegl beglkwa, No Jisas dedugwa yoba munga i, ya te pre mediglkwa yoba suglno munga i, no ene agroma munga. No pepa i ene bogl tomga i, No ene yoba yugobuno pere pere moglsre, Jisas pre mediglkwa dumo Antiok ya provins suo Siria ya Silisia meglkwa i, wakai we di tomga.<verse eid="ACT 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24" />No prumga i, yoba tau no munara kide kodo, ede u ene meglmara udre, ka tau didre, ene deno muduno ere kide ere, ene nomano sinaiglmedi ka di teigwa i, prumga. Prumga ba no yoba i ka yegl dinaiglmedi di tekunga. Ye yene primere digwa. <verse eid="ACT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25" />Yegl pre no makai si mogl, yagl suo kere idre, ye Barnabas ya Pol, no deno muduno suna miurka i, ye bogl akie pi, ene meglmara enaiglmedi dedumga. <verse eid="ACT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26" />Barnabas ya Pol i, ye nono Yaglno Kade Jisas, God Kere Yugwa Yagl moglkwa i, ye pre gorabrika i pre mitna edekre, kogonmo ere pai miurka. <verse eid="ACT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27" />Ana no yagl suo Judas ya Sailas dedumga i, ye no ka bunere mere yegl aglke kor drano mina ene di tebr, ene praiglkwa pre dedumga.<verse eid="ACT 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28" />God Murubuglo no obuno di noruko, no prumga i, no ene God lomo duglo boraiglkwa pame dumun, yubunde panabuka ba no yubun yegl tenamga kuno ta erekrukwa. Yubun yegl ta tekramga ba ene taragl suom ta eraiglkwa paugwa i, <verse eid="ACT 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29" />ene mie ta god kibi tawa tenaiglkwa i nekre, bormai ta nekre, te mie ta bormai dage pai moran, nekraiglkwa paugwa, te, yagl abu ta bogl kunogl nekraiglkwa paugwa. Ene mabuno yegl eribi, wakai panabuka. Ana wakai we di tomniwe di, pepa mina yegl beglkwa.<verse eid="ACT 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30" />Ana ye yagl 4-pela pepa beglkwa ikra tedre, dedigo, ye ede eigwa. Ye ede pi dumo Antiok plau didre, Jisas pre mediglkwa yoba ikra mudu digo, u makai sigwa. Mudu makai sigo, ye pepa ikra teigwa. <verse eid="ACT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31" />Teigo, yoba u makai sigwa i pepa ikra kersre, kere kanigwa i, ye deno muduno wida dinabuka ka yegl di beglko, kere kandre, gun podo yeigwa. <verse eid="ACT 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32" />Kere kan, gun yeigo, yagl suo Judas ya Sailas i, ye ama God kamo kep yoba ta miurka pre ye Jisas pre mediglkwa yoba u makai si meglkwa i ka olto di te, ye deno muduno si gigle di tedre, kiano wagle yobuglo inaiglmedi ka di tebrika. <verse eid="ACT 15:32" /><verse number="33-34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33-34" />Yegl esre, ye ege olto dagl dumo Antiok mogl pai miurko, okuo pre mediglkwa yoba ere mogl, ye di wakai yei tedre, dedigo, ye aglke ede ikne pi Jerusalem yoba ye okna dedigwa i meglmara ede ikne ebrika. <verse eid="ACT 15:33-34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35" />Ede ikne ebriko, Pol ya Barnabas ye dumo Antiok mogl pai mogl, yoba tau mere bogl akie Yagl Kade kamo i yoba di te moglsre, beke tedre, erikwa.<verse eid="ACT 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pol ya Barnabas ede pere pere ebrika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36" />Ana okuo Pol ere mogl, Barnabas di te, yegl dugwa, Nono erme wan ede pi taun pere pere Yagl Kade kamo okna di tobuglara mudu pidre, nono pre mediglkwa yoba wakai meglmo mo moglkrimo mo i wan kanabugledi priwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37" />Yegl dugo, Barnabas pra we didre, yagl ta kagie Jon Mak we digwa ikra auro idre, enabugledi prie dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38" />Yegl dugwa ba Pol mane di prisre, yegl dugwa, Nono okna kogon akie ere ede pi provins ta Pamfilia we dimara omgo, ye no kodo, ede ikne ugwa. Yegl pre ye bogl akie pikramniwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39" />Yegl dugo, ye Barnabas bogl ka tau didre, nonga podo dibrika. Nonga podo didre, pra ede pere pere ebrika. Barnabas ye yagl Mak i agre yugo, ye sip mina ede dumo ta mudi nigl suna yogwa, Saiprus we dimara i ebrika. <verse eid="ACT 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40" />Te, Pol ye yagl Sailas ikra ye bogl akie enabugledi kere yugwa. Kere yugo, Jisas pre mediglkwa yoba ere mogl, Yagl Kade yene wakai prumere yagl suo i suglno morabedi kamage ere, Yagl Kade ogo mina yedre, dedigo, ye ede ebrika. <verse eid="ACT 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41" />Ye ede pi provins suo Siria ya Silisia, Pol okna enagledi prie dumara i suna wan ede ebriko, Pol ye Jisas yugobunomo provins suo i suna meglkwa i deno muduno si gigle di tedre, pre mediglkwa si gigle di tedre, erukwa.<verse eid="ACT 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16" />
  <para style="s">Timoti ye Pol ya Sailas bogl akie ede eigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1" />Ana Pol ya Sailas ye konbauna wan ede pi dumo Derbe pidre, aglke wan ede pi dumo Listra we dimara ebrika. Dumo Listra ebriko, Jisas nagigle ta moglkwa, kagie Timoti we digwa. Ye mam Juda abu ta moglsre, Jisas pre meduglkwa ba ye nem Grik yagl ta moglka. <verse eid="ACT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2" />Jisas pre mediglkwa yoba dumo Listra ya Aikoniam meglkwa i, yagl Timoti mabunomo kandre, yagl wakai ta moglmedi kanigwa.<figure style="fig" alt="Map - Paul's second journey" file="Map_Paul 2_Kuman.jpg" size="span" loc="16.1-15" copy="FMOsoft" ref="16.2" /> <verse eid="ACT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3" />Ana Pol ye yagl Timoti i kandre, akie wanamnedi prukwa. Yegl prisre, gagie puduo gagie bogl togwa. I siragl pre Juda yoba dumo magigl kipai meglkwa i, Timoti nem ye Juda yoba moglkre, Grik yagl ta moglmedi pre kan erikwa. Pre kan eriko, Pol prukwa i, ye Juda yoba mabunono pamere yegl ta duglo boglkran, ye ka dinabuka i, Juda yoba ta prikraiglkwa mere yegl paugo, Juda yoba mabunono pamere duglo bogl, gagie puduo gagie bogl togwa.<verse eid="ACT 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4" />Ana Pol yegl eruko, Pol ya Sailas ye yagl Timoti agre idre, ye wan ede pi taun pere pere pidre, yoba dumo pere pere meglkwa i, ka di tedre, Jisas dedugwa yoba ya yoba tau ye Jerusalem pre mediglkwa yoba suglno meglkwa i, ye okna ere mogl, yoba yugobuno pere pere meglkwa i, ye mabuno siragl mere eraiglkwa pre pepa beglkwa ikra ka siragl mere beglkwa i di tedre, wan meglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5" />Di tedre, Jisas yugobunomo bage bage meglkwa i, ye pre mediglmara si gigle di teigo, ege ege yoba kor Jisas pre mediglsre, ede suna u pai meglkwa.<verse eid="ACT 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pol gumuglomugl eruko, dumo Masedonia nem ta kanugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6" />Ana Pol yogo, Sailas ya Timoti yebriko, ye wan pidre, provins ta Esia we dimara i suna pidre, yoba ka mabuno di tenamnedi prikwa ba God Murubuglo mane dugwa pre ye Esia suna pikre, aglke provins ta Galesia we dimara pidre, distrik ta suna i yogwa, Frigia we dimara i pidre, konbauna wan ede eigwa. <verse eid="ACT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7" />Dumo i pidre, aglke wan ede pi distrik Misia yomara bina bina wan ede pi provins ta Bitinia we dimara enamnedi eigwa. Ede Bitinia enamnedi eigwa ba Jisas Murubuglomo aglke kor mane di togwa <verse eid="ACT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8" />pre ye ede distrik Misia pidre, Misia suna i, taun ta mudi nigl bina yogwa, kagie Troas we dimara plau digwa.<verse eid="ACT 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9" />Ana Pol ya Sailas ya Timoti ye ede pi Troas eigo, eduer Pol gumuglomugl ta eruko, kanugwa i, provins Masedonia nem ta moglko, kanugwa. Ye kanugwa i, Masedonia nem i adigl mogl, Pol moglmara ka giglede di te, yegl dugwa, Ene ede koglo Masedonia provins udre, ake ple di noro! dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10" />Yegl dugo, Pol kandre, ye gumuglomugl siragl mere eruko, kanugwa i, di norukwa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yagl suota i, ede Troas eigwa igne, Luk ye bogl akie dumo Troas meglkwa. Yegl pre ye Pol gumuglomugl eruko, di togwa i, Luk akie meglkwa pre Luk ka boglkwa i, No we di, yegl dugwa.</char></note> Di noruko, no prumga i, God no Jisas kamo i pi Masedonia yoba i di tenaiglmedi no dedugwa pamedi prisre, no tabre ede enamnedi erumga.<verse eid="ACT 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lidia ye Jisas pre meduglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11" />Ana no prumga, God no Jisas kamo Masedonia yoba di tenamga pre no dedumedi prisre, no dumo Troas kide kodo, sip mina ede pi provins Masedonia enamnedi omga. No sip mina omgo, sip i ake dudi, ede pi dumo kebra ta mudi nigl suna yogwa, kagie Samotres we dimara i ogwa. Ogo, no dumo igle pai, taganamogl adigl, aglke kor sip mina ede pi provins Masedonia suna i, taun ta mudi nigl bina yomara kagie Neapolis we dimara i omga. <verse eid="ACT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12" />Sip no i pi igle edugo, no makandigle wan ede pi taun ta Filipai we dimara omga. Taun Filipai i, Rom yoba okna u buro yeigo, Filipai i dumo kade ta Masedonia suna i yogwa. No ede Filipai pidre, ege tau Filipai suna i pai, wan munga.<verse eid="ACT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13" />No ede pi dumo Filipai pidre, pai mungo, wakan kade yogwa. Wakan kade yogwa pre no taun suna i kide kodo, togl dra yomara ede meda omga. Ede taun meda pidre, ede pi nigle bina ta omga. I siragl pre no prumga i, dumo igle Juda yoba ka mabuno yugu ta kei yeigwa yeikrukwa pre yoba ye God kamage ere tenaiglkwa i, nigle bina makai sidre, kamage ere tenaiglkwa mere yegl paugwa pre no omga. Omgo, abu tau u nigle bina i makai si meglko, kanumga. No kandre, ye meglmara omgo, akie ame di munga. Ame di mungo, no ye ka tau di tomga. <verse eid="ACT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14" />Ana abu makai si meglmara suna i, abu ta moglkwa, ye kagie Lidia we digwa. Abu Lidia i, ye dumo Taiataira mam ta moglkwa. Ye ege ege lap gogl tau ere yu, topo bogl nogwa abu ta moglkwa. Te, ye ama God kagie kade tedre, kamage erukwa abu moglkwa. Ana no abu wagle i ka di tomgo, abu Lidia i pre moglkwa. Pre moglko, Yagl Kade ye Pol ka dugwa i abu i pre medrabedi dem muduo mina kogon eruko, ye pre meduglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15" />Pre meduglko, ye yobama yugu swara paigwa i mudu nigl biglko, ana abu i no di noro, yegl dugwa, Ene na Yagl Kade pre meduglkwa abu ta moglmedi kanibi, ene na kipaimara wibi, panamniwe dugwa. Ka giglede yegl dugwa pre no pi ye kipamara pamga.<verse eid="ACT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pol ya Sailas dumo Filipai kane yugu edigo, miurka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16" />Ana aglke ta, no kor ede pi nigle bina kamage erimara ikra omga. Omgo, nigl kogon abai ta murubuglo kide ye moglmara suna moglkwa i no kanugwa. Abai i, murubuglo kide ye moglmara suna mogl, siragl tau okuo plau dinabuka i di togo, abai i, ege ege di nogugl edugwa. Abai i kogon yegl eruko, ye suglmo meglkwa yoba mige podo abai kogon erumara i, ege ege yoba ye topo teigo, i neigwa. <verse eid="ACT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17" />Ana abai i no kandre, no Pol bogl omnara i sika sugwa. Sika sidre, ka podo di, yegl di moglkwa, Yagl wagle i, ye God Mogl Mitna Kaima Edugwa i niglmo kogonmo yoba moglsre, God ye yoba siragl mere ere inabuka i, ene yoba magigl meglkwa i di teimiwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18" />Yegl didre, ege tau mere ama ye no wamnara sika sugwa. Sika sidre, ka yegl keme dugwa pre Pol oglka kide eruko, kan ake te, yegl dugwa, Ene murubuglo kide, abai i moglmara suna motnga i, na Jisas, God Kere Yugwa Yagl i, dra idre, ene di teiga, ene abai moglmara kide kodo, ede meda wo! dugwa. Yegl dugo, murubuglo kide i abai moglmara suna moglkwa i, tabre ede meda ugwa.<verse eid="ACT 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19" />Ana murubuglo kide ta abai i moglmara kide kodo, ede meda ogo, yoba abai i suglmo meglkwa ikra kanigwa, abai i taragl okuo plau dinabuka di poglko, yoba mige noriko, no i ne ne erumga i, okuo ta i nekramga pamedi kandre, ye pi Pol ya Sailas si ake gi di mogl, gudu i pi taun suna, yoba makai si, maket erimara dumo pidre, i pi jas kade suo gumanomugl edigwa. <verse eid="ACT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20" />Edidre, ye jas suo i di te, yegl digwa, Yagl suo i, Juda yoba moglsre, nono tauno mina yoba deno muduno ere kide ersre, <verse eid="ACT 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21" />Te, ye mabuno kor tau nono Rom yoba idre, duglo boramga mane pamara i, ye yoba di te wan miuriwe digwa. <verse eid="ACT 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22" />Yegl digo, yoba makai si mogl, prikwa i mudu ere mogl, Pol ya Sailas ere sinamnedi eriko, jas suo i ere mogl, yoba tau Pol ya Sailas kuguglno gaglno gugl ede, kuba sinaiglmedi dedebriko, <verse eid="ACT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23" />ye kuguglno gaglno gugl ede, yagl suo i tau ege mere kuba mina ere sigwa. Ere sidre, ye si i pi kane yugu ede, yagl ta kane yugu sugl moglkwa i ye suglno wakai morabedi dedigwa. <verse eid="ACT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24" />Dedigo, kane yugu sugl moglkwa yagl i ere mogl, Pol ya Sailas i pi kane yugu suna wom iyo ta yomara edidre, ede paglkane ta idre, kaglno ede waiglmara suna padigl, si gi di, sen mina kane sugwa.<verse eid="ACT 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25" />Ana kane yugu sugl moglkwa yagl ikra Pol ya Sailas si kane si paduglko, ye pai miurka. Pai mogl ebriko, eduer suna yagl suo ye God kagie kade tenabugledi giglage didre, kamage eribriko, yoba kane paigwa i pre meglkwa.<figure style="fig" alt="Paul and Silas in stocks" file="cn02132b.tif" size="col" loc="16.25" copy="David C Cook" ref="16.25" /> <verse eid="ACT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26" />Pre meglko, imem podo kide ta tabre udre, kane yugu ikra ake piga di, kane yugu keimara kobuglo tau mabunomugl bogl padiglkwa i ake piga dugo, kane yugu dua mudu yauruko, ama kane yoba sen mina mudu kane sigwa i, sen mudu pirka sugwa. <verse eid="ACT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27" />Yegl eruko, kane yugu sugl moglkwa yagl ikra nagie kogl, adigl, kanugwa i, kane yugu dua mudu yoko yogwa. Ye prukwa i, kane yoba mudu teke ede meda pi, ede eimedi prisre, ye yoba kade wagle yoba gumuglnomugl na si gogl dinaiglmedi yene wi si goragledi ere, ye bainetmo i meda edugwa. <verse eid="ACT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28" />Yegl erukwa ba Pol ere mogl, ka podo di, yegl dugwa, Ene enene si goglkro! No kane yoba mudu yoko muniwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29" />Yegl dugo, kane yugu sugl moglkwa yagl i yoba ta ken gagl yunaiglmedi agle dugwa. Agle dugwa, ken gagl yuigo, ye ken idre, muku di ede pi Pol ya Sailas miurara pidre, kudugl gogl, nagie nuglo didre, ye gumanomugl yage goglko boduglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30" />Yegl ersre, ye Pol ya Sailas agre i meda udre, ye di pre, yegl dugwa, Yagl suo, na siragl mere eribo, God na ere inabe? di, yegl di prukwa.<verse eid="ACT 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31" />Kane yugu sugl moglkwa yagl i yegl di, kira pogl pruko, Pol ya Sailas ye di te, yegl dibrika, Ene Yagl Kade Jisas pre medigln, God ene ere inabiwe di, yegl dibrika. No dubuglka i, ene ya ene yobanma mudu ta moraiglkwa i, mudu pre medraiglkwa pre dubuluwe dibrika. <verse eid="ACT 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32" />Yegl didre, ye Yagl Kade kamo tau ama yagl i nem agiglema mudu akie magigl meglkwa i di tebrika. <verse eid="ACT 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33" />Di tebriko, eduer suna yagl i ye Pol ya Sailas agre i ede nigle pidre, ye sigwa biurara i nigl pai togwa. Nigl pai togo, yagl i nem agiglema bogl mudu tabre kana nigl biglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34" />Yegl eriko, yagl i ye Pol ya Sailas agre i ede pi ye kipamara yugugl pidre, kaya mokna tau gagl togwa. Gagl togwa nebriko, yagl ikra gun podo yogwa. Ye gun podo yogwa i siragl pre ye nem agiglema bogl mudu God pre mediglkwa pre ye gun podo yogwa.<verse eid="ACT 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35" />Ana kamun tagugo, jas kade suo ikra ye kibr nem tau dede, yagl suo Pol ya Sailas i meda edinaiglmedi dibriko, eigwa. <verse eid="ACT 16:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36" />Kibr nem wagle ye i meda edinamnedi eigo, kane yugu sugl moglkwa yagl ikra Pol di te, yegl dugwa, Jas suo ikra kibr nem ene i meda edinaiglmedi dedebriko, wigwa pre ene deno muduno wida dinan, ede meda enabriwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 16:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37" />Yegl dugwa ba Pol ye u kibr nem melgmara pidre, yegl dugwa, No Rom pabuglka dudugo, no Rom yoba muglka ba jas suo i ye no kotno prikre, mane pamara ersre, ege mere kide yoba gumuglnomugl yoba tau no kuba sinaiglmedi dedebriko, no sidre, i pi kane yugu edigwa pre ye erme ugl mage ere, no di bage ta edekrabriwe dugwa. Yegl pre ye yene udre, no i meda ede edibr, kuno erabuka pre ene pi di teo! di, Pol kibr nem wagle ikra yegl di togwa.<verse eid="ACT 16:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38" />Ana Pol ka yegl di, kibr nem wagle ikra togo, kibr nem ye Pol kamo i pi jas kade suo ikra di teigwa. Di teigo, jas kade suo ikra ye Rom yoba miurka pai dumedi prisre, ye aglau erubugledi kudugl gogl, <verse eid="ACT 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39" />ye yene pi Pol ya Sailas miurara pidre, ye di te, No aglau erubugliwe didre, ye i meda edibrika. I meda edidre, ye di te, yegl dibrika, Ene no dumono i moglkre, ede bage ta enabriwe di, ege mere jas suo yegl dibrika. <verse eid="ACT 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40" />Dibriko, Pol ya Sailas kane yugu kide kodo ede udre, ede pi abu Lidia ikra kipamara ebrika. Ebriko, Jisas pre mediglkwa yoba dumo Filipai meglkwa i u makai sigo, Pol ya Sailas ye pre mediglkwa i si gigle di tenabugledi ka tau dibrika. Yegl ere kodibriko, ye Timoti bogl dumo Filipai kide kodo, ede eigwa.<verse eid="ACT 16:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17" />
  <para style="s">Pol ya Sailas ede dumo Tesalonaika ebrika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1" />Ana Pol ya Sailas ye Filipai kide kodidre, konbauna wan ede pi taun ta Amfipolis we dimara pidre, dumo i kide kodo, wan ede pi taun ta Apolonia we dimara ebrika. Pidre, aglke kor dumo i kide kodo, ede pi taun ta Tesalonaika we dimara ebrika. Tesalonaika i, Juda yoba ka mabuno yugu ta kei yeigwa yogwa. <verse eid="ACT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2" />Ana ye ede Tesalonaika ebriko, okna Pol dumo bage bage pidre, wakan kade yogwa igne ye Juda yoba ka mabuno yugu kei yeimara pi, yoba ka mabuno beke te, te erumere i ere, wakan kade suota ye Tesalonaika ka mabuno yugu kei yeimara i pidre, ye yoba makai si meglkwa i God kamo di tedre, mabunomo di pogl togwa.<verse eid="ACT 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3" />Ana Pol ye Tesalonaika yoba ka mabuno di togwa i, yegl mere di togwa, ye God kamo tau bage mere God Kere Yugwa Yagl i gagie giugl prisre, gogl, aglke adigl u kor enabuka paugwa pre dugwa i didre, mabunomo di pogl togwa. Di pogl tedre, ama yegl dugwa, Na ka erme diga i, Jisas ye God Kere Yugwa Yagl i moglkwa pre diwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4" />Ana Pol ka yegl di kodugo, Juda yoba makai si meglkwa i tau ye kaima dumedi prisre, Pol ya Sailas bogl u swara eigwa. Te, Grik yoba ye God kuduglmo geglkwa i tau mere yeigo, abu kade tau mere dumo Tesalonaika meglkwa i ama pre mediglsre, Pol ya Sailas bogl u swara pi, akie meglkwa.<verse eid="ACT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5" />Ana dumo Tesalonaika i, yoba tau mere Jisas pre mediglko, ye Pol ya Sailas bogl u swara pi meglkwa ba Juda yoba tau ere mogl, yagl suo i kide kandre, deno kubro te, ye pi maket dumo, yoba makai si, si erimara pidre, yoba kide maket suna winabo di wan meglkwa i di makai sidre, te yoba tau mere taun suna meglkwa i di makai sigwa. Di makai sidre, Juda yoba i ka kane kane di, yoba i kinano sidre, deno buglo yeigwa. Deno buglo yeigo, yoba makai si meglkwa i deno kubruko, ye muku di ede pi yagl ta kagie Jeson we digwa i kipamara eigwa. Yagl Jeson kipamara i, ye Pol ya Sailas akie pai, pai erikwa pre ye yagl suo i gudu yu yoba mere meglmara gumuglnomugl unamnedi pi, dua sada bogl, ede yugugl pi kanigwa <verse eid="ACT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6" />ba yagl suo i yugugl moglkribrika. Yugugl moglkribriko, ye kanigwa, pre mediglkwa yagl tau ye yugu nem Jeson ikra bogl meglko, ye yagl wagle i yugu nem bogl gudu yu taun yobano kade tau meglmara wigwa. Udre, ye ka podo di, yegl digwa, Yagl suo ye dumo uglo koglo koglo pidre, yoba ere kide ere tebrika i, erme ede u nono dumono ama ubriwe digwa. <verse eid="ACT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7" />Ubriko, yagl Jeson magigl i, ye yagl suo i ye yugumo mina panabredi i yugugl edumiwe digwa. Te, yoba mudu gudu yumga i, ya te yagl suo i ye akie nono Rom yoba kingno lo norukwa pamere i duglo boglkre, ye kingno pere ta moglkwa, kagie Jisas we di yegl dime digwa. <verse eid="ACT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8" />Yegl digo, taun yobano kade ya yoba makai si mogl, kano prikwa i, mudu deno kubrisre, ka kane kane digwa. <verse eid="ACT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9" />Yegl eriko, yagl kade wagle i, ye Jeson ya pre mediglkwa yagl tau i ka tage te, ye topo podo ersre, ede meda enaiglmiwe di, yegl digwa. Didre, ye di te, No kan mun, ene okuo mabuno yegl aglke ta erekribi, pra topo i okuo enene ikne edinaiglmiwe di, yegl digwa. Yegl digwa pre ye dimere ere, topo podo tedre, ede meda eigwa.<verse eid="ACT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pol ya Sailas ede dumo Beria ebrika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10" />Ana Jeson ye pre mediglkwa yagl i bogl ede meda u meglkwa. Meglko, ege swara i mina eduer Jisas pre mediglkwa yoba mudu u makai sidre, Pol ya Sailas oglade dede, ede taun ta Beria we dimara enabredi dedigwa. Dedigo, Pol ya Sailas ede dumo i pidre, ede pi wakan kade igne Juda yoba ka mabuno yugu kei yeimara yugugl pidre, yoba makai si meglkwa i Jisas kamo di tebrika. <verse eid="ACT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11" />Ana Juda yoba dumo Beria meglkwa i, ye mabunono tau wakai pai, Tesalonaika yoba togwa. I siragl pre Pol ya Sailas ye Jisas kamo di tebriko, ye ka kaima pramnedi prisre, ka dibrika i kuno pamere di noribro mo di, ege ege God kamo tau yene kere kan, pre pogl sinamnedi erikwa. <verse eid="ACT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12" />Ye mabuno yegl erikwa pre ye tau mere Jisas kamo pre mediglko, te Grik abu kade tau mere ya Grik yagl tau mere ama pre mediglkwa.<verse eid="ACT 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13" />Ana Beria yoba tau mere Jisas pre mediglkwa ba Pol ye dumo Beria i mogl, God kamo di moglkwa i, yoba tau kandre, ede Tesalonaika pi Juda yoba dumo Tesalonaika meglkwa ikra di teigo, prikwa. Prisre, ye ede u dumo Beria udre, yoba mere meglmara ye kinano si, bagl nu sigwa. Yegl eriko, Beria yoba ye deno kubro Pol teigwa. <verse eid="ACT 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14" />Yegl erikwa pre Jisas pre mediglkwa yoba i ere mogl, Pol ere kide ere te dinaiglmedi Pol tabre ede mudi nigl bina enabedi dedigo, yoba tau ye agre i ede eigwa. Ye agre i ede eigwa ba Sailas ya Timoti ye dumo Beria mogl pai miurka. <verse eid="ACT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15" />Ana yoba tau Pol agre i ede mudi nigl bina pidre, ede pi taun kade ta Atens we dimara eigo, Pol ye yoba agre yeigwa i, di ikne edidre, ye yegl di togwa, Ene ede ikne pidre, yagl suo Sailas ya Timoti dedibi, tabre u na kan inabriwa di teo dugo, yagl tau Pol agre yeigwa i aglke ede ikne eigwa.<verse eid="ACT 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pol dumo Atens moglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16" />Ana Pol ye dumo Atens mogl pai mogl, yagl suo Sailas ya Timoti pre sugl moglkwa. Ye yagl suo pre sugl mogl, ye kanugwa i, Atens yoba ye god kibi mere kide beke yeigo, kanugwa. Kandre, Atens yoba ye God kaima moglkwa i pre pogl sikrimedi prisre, kide pre, dem muduo yubun dogwa. <verse eid="ACT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17" />Dem muduo yubun dogo, ye ede pi Juda yoba ka mabuno yugu kei yeimara yugugl pidre, ye God kamo tau didre, mabunomo di pogl, Juda yoba ya Grik yoba tau ye God kuduglmo geglkwa yugugl makai si meglkwa i, di pogl togwa. Yegl ersre, te, ye ege ege ede pi maket dumo, yoba wan meglmara i pidre, yoba ta suna wan meglkwa i ama God kamo tau di togwa.<verse eid="ACT 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18" />Ana Pol yoba maket erimara wan mogl, yoba ka mabuno di te moglko, yoba yugobuno suo meglkwa, ye bitno podo paugwa u Pol moglmara wigo, ye ka tau di ikne ikne ede, ka drano digwa. Yugobuno ta i kagno Epikurian we digo, te yugobuno ta meglkwa i, kagno Stoik we digwa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Epikurian ya Stoik yoba i, ye suo akie god kane kane meglmedi prikwa ba ye pre mediglsre, yoba ka beke teigwa i, pere pere paugwa. Epikurian yoba ye yoba ka beke te meglkwa i, Erme wakai mogl pai ersre, gun yenamga swara i podo pamiwe di, yegl digwa. Te, Stoik yoba ye yoba ka beke te meglkwa i, Nono mabuno wakai boglsre, kogono kane kane ta panabuka i wakai eun, swara i wakai panabiwe di, yegl digwa.</char></note> Ye wigo, Pol bogl ka drano digo, ye tau ere mogl, yegl digwa, Yagl ka gua gua dugwa i, ye erme siragl ka dinagledi ere moglme? digwa. Digo, te, yoba tau ere mogl, Ye dumo pere ta godno pre di da dumiwe digwa. I siragl pre ye Jisas pre didre, yoba goglsre, adigl u kor enaiglkwa i pre dugwa pre yoba i ka yegl ta prikrikwa pre ye yegl digwa. <verse eid="ACT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19" />Yegl digo, yugobuno suo bitno podo paugwa ikra ere mogl, Pol auro i pi muglo ta Kaunsil makai si, si erimara, kagie Areopagus we dimara i pidre, ye di pre, yegl digwa, Ene ka kor yoba di te wan motnga i, mabunomo siragl mere paugwa ene no di notn, pramniwe digwa. <verse eid="ACT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20" />I siragl pre no ka ta okna prikrumnere dinga pre no mabunomo i, pramnedi prumniwe di, yegl digwa. <verse eid="ACT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21" />Yegl digwa i, i siragl pre yoba dumo Atens makan nem meglkwa i ya te, yoba dumo bage bage mogl, ede Atens wigwa i, mabunono yegl paugwa, ye kogon ta ta erekre, ege ege ka kor yoba di tedre, te yoba kor ta ede suna u ka kor di teigwa i prisre, yegl keme erikwa.<verse eid="ACT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22" />Ana Pol ye kaunsil muglo Areopagus makai si meglmara ye suna adigl mogl, yegl dugwa, Yagl wagle, ene Atens yoba meglkwa i, ene god pere pere kagno kade te, kamage ere teigwa i, giglede eriko, kaniga. <verse eid="ACT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23" />Na ka yegl diga i, i siragl pre na taun suna koglo koglo wan mogl, ene godno kane kane bekigwa i kan wan moglsre, kobuglo bogl ta agl bugla si gogl, gagl tenamnedi kiglkwa i ama kaniga. Kobuglo bogl i mina ka yegl beglme dugwa, Kobuglo bogl i, God ta kagie pre kan erekunga pre yomiwe di, yegl beglko, kaniwe dugwa. Yegl pre na ene ka erme di tenaglka i, God ene kagie pre kan erekrikwa ba kagie kade tenamnedi erikwa i, erme ye kamo ene di tenaluwe di, Pol yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24" />Pol yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Na God ta pre diga i, ye dumo makan ere yedre, taragl mudu dumo makan mina meglkwa ya paigwa i, ere yogwa. Te, ye kamun mitna ya atne nem yagl moglkwa pre yoba yugu kei yeimara ye atne ta mogl pai erekrume dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25" />Te, God moglkwa i, yene ere mogl, nono yoba mudu kor munga i norsre, taragl mudu yumga ya nomga i ama norukwa. Yoba taragl swara ta ye tenaiglkwa i, kuno erekrukwa. I siragl pre ye taragl swara ta inabuka paikrumiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26" />God oknayene ibo yagl swara ta ere yogwa. Ana nono yoba yugobuno pere pere, uglo koglo koglo munga i, yagl swara i gawama mogl, yugobuno pere pere moraiglmedi, God yene i nogugl edumiwe dugwa. Yugobuno swarade dumo aglo mere mogl pai eraiglkwa i ye ere padiglsre, te, ege aunake yugobuno ira ede okna enaiglkwa i, ya yugobuno ira ede okuo unaiglkwa i, komono kana ere padiglsre, okuo ye i nogugl edumiwe di, Pol yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 17:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27" />Ana Pol yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, God prukwa i, ye kogon kane kane erukwa i yoba kandre, ye doko pi God ye siragl mere moglkwa i pre kan pogl sinaiglmedi prukwa. God yegl prisre, kogon kane kane ere, taragl wakai kane kane norukwa. God yoba na dokinaiglmedi prukwa ba ye dumo eglke ta moran, nono ta dokokramga. Ye ka kaima nono swarade munara i, magigl moglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28" />Nono God yegl mere moglmedi pramga i, nogugl paugwa. I siragl pre Grik yagl swara ta okna yegl boglkwa, Nono ye swara erumara i mina kor mogl, wan u ikne ikne omniwe di, yegl boglmiwe dugwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 17:28">Te, God siragl mere moglkwa pre diga i, ene Grik yoba ka beglkwa yoba meglmara suna i, swara ta okna ibo yegl boglme dugwa, Ye nono ere yogwa, muniwe di, yegl boglme dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29" />Ana God nono ere yogo, munga pre God siragl mere moglkwa i nogugl panabuka. Yoba gol mo silva mo kobuglo idre, god ta yene primere ogono mina bekigwa i, God kaima yegl mere ta moglmedi prikramniwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30" />Okna yoba ye God pre kan erekrikwa igne i God ye kanige erukwa. Yegl erukwa ba erme God yoba mudu uglo koglo koglo meglkwa i nomane kor inaiglmedi ka giglede di togwa. <verse eid="ACT 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31" />Ye yoba mudu nomane kor inaiglmedi di togwa i, i siragl pre ye ege ta padiglsre, Yagl swara ta mabuno du keme ersre, yoba mudu kotno prabedi kere i pere edume dugwa. Yagl ta yoba mudu kotno prabuka pre diga i, ye okna golko, yagl i ira moglkwa i, yoba kan pogl sinaiglmedi God ye ere i kor edumiwe di, Pol yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 17:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32" />Ana Pol ka yegl di kodugo, yoba tau ye yagl ta gogl, adigl u kor omiwe dugwa i ye prisre, gauglmo ere, ka boglo erikwa. Yoba tau yegl erikwa ba yoba tau ama Pol di te, Ka dinga i, barma kor u din, pramniwe digwa. <verse eid="ACT 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33" />Yegl digo, Pol ye meglmara kide kodo, ede meda ogwa <verse eid="ACT 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34" />ba yoba ama tau ye Pol ka dugwa pre medigl, Pol omara sika si eigwa. Yagl swara ta pre meduglkwa i, ye kagie Dionisius we digwa. Yagl i ama Kaunsil meglmara suna i moglkwa. Te, abu ta kagie Damaris ama pre meduglko, yoba tau ama pre mediglkwa.<verse eid="ACT 17:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18" />
  <para style="s">Pol ede dumo Korin ogwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1" />Ana Pol okuo dumo Atens kide kodo, ede pi taun kade ta Korin we dimara ogwa. <verse eid="ACT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2" />Ede taun Korin we dimara i ogo, Juda yagl ta kagie Akwila we digwa i ugo, tegigl yebrika. Ana yagl Akwila moglkwa i, ye dumo Pontus nem ta moglkwa, ba ye ebie bogl okna dumo Rom, kantri Itali suna yogwa i pi kipabrika. Kipabriko, Rom King ta kagie Klodius we digwa i ye Juda yoba mudu ye Rom moglkraiglmedi mane di, si meda edugo, yagl Akwila i, ebie Prisila bogl edue tagl iga terke u dumo Korin kipabrika. Ana Pol ye Akwila bogl tegigl yebriko, okuo Pol ede pi yagl abu suo i kipabrara ogwa. <verse eid="ACT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3" />Ogo, ye yugu swara pai, kogon akie erikwa. Pol ye sel yugu si boglkwa yagle moglko, yagl abu suo i ama sel yugu si biurka pre ye akie pai, kogon akie erikwa.<figure style="fig" alt="Paul making tents" file="CN01997B.TIF" size="col" loc="18.3" copy="David C Cook" ref="18.3">Pol sel yugu si bogl, mige boglkwa</figure> <verse eid="ACT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4" />Pol ye bogl akie paigo, wakan kade ege ege Pol ye ede pi Juda yoba ka mabuno yugu kei yeimara yugugl ogwa. Ogo, ye Juda yoba ya Grik yoba makai si meglkwa i bogl ka drano digo, te Pol ye mudu Jisas kamo pre medraiglmedi ka beke togwa.<verse eid="ACT 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5" />Ana Pol ye dumo Korin mogl, sel yugu si boglsre, te yoba ka mabuno di te, ere moglkwa. Yegl ere moglko, yagl suo Sailas ya Timoti ye provins ta Masedonia we dimara i moglsre, ede pi Pol moglmara ebriko, Pol ye sel yugu si boglkwa i kide kodo, ege ege yoba God kamo di te wan moglkwa. Yegl ersre, ye Juda yoba ka giglede di tedre, Jisas ye God Kere Yugwa Yagl moglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6" />Yegl dugwa ba Juda yoba ye ka dugwa i, prakiuro, ye kenaglmo sigwa. Yegl eriko, Pol ye Juda yoba mabuno kide erikwa i, i nogugl ede tenagledi ye yoba kugane tama si edimere mere yegl ye kuguglmo gaglmo mina tama bagl, ye yegl di togwa, God ene ka tage tenabuka i, na mabuno ta moglkraglka. Siragl pre na Jisas kamo i ene di teiga ba ene prakiurikwa. Yegl pre na ene Juda yoba kide kodo, yoba ye Juda yoba ta moglkrikwa ba yugobuno pere meda meglmara i, Jisas kamo di tenaluwe di, Pol yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7" />Ana Pol ye Juda yoba yegl di tedre, ye Juda ka mabuno yugu kei yeimara yoba ka beke te moglkwa ikra kide kodo, aglke ede pi yagl ta ka mabuno yugu yomara magigl kaima kipamara yoba i makai si, ka mabuno di te moglkwa. Yugu nem yagl i kagie Titius Jastus we digwa. Ye Juda yoba ta moglkrukwa ba ye God kamage ere tedre, kagie kade togwa yagl ta moglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8" />Ana Pol ye yagl i kipamara yoba ka mabuno di te moglko, Juda yoba ka mabuno yugu bitno moglkwa yagl, kagie Krispus we digwa i, ama ye yobama bogl mudu Yagl Kade Jisas kamo prisre, pre mediglkwa. Yagl i ye yobama bogl Jisas pre mediglko, te Korin yoba tau mere Jisas kamo prisre, pre medigl, nigl biglkwa.<verse eid="ACT 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9" />Ana aglke ta eduer Pol gumuglomugl eruko, Yagl Kade ye moglmara u yegl di togwa, Ene kudugl goglnga i kide kodo, yoba na kana di te pai moglo dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10" />I siragl pre na ene motnara mogl teiga. Te, dumo Korin magigl i, na yobanama mere meglkwa pre yoba swara ta ere mogl, ene si, ere kide ere tekraiglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11" />Yegl dugo, Pol ye dumo Korin bugla yugu swara ta mogl, ba 6-pela mogl tebe ede, God kamo yoba beke te moglkwa.<verse eid="ACT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12" />Ana Pol taun Korin moglkwa i, provins ta Akaia we dimara suna i yogwa. Pol mogl ede ogo, okuo yagl ta kagie Galio we digwa i ye provins Akaia i sugl moglkwa igne, Juda yoba ere mogl, nomano swara yei, Pol kot ere tenamnedi ake i pi yagl Galio i moglmara eigwa. <verse eid="ACT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13" />Agre i pidre, Juda yoba ye Galio di te, yegl digwa, Yagl Pol i ye yoba ka mabuno kor beke tekraiglmedi lo mane dugwa i sede, yoba ka kor beke tedre, ye konbo kor pere ta mina God kagie kade tenaiglmedi di te wan moglmiwe digwa. <verse eid="ACT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14" />Digo, Pol ye ka di ikne edenagledi erukwa ba yagl Galio i tabre Juda yoba di te, yegl dugwa, Ene Pol aglau podo ta erukwa pre dinaiglmo mo lo kade ta si biglke dugwa pre dibi, na ene Juda yoba kano praglka i kuno erume dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15" />Ba ene ere mogl, yoba ka beke teimara pre nonga didre, yoba kagno pre ya te enene Juda yoba lono pre nonga digwa. Yegl pre na kotno ta prikraluwe di, yegl dugwa. Ene enene pi meda ere wakai erio! di, Galio yegl dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16" />Yegl didre, ye kotno prikragledi si meda edugwa. <verse eid="ACT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17" />Si meda edugo, yoba kot eraiglkwa pramnedi makai si meglkwa i ere mogl, Juda yoba ka mabuno yugu bitno yagl, kagie Sostenes we digwa i deno kubro tedre, ake gi di mogl, yagl Galio ikra gumuglomugl ere sigwa. Ye ere sigwa ba Galio kan kor erekre, kanige erukwa.<verse eid="ACT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pol ede ikne dumo Antiok, provins Siria suna yomara i ogwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18" />Ana Pol ege olto dumo Korin moglsre, pre mediglkwa yoba di wakai yei tei, Pai molo didre, ye ede pi dumo ta mudi nigl bina yogwa, Senkria we dimara pidre, sip mina ede provins Siria, ye okna mogl ede omara i, enagledi ogwa. Pidre, ye God ka kaima ta di te paduglkwa i, ere kodugwa pre ye i nogugl edenagledi Juda yoba mabunono pamere ere, ye bre yugo guku edugwa. Bre yugo guku edugo, ye yagl Akwila ikra ebie Prisila bogl akie sip mina ede eigwa <verse eid="ACT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19" />ba ye pi dumo ta Efesus we dimara plau digo, Pol ye Akwila ebie Prisila bogl dumo Efesus morabredi kide kodo, ye swara ede pi Juda yoba ka mabuno yugu kei yeimara yugugl pidre, Juda yoba ka beke togwa. <verse eid="ACT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20" />Ka beke togo, Juda yoba ye wakai pre, Pol bogl akie ege tau moramne digwa ba Pol di ikne ede te, <verse eid="ACT 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21" />God ta unatnedi pran, na okuo ikne unaluwe dugwa. Yegl didre, ye Juda yoba dumo Efesus meglkwa i kide kodo, sip mina ede u <verse eid="ACT 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22" />dumo Sisaria plau didre, makandigle wan ede pi Jerusalem ogwa. Pidre, Jisas yugobunomo dumo Jerusalem meglkwa i kandre, di wakai yei te, aglke Jerusalem kide kodo, ede dumo Antiok, ye okna mogl, ede omara ikra ogwa.<verse eid="ACT 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23" />Ana Pol ede Antiok pi ege tau moglsre, ye aglke kor dumo i kide kodo, ede pi distrik Galesia ya Frigia ye okna Jisas kamo di te wan moglmara i wan mogl, Jisas nagiglema meglmara i wan kandre, pre mediglmara si gigle di tenagledi ka di te wan moglkwa.<verse eid="ACT 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yagl Apolos ede Efesus ogwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24" />Ana igne i Juda yagl ta kagie Apolos we digwa i ede u dumo Efesus plau dugwa. Ye dumo Aleksandria, kantri Isip nem ta moglkwa. Ye God kamo pre pogl sidre, ka kaugo sugwa yagl ta moglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25" />Komno kana yoba Jisas kamo di teigo, prisre, ye ka kaima ka i yoba beke tenagledi prisre, Jisas kamo pamere yoba di te wan moglkwa. Yegl erukwa ba ye ka swara ta di teigo, prikrukwa i, yoba ye Jisas pre mediglsre, nigl biglkwa ka i ta prikrukwa. Jon okna yoba ake nigl atne ede, nigl bugl togwa i keme ye di teigo, prukwa. <verse eid="ACT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26" />Ana yagl Apolos i ede dumo Efesus pidre, Juda yoba ka mabuno yugu kei yeimara ede yugugl pi, kudugl goglkre, Juda yoba ka beke togwa. Ka beke togo, yagl Akwila ebie Prisila bogl ama yugugl mogl, yoba ka beke togwa i pre miurka. Ana ye yoba ka beke te kodugo, yagl Akwila ebie Prisila bogl ye agre i ede bina pi, God kamo mina nomane tau ama inabedi beke tebriko, prukwa.<verse eid="ACT 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27" />Ana okuo Apolos ede pi provins ta Akaia we dimara i enagledi prukwa. Pruko, pre mediglkwa yoba dumo Efesus meglkwa i ye pra, ede Akaia enabedi di wakai yei te, dedigwa. Dedidre, te, ye pepa ta bogl, Jisas nagiglema provins Akaia meglkwa i tedre, Apolos enan, di wakai yei, kogl kare di inaiglmedi pepa bogl teigwa. Yegl eriko, Apolos ede pi provins Akaia we dimara i ogwa. Ye ede ogo, God ye ake ple di te moglko, Apolos ye kogon podo ere, Jisas pre mediglkwa yoba ake ple di togwa. <verse eid="ACT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28" />Apolos ye kogon swara ta erukwa i, ye Juda yoba bogl yoba gumuglnomugl ka drano digo, Apolos ye ka giglede dugo, yoba ka di ikne edenaiglkwa manugwa. Apolos ye Juda yoba ka kibi dime didre, ye God kamo pamere di, Jisas ye God Kere Yugwa Yagl moglmiwe di, i nogugl edugwa.<verse eid="ACT 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19" />
  <para style="s">Pol ede Efesus ogwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1" />Ana Apolos ye ede pi dumo Korin moglkwa igne, Pol provins Esia suna i, wan ede pi kamin muglo kra pidre, konbauna ta yomara ede pi dumo Efesus plau dugwa. Efesus plau didre, yagl tau tegigl yogwa. Yagl i, Jon yoba okna ye nigl bugl togwa i, kamo prisre, duglo beglkwa yagl meglkwa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ka Grik mina yagl wagle i ye duglo beglkwa yoba meglme dugwa. Ye Jon duglo beglmo mo ira duglo beglkwa i, ka bage i mina paikrukwa ba ka yoglbo i mina nogugl paugwa. Ye Jon kamo okna duglo boglsre, erme Jisas pre mediglsre, nigl biglkwa.</char></note><figure style="fig" alt="Map - Paul's Journey 3" file="Map_Paul 3_Kuman.jpg" size="span" loc="19.1-20" copy="FMOsoft" ref="19.1" /> <verse eid="ACT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2" />Pol yagl wagle i tegigl yedre, ye di pre, yegl dugwa, Ene pre mediglkwa igne, Mudu Murubuglo ene meglmara umo? dugwa. Yegl dugo, yagl wagle i di ikne ede te, yegl digwa, Ta ukrukwa. Ene Mudu Murubuglo pre dinga i, no ta pre kan erekrumniwe digwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3" />Yegl digo, Pol ye di pre, yegl dugwa, Ene ka siragl mere pre mediglsre, nigl biglme? dugwa. Yegl dugo, yagl wagle i di ikne ede te, yegl digwa, No Jon ka okna yoba di tedre, ye nigl bugl togwa i no pre mediglsre, nigl bune digwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4" />Yegl digo, Pol ye aglke kor Jisas pre medraiglmedi yegl di togwa, Yoba ta ye nomane kor idre, tadaglme yoba munedi prikwa i, Jon ake nigl atne ede, nigl bugl tome dugwa. Jon yegl ersre, ama yoba di te, Yagl ta na moknamugl unabuka i, pre medilo di, yegl dumiwe dugwa. Ye Yagl ta unabuka pre dugwa i, Jisas pre dumiwe di, Pol ka yegl dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5" />Pol yegl dugo, yagl wagle i prisre, ye Jisas erme pre meduniwe didre, ye pre mediglkwa i nogugl edinamnedi nigl biglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6" />Nigl biglko, Pol ye ogo i pi, ye pra pra akugo, Mudu Murubuglo ye meglmara ugwa. Ugo, yagl wagle i yoba kano tau pere pere pamere i didre, God kamo ka kep ere digwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7" />Yagl wagle i, ye 12-pela mere yegl meglkwa.<verse eid="ACT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8" />Ana Pol ere mogl, ede pi Juda yoba ka mabuno yugu kei yeimara pidre, kudugl goglkre, yoba meglkwa i God kingno mogl, ye suglno morabuka pre ka beke tedre, ye ka dugwa i pre medraiglmedi ka giglede dugwa. Ye ege mere pi ka mabuno yugu kei yeimara pidre, ka yegl mere beke te moglko, ba suota ede ogwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9" />Yegl erukwa ba Juda yoba tau Jisas pre medrakiuro, nomano gigle dugo, ye yoba gumuglnomugl Jisas konbauna sugwa i di kide yei, ake atne edigwa. Yegl erikwa pre Pol ere mogl, Jisas nagiglema meglkwa i, i ede pere pi yagl ta kagie Tiranus we digwa i sule yugu kei yomara yoba ege ege i makai sidre, God kamo beke te moglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10" />Ye bugla yugu suo mere yegl pai mogl, yoba ege ege ka beke te moglkwa pre yoba mudu provins Esia suna meglkwa i, Juda yoba ya yugobuno pere meglkwa i, Yagl Kade Jisas kamo prikwa.<verse eid="ACT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Agigle agigle 7-pela ye murubuglo kide ta di meda edinamnedi erikwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11" />Ana Pol dumo Efesus moglkwa igne, God ye kimagl erabedi yobuglo togo, kimagl tau podo ere moglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12" />Ere moglko, yoba kandre, ye ere mogl, lap kebra mo kogon gagl ta Pol nagie baugwa i, i pi yoba kide sigwa mo murubuglo kide ta ye meglmara suna meglkwa i nagino mina padiglko, ye kideno aragan eruko, murubuglo kide ta meglmara suna meglkwa i ama kide kodo, ede meda wigwa.<verse eid="ACT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13" />Ana Pol ye kimagl tau mere yegl ere wan moglko, Juda yoba tau ye dumo bage bage wan mogl, murubuglo kide yoba meglmara suna meglkwa di meda edinamnedi ere wan meglkwa i, ye Pol erumere ere, Yagl Kade Jisas kagie mina murubuglo kide di meda edinamnedi erikwa. Ye murubuglo kide di te, yegl digwa, No Jisas, yagl Pol kamo di te wan moglkwa i, kagie mina ede meda wo dumniwe di, yegl di wan meglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14" />Juda yoba tau yegl di wan meglko, agigle agigle 7-pela ta meglkwa i ama yegl eramnendi erikwa. Agigle agigle 7-pela i ye yagl ta kagie Skeva we digwa, ye Juda yoba tawa teigwa yoba bitno ta moglkwa i, wama meglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15" />Ana aglke ta, agigle agigle 7-pela i ere mogl, murubuglo kide ta Jisas kagie mina di meda edinamnedi eriko, murubuglo kide ye di ikne ede te, yegl dugwa, Yagl Jisas i na pre kan erika. Te, yagl Pol moglkwa i ama pre kan erika. Ba ene siragl yoba udre, na di meda edinamnedi erime? di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16" />Yegl dugo, yagl ta murubuglo kide ye moglmara suna moglkwa i muku di pi, yagl 7-pela i kuguglno gaglno ake argla di, dimede ere sugo, ye bogl, yokoko teke ede meda eigwa.<verse eid="ACT 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17" />Ana yagl ta murubuglo kide moglmara suna moglkwa ere mogl, agigle agigle 7-pela ere sugwa ka i, di ede eigo, yoba mudu dumo Efesus meglkwa, Juda yoba ya yugobuno pere meglkwa i, prikwa. Prisre, kudugl podo gogl, Yagl Kade Jisas kagie ake mina edigwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18" />Yegl eriko, te, pre mediglkwa yoba tau mere ka i prisre, ede nogugl u ye mabuno kide tau ake meglkwa i, yoba gumuglnomugl di nogugl edigwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19" /><figure style="fig" alt="Burning magic books" file="FM 210 Burning Ephesian Magic Books_6inches_BW.jpg" size="col" copy="Foundation Matters" ref="19.19" />Edigo, ye tau mere ama ka nibine didre, kumo giai erikwa i, ye ka nibine ya kumo giai erikwa buk ta yeigwa i yu makai sidre, yoba gumuglnomugl gagl tege erikwa. Ye buk gagl tege erikwa i, buk mudu i topo boglkwa kerikwa i, mige silva 50,000 borabuka mere yegl gagl tege erikwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20" />Ana taragl kane kane yegl mere dumo Efesus plau digwa pre Yagl Kade Jisas kamo pare wai dugo, yoba mere pre mediglkwa.<verse eid="ACT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Efesus yoba Pol sinamnedi erikwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21" />Ana taragl kane kane yegl dumo Efesus suna i plau dugo, okuo Pol kina gudu pre, ye ede provins suo Masedonia ya Akaia pidre, wan ede ikne Jerusalem enagledi prukwa. Yegl prisre, ye yoba di te, yegl dugwa, Na ede pi Jerusalem pidre, okuo ama wan ede pi Rom enaglka pamiwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22" />Pol yegl didre, ye yagl suo ye ake ple di tebrika, kagno Timoti ya Erastus we digwa i, komono kana dedugo, ye ede okna pi provins ta Masedonia we dimara ebrika. Ebriko, Pol ye provins Esia suna moglmara i ege sugunagle ta mogl pai moglkwa.<verse eid="ACT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23" />Ana igne i dumo Efesus, Jisas konbauna sugwa pre mediglkwa yoba meglmara yubun podo ta plau dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24" />Yubun ta plau dugwa i, yegl mere paugwa, yagl ta dumo Efesus silva idre, taragl kane kane beke, topo boglkwa, ye kagie Demitrius we digwa. Ye kogon yoba tau mere topo togo, ye akie silva idre, abu god ta moglmedi pre, kagie Artemis we digwa i, yugumo kebra kebra tau mere bekidre, topo beglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25" />Ana yagl Demitrius ere mogl, ye kogonmo yagl ya yoba tau ama silva idre, taragl kane kane bekigwa i di makai sidre, ye di te, yegl dugwa, Yagl wagle, nono silva mina taragl bekidre, mige mere i nomga i, ene pre kan erime dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26" />Ba ene ama pre kan erikwa i, yagl Pol ye dumo Efesus magigl i ya provins Esia suna dumo mere kide yoba di te, yoba ogono mina god bekigwa i, ye god kaima ta moglkrime di, yegl dugo, yoba mere ye ka kaima dumedi prisre, nomane kor imiwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27" />Yegl pre nono bisnis erumga i, yoba taragl yoko mere yomedi kanaiglkwa. Yegl pre na diwe dugwa. Te, abu kade god Artemis i, yoba provins Esia meglkwa i ya te uglo koglo koglo meglkwa i, ye kagie kade teigwa ba ye Pol ka dugwa i pribi, Artemis yugumo ama yugu yoko mere yomedi kanaiglkwa. Kanibi, abu i, kagie podo kide paugwa i, ede atne pi dinabuka pre diwe di, Demitrius yegl dugwa.<figure style="fig" alt="Burning the magic books" file="hk00286b.tif" size="col" loc="19.27" copy="Horace Knowles, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="19.27" /><verse eid="ACT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28" />Ana yagl Demitrius i ka yegl dugo, yoba kamo prikwa i deno podo kubriko, ka podo di, yegl digwa, Nono Efesus yoba godno Artemis i, kagie kade pamiwe! digwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29" />Yegl digo, ka i dumo Efesus suna i di u ikne ikne eigo, yoba mere pre, deno kubruko, ka kane kane di wan mogl, ye mudu muku di ede pi yagl suo okna Pol bogl dumo Masedonia mogl, akie wigwa, kagno Gaius ya Aristarkus we digwa i, si gudu i pi taun suna, yoba makai si meglmara suna edigwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30" />Edigo, Pol ye ama makai si meglmara ede suna pi ka tau di tenagledi prukwa ba Jisas nagiglema ye mane di teigwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31" />Te, provins Esia bitno yagl tau Pol kabaglema meglkwa i ama ka giglede dede, Pol ede suna unan, yoba ye kaima si goraiglkwa pre Pol ukrabedi, mane digwa.<verse eid="ACT 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32" />Ana yoba u makai si meglkwa ikra, ka kade di, ka kane kane digwa. Siragl pre ye u makai sigwa i, yoba tau mere mabunomo pre pogl sikrikwa pre ka kane kane digwa. Tau ka pere ta pre digo, tau ka pere ta pre digo, yegl erikwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33" />Yegl eriko, Juda yoba ye ere mogl, Juda yagl ta kagie Aleksander we digwa i, siragl pre u makai sigwa i di poran, praiglmedi ye ka do! digwa. Yegl didre, ye ake nu si, yoba gumanomugl edigwa. Edigo, yoba u makai si meglkwa i tau kandre, Mabuno siragl mere paugwa i ka do, pramniwe! digwa. Yegl digo, Aleksander ere mogl, yoba ka di meglkwa i dikraiglmedi ogo mina wermane ere, ye yoba siragl pre u makai sigwa i mabuno di nogugl edenagledi erukwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34" />Di nogugl edenagledi erukwa ba Efesus yoba kanigwa i, ye Juda yagl ta moglko, kandre, ye prikwa i, Juda yoba no godno Artemis i, kagie kade tekrikwa yoba meglmedi prisre, Efesus yoba ikra ere mogl, ye yene ka podo di, yegl di meglkwa, Nono Efesus yoba godno Artemis i, kagie kade pamiwe! di, yegl di mogl eigo, eigo, ade kwia suo mere ede ogwa.<verse eid="ACT 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35" />Ana ade kwia suo mere yoba i ka yegl di pai meglko, yagl ta ye kuskus kogon erukwa, ye dumo Efesus suna i, yoba kade, sugl meglkwa yoba ka digwa i, ye pepa mina bogl atne edidre, te di meda ede te, erukwa yagl ta moglkwa i ye adigl mogl, yoba ka di meglkwa i di te, Ka dikre, kiede molo! dugo, yoba ikra pra pra ka di meglkwa i dikre, kiede meglko, ye di te yegl dugwa, Efesus yoba, ene prio! dugwa. Nono Efesus yoba munga i, nono abu kade Artemis yugumo sugl munga, te ye kiamo okna heven ibo yei, yage makandigle sugwa ama sugl munga i, yoba mudu pre kan erime dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36" />Yegl pre yoba ta ere mogl, taragl yegl kibi yomiwe di, yegl ta dinabuka ta kuno erekrume dugwa. Yegl pre ene mabuno gua gua ta erekre, kiede molo! dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 19:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37" />Ana yagl kuskus kogon erukwa i ka yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Ene erme yagl suo si kane si yu edigwa magigl miurka i, ye nono godno Artemis i yugumo mina ye taragl swara ta kunogl nekribrika. Te, ye Artemis ta kenaglmo sikribrika. <verse eid="ACT 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38" />Yegl pre Demitrius ya yoba ye akie silva idre, taragl bekigwa yoba meglkwa i ye yagl suo i lo yegl ta paugwa si biglke dibredi ye kot ere tenaiglkwa i, konbo yogwa. Gavman yoba kade ye kotno praiglkwa ama meglmiwe dugwa. Yegl pre ye meglmara pi kot ere tenamnedi pribi, enaiglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39" />Te, nono erme ka ta dinamga panan, nono lo pamere makai sidre, dinamga. <verse eid="ACT 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40" />Ba nono erme kuda eramnedi erumga i, Rom gavman ta pribi, nono ka tage noraiglkwa pamiwe dugwa. Nono erumga i, mabuno wakai ta paikrukwa pre Rom yoba kade ta ere mogl, nono mabuno gua gua erumnara i ta no kira pogl pribi, ka wakai ta di ikne edinamga paikrumiwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41" />Efesus kuskus kogon erukwa yagl i ye yoba yegl di tedre, di pere pere edugo, ye ede pere pere eigwa.<verse eid="ACT 19:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20" />
  <para style="s">Pol ede Masedonia ya Grik kamun ogwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1" />Ana Efesus yoba u makai sidre, kuda eramnedi ka di meglko, kuskus kogon erukwa yagl ikra u, mane di togo, ye ede pere pere eigwa. Eigo, Pol ye Jisas nagiglema di makai sugo, wigwa. Wigo, Pol ye ka tau di, deno muduno si gigle di tenagledi di togwa. Didre, ye kide kodo, ede provins Masedonia enagledi ogwa. <verse eid="ACT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2" />Ye ede pi provins Masedonia suna pidre, Jisas pre mediglkwa yoba bage bage meglmara i ka di te, deno muduno si gigle di tenagledi ka mere di te wan moglkwa. Di tedre, konbauna wan ede pi kantri Grik ogwa. <verse eid="ACT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3" />Pol ye kantri Grik pidre, ba suota moglsre, okuo sip mina ede ikne provins Siria, ye mogl, ede meda omara ikra enagledi erukwa. Ye sip mina ede enagledi erukwa ba Juda yoba igne i ka di kogl, ye si goramniwe digwa. Ka yegl di keglko, yoba ta pre, u Pol di togwa. Di togo, Pol ere mogl, sip mina ede enagledi erukwa i kide kodo, ye kina gudu pre, makandigle wan ede ikne provins Masedonia pidre, okuo ede provins Siria enagledi prukwa.<verse eid="ACT 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4" />Ana Pol ede enagledi pruko, no yagl tau bogl akie makandigle wan ede omga. Taun Beria nem ta, kagie Sopater we digwa, ye Pirus wam moglkwa i yogo, te taun Tesalonaika nem suo Aristarkus ya Sekundus yebriko, te Gaius, ye taun Derbe nem moglkwa i Timoti bogl yebriko, te provins Esia nem suo Tikikus ya Trofimus i, no mudu Pol bogl akie ede omga. <verse eid="ACT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5" />No akie ede provins Masedonia omgo, yagl wagle i, no kide kodo, ede okna pi dumo Troas pidre, no pre sugl meglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6" />No kide kodo ede eigo, no Pol bogl taun Filipai pai muglko, Juda yoba bret yis edekre, gagl neigwa egemo kade ikra dudugo, no aglke kor ede Troas enabugledi sip mina ede obuglka. No ege 5-pela de mere sip mina pai mogl, wan ede pi dumo Troas plau dubuglka. Troas plau dubuglko, yagl wagle ede okna wigwa ikra, no pre sugl meglko, tegigl yedre, aglke 7-pela de dumo Troas i, pai munga.<verse eid="ACT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pol kumugl gak ta ere i kor edugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7-8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7-8" />Ana no dumo Troas pai mungo, Sande ege yogo, no Jisas pre mediglkwa yoba dumo Troas meglkwa i bogl makai sidre, Jisas goglkwa pre moramnedi bret akie buko di nenamnedi makai sumga. No pi yugu ta bogl kugl, tebe atne suo keimara ede kuglo ibo pi makai sumga. Makai sumnara i, yoba ken lam mere gagl padiglko, Pol ye yoba ka beke togwa. Ye yoba ka beke togwa i, tagna ye Troas kide kodo ede enagledi prukwa pre ka olto di ede ogo, eduer suna yogwa. <verse eid="ACT 20:7-8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9" />Ana Pol eduer suna ka beke te pai moglko, kumugl gak ta kagie Yutikus we digwa i ye windo mina ame di mogl, ugl guk sidre, ugl paugwa. Ugl pai du pidre, ye wai kugl, mina ibo yei, yage makandigle sugwa. Yage sugo, yoba ede makandigle pidre, ye ogo nagie ake ple di, kanigwa i, kumugl i goglko, kanigwa. <verse eid="ACT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10" />Yegl kanigo, Pol ye yugu kuglo mitna ibo moglmara i kide kodo, ede atne u kumugl i pai moglmara ye bolamugl pai ime di, kugrukwa. Kugrisre, ye yoba meglkwa i di te, yegl dugwa, Ene kide prikrio! Ye kor moglmiwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11" />Yegl dugo, kumugl gak i aduglkwa. Aduglko, yoba mudu aglke ede ikne bogl mitna ibo eigwa. Eigo, no yoba i mudu Jisas goglkwa pre moramnedi bret buko didre, akie nomga. Nomgo, Pol yoba ka beke te ede ogo, kamun tagugwa. Kamun tagugo, no Pol bogl dumo Troas kide kodo, ede omga. <verse eid="ACT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12" />Ede omgo, yoba i gun yei, kumugl i agre i ede kipamara eigwa. Siragl pre kumugl i kor moglkwa pre ye deno muduno aragan eruko, ye gun podo yeigwa.<verse eid="ACT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pol dumo Troas kide kodo, ede Miletus ogwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13" />Ana no dumo Troas kide kodinamnedi erumgo, Pol ye swara makandigle enagledi prisre, no di noro, yegl dugwa, Ene sip mina ede okna pi dumo Asos ebi, na makandigle wibo, nono Asos tegigl yenamniwe di, yegl dugwa. Yegl dugwa pre no ye dumere ere, sip mina ede okna pi taun Asos omgo, <verse eid="ACT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14" />Pol makandigle u Asos plau dugo, no tegigl yomga. Tegigl yedre, no akie sip mina ede pi taun ta Mitilini we dimara omga.<verse eid="ACT 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15" />Ana no taun ta Mitilini we dimara i pidre, aglke kor dumo i kide kodo, sip mina ede omga. No pidre, ege ta dumo kebra ta mudi nigl suna yogwa, kagie Kios we digwa yomara i, magigl omga. Pidre, tagna ta ede pi dumo kebra pere ta mudi nigl suna yogwa, kagie Samos we dimara i, omga. Dumo Samos pidre, tagna ta aglke kor no dumo Efesus yadidre, taun ta Miletus we dimara pi plau dumga. <verse eid="ACT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16" />No dumo Troas mogl, sip mina ede enamnedi erumga igne, Pol okna kana konbauna ta sugwa i, no dumo Efesus pikre, ake dudi ede enamnedi prukwa. Yegl prukwa pre no sip ta dumo Efesus pikre, ake dudi ede enamga sip i mina ede omga. Siragl pre Pol prukwa i, ye ede pi Efesus pidre, provins Esia suna i moglbo, ege kade Pentikos we digwa i, u dinabedi prukwa pre ye kuno eran, tabre ede pi Jerusalem moglbo, ege kade Pentikos yenabedi prukwa pre no ede Efesus pikre, ake dudi ede omga.<verse eid="ACT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pol ye Efesus suglno yoba ka di tedre, ye kodo, ede ogwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17" />Ana no ede dumo Miletus omgo, Pol yoba ta dedugo, ye ede pi dumo Efesus pidre, Jisas yugobunomo dumo Efesus meglkwa i, suglno meglkwa yoba mudu agre yunabedi dedugwa. Yoba i ede pi dumo Efesus pidre, pre mediglkwa yoba suglno yoba dumo Efesus meglkwa i di togo, ye mudu Pol moglmara Miletus wigwa.<verse eid="ACT 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18" />Ana Jisas pre mediglkwa yoba dumo Efesus meglkwa i suglno yoba wigo, Pol ye yoba mudu i di tedre, yegl dugwa, Na agrama wagle, na kere mogo ede u provins Esia u mogl, aglke ede ikne eiga igne ikra ya te, wan mogl, okuo aglke kor wigo, nono akie mogl umga i, na siragl mere mogl pai erika i, ene pre kan erime dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19" />Juda yoba ege mere ka di koglsre, na si goramnedi erikwa. Yegl erikwa pre na yubun tau mere idre, ama ege sike ta na kai erika. Na yegl erika ba ene na kanigwa i, na nana ake atne edidre, na Yagl Kade kogonmo ere pai moluwe dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20" />Ana na okna ene ka beke teiga igne, na ka swara ta ene di tenaglka, wakai paugwa i, na teke ta padiglkre, na ene di pogl te keme erika. Na ene makai si meglmara ya ene pere pere kipai meglmara i ama ka beke teiga. <verse eid="ACT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21" />Te, na ama Juda yoba ya yoba yugobuno pere meda meglkwa i, ama ka giglede di tedre, ye nomane kor idre, ede God moglkwa u Yaglno Kade Jisas pre medraiglmedi di teiwe di, Pol yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22" />Pol ka yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Na erme ede Jerusalem ena pre wiga. I siragl pre na dena muduna mina ka kaima ede Jerusalem enagledi priwe dugwa. Na ede ebo, siragl taragl na moglmara plau dinabuka i, na ta pre kan erekrika <verse eid="ACT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23" />ba na taun pere pere wan moglka igne i God Murubuglo komono kana ka giglede di narukwa i, yoba na si kane sibi, yubun podo inaglka mere yegl na di narukwa. <verse eid="ACT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24" />Yubun podo yegl inaglka mere di narukwa ba yoba na si kane sidre, na si goraiglkwa i, na pre mitna edekrie dugwa. Pre mitna edekrika ba Yagl Kade Jisas na kogon eratnedi narukwa i swara ere kodinagledi pre mitna edie dugwa. Na prika i, God ye yoko kaima yoba ere yugwa ka wakai i, yoba di te kodinagledi prika pre diwe di, Pol yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25" />Ana Pol ka yegl didre, ka tau ama di, yegl dugwa, Na agrama wagle, ene prio. God yoba kingno mogl, ye suglno morabuka i, na okna ene meglmara suna wan mogl, ene mudu di te kodiga. Na erme prika i, ene okuo na gumana kankraiglmiwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 20:25" /><verse number="26-27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26-27" />Yegl pre na ene erme di nogugl ede teiga, na God kamo mudu ene di teiwe dugwa. God taragl swara ta eragle dugwa mo ene eraiglmedi prukwa i, na ka swara ta teke padiglkre, ene mudu di pogl te kodiga. Di pogl te kodiga pre okuo yoba swara ta wau borabuka i, na mabuno ta moglkraluwe di, Pol yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 20:26-27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28" />Ana Pol ka yegl didre, ka tau ama yegl di pai moglkwa, Pre mediglkwa yoba meglkwa i, ene sugl meglkwa yoba, na ene ka yegl di tenaluwe dugwa. Ene enene suglno wakai moglsre, te God yugobunomo mudu ama suglno wakai molo dugwa. Siragl pre yoba God yugobunomo mina meglkwa, yene Wam bormaimo mina topo si yugwa i, Mudu Murubuglo ye ene sipsip sugl meglkwa yoba mere yegl suglno wakai moraiglmedi dedugo, meglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29" />Na pre kan erika i, na ede ebo, yoba tau okuo unaiglkwa i, agl are taragl si paglka neimere mere yegl u God sipsipmo meglkwa i, mudu ere kide ere tenamnedi eraiglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30" />Te, enene meglmara yagl tau suna moraiglkwa i, ama pre mediglkwa yoba ye no duglo boraiglmedi God kamo pamere dikre, yoba ka kibi beke tenaiglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31" />Yegl pre ene kan kun ere molo! dugwa. Na okna bugla yugu suota ene bogl mungo, na etne ya eduer ene ka beke tedre, ege sike tau kai erika i, ene poglo di pre, na erimere yegl ene ama erio di, Pol yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32" />Ana Pol ka yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Erme God yene ene suglno morabedi ene God ogo mina yei kodiwe dugwa. Te, God ye yoba yoko kaima ere yugwa kamo i mina ene mogl atne ede molo di, yegl dugwa. Ka swara i, ene si gigle di tenabuka, kuno erukwa. Te, ene pre molo, God ye yene yobama taragl wakai wakai okuo inaiglme dugwa, ene ama inaiglkwa i, ye kamo swara i ene pre mediglkwa pre ene inaiglmiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 20:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33" />Ana na yoba silva mo gol mo kugugl gagl ta kan neigwa i pre bubuno goglkrika. <verse eid="ACT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34" />Na nana ogona mina kogon ere, taragl ta i nenaglka mo yoba na bogl akie God kogonmo erumga i, i nenamga pre na nana kogon erika i, enene pre kan erime dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35" />Na yegl ere ene obuno di teiga i, ene kogon yegl ersre, yoba tau yobuglno paikrukwa ake ple di tenaiglkwa pre obuno di teiga. Yegl obuno di tedre, te Jisas ka ta yene dra mina dugwa i, ene pre moraiglmedi na ene obuno di teiwe dugwa. Jisas yegl dugwa, Ene enene taragl tau idre, gun yenatnga i, gun kebra yenatnga ba ene taragl tau yoba tedre, gun yenatnga i, gun podo kaima yenatniwe di, Jisas ka yegl dumiwe di, Pol yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36" />Ana Pol ka yegl di kodidre, ye goglko boduglko, no Efesus suglno yoba mudu i bogl akie kamage erumga. <verse eid="ACT 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37" />Kamage ere kodumgo, yagl wagle i kai podo ere, Pol nugo kugro, pauna si neigwa. <verse eid="ACT 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38" />I siragl pre Pol ye okuo na ta kankraiglmiwe dugwa pre ye deno muduno yubun podo dogo, ye kai ere, Pol kugro, pauna si neigwa. Yegl ersre, ye no Pol bogl auro i pi sip mina edigo, munga.<verse eid="ACT 20:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21" />
  <para style="s">Pol ede Jerusalem enagledi ogwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1" />Ana Efesus suglno yoba ikra no agre i pi sip mina edigo, no ede enamnedi ere, ye di wakai yei tedre, no sip mina ede omga. Ana no sip mina ake dudi ede pi dumo kebra ta mudi nigl suna yogwa, kagie Kos we dimara i, omga. Pidre, tagna ta dumo kebra i kide kodo, aglke ede pi dumo kebra ta mudi nigl suna yogwa, kagie Rodes we dimara omga. Pidre, aglke dumo i kide kodo, sip mina ede pi taun ta Patara we dimara omga. <verse eid="ACT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2" />No pi dumo Patara moglsre, no kamga i, sip pere ta ede distrik Fonisia enagledi eruko, kandre, no ede sip ta i mina bolamugl pidre, sip i mina ede omga. <verse eid="ACT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3" />No sip i mina ede mudi nigl suna pidre, kamga i, ailan ta Saiprus we digwa i ogono koda kra yogo kandre, no ake dudi ede provins Siria omga. Pi provins Siria suna, taun kade ta Tair we dimara i omgo, sip mina bonagana tau yuigwa i, i atne edinamnedi erikwa pre no ede makandigle pi makandigle sugl munga.<verse eid="ACT 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4" />Ana no ede makandigle pi sugl mogl pai moglsre, ana Jisas nagiglema dumo Tair meglkwa i wan doko kamga. Wan doko kan imgo, no yoba i bogl ege 7-pela de akie pai munga. Ege 7-pela de pai mungo, Jisas nagiglema dumo Tair meglkwa i, God Murubuglo ye meglmara kogon ere, yubun ta okuo Pol moglmara plau dinabuka i, i nogugl ede togo, pre kan ersre, ye Pol di te, Ene ede pi Jerusalem pikratne! di, tau ege mere yegl di teigwa. <verse eid="ACT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5" />Yegl di teigwa ba Pol ye kano prikrukwa pre okuo sip i aglke kor ede enabuka magigl erukwa igne, no aglke ede sip mina enamnedi erumga. No ede sip mina enamnedi eungo, Jisas nagiglema dumo Tair meglkwa i ebino gagroma bogl mudu no agre i pi taun meda pidre, sip mina ede enamnedi no agre yeigwa. No agre i pi mudi nigl bina eigo, no mudu mudi nigle bina wesan moglmara i goglkono bodugl, kamage erumga. Ere kodidre, no ikne ikne di wakai yedre, <verse eid="ACT 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6" />no ede sip bolamugl omgo, ye aglke ede ikne taun suna eigwa.<verse eid="ACT 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pol ede Sisaria ogo, ka kep yagl ta ye ka di togwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7" />Ana no dumo Tair kide kodo, sip mina ede pi taun ta Tolemes we dimara omga. Ede Tolemes pidre, pre mediglkwa yoba Tolemes meglkwa i, pi kandre, di wakai yei te, ege swara ta ye bogl pamga. <verse eid="ACT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8" />Ege swara keme taun Tolemes i pre mediglkwa yoba bogl padre, tagna ta i adigl, sip mina ede pi taun Sisaria we dimara omga. Pidre, ede pi yagl ta kagie Filip we digwa i kipamara pi, pamga. Ana yagl Filip i, okna Jisas dedugwa yagl ye yagl 7-pela kaya mokna yubu si, yoba tenaiglmedi kere imara ikra, ye swarano ta moglkwa. Te, ye ama Jisas kamo yoba di togwa yagl moglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9" />Yegl eruko, te ye abugloma 4-pela meglkwa i, ede yagl pikre, yoko mogl, God kamo kep ere digwa abai meglkwa.<verse eid="ACT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10" />Ana no dumo Sisaria ege tau pai mungo, God kamo kep yagl ta kagie Agabus we digwa ye distrik Judia mogl, u no munara plau dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11" />Ye u no munara udre, ye Pol kumaglmo idre, Agabus yene ogo kagle kan sugwa. Kan sidre, ye no di noro, yegl dugwa, Mudu Murubuglo ene yegl di tomiwe dugwa, Yagl ta kumagl i nem yagl morabuka yaglmo i, Juda yoba Jerusalem meglkwa i ye yegl mere si kane sidre, i pi Rom yoba tenaiglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12" />Ana yagl Agabus i ka yegl dugo, no prisre, Sisaria pre mediglkwa yoba tau meglkwa i bogl ka giglede di te, Pol ede Jerusalem pikratniwe di, mane dumga. <verse eid="ACT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13" />Yegl dumga ba Pol di ikne ede noro, yegl dugwa, Ene siragl pre kai ere, na dena muduna yubun denabedi erime? di, yegl dugwa. Na ede Jerusalem ebo, Juda yoba na Yaglno Kade Jisas kogonmo erika i pre na si kane sinaiglmo mo na si goraiglkwa i, na pra wakai priwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14" />Yegl dugo, no ye kanumga i, nomane kor ta ikrabuka mere kamga. Yegl kandre, no mane dumga i kodo, Yagl Kade yene pre kan erumere erabiwe di, ye yegl di tomga.<verse eid="ACT 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pol ede Jerusalem ogwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15" />Ana no ege tau Sisaria pai moglsre, no ede Jerusalem enamnedi bona ganano ki ake kun ere, ede enamnedi erumga. <verse eid="ACT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16" />Ede enamnedi omgo, Jisas nagiglema tau Sisaria meglkwa i no agre i ede eigwa. No agre i ede pi Jerusalem pidre, yagl ta kagie Nason we digwa kipamara i edigo, pamga. Yagl Nason i, ye dumo Saiprus nem ta moglsre, okna kaima Jisas pre meduglkwa yagl ta moglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17" />Ana no ede Jerusalem omga i, Jisas pre mediglkwa yoba no wimedi prisre, gun yei, no kogl kare di, no di igwa.<verse eid="ACT 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18" />Ana yoba tau no agre i pi Jerusalem edigo, no padre, tagugo i, no Pol bogl ede pi yagl Jems kanamnedi ye moglmara omga. Omgo, Jems yogo, pre mediglkwa yoba Jerusalem meglkwa i suglno yoba mudu meglko, no pi, ye kamga. <verse eid="ACT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19" />Kamgo, Pol ye mudu di wakai yei tedre, ye ka tau boglo si togwa. Pol ye yugobuno pere pere, Juda yoba moglkrikwa i meglmara pi Jisas kamo di te wan moglko, God ye meglmara kogon podo erukwa i, ye mudu boglo si togwa.<verse eid="ACT 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jerusalem suglno yoba Pol ede tawa teigwa yugu enatne digwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20" />Ana Pol ye Jerusalem pre mediglkwa yoba suglno yoba meglkwa ya yagl Jems i ka tau yegl di togo, ye gun yei, God kagie kade teigwa. God kagie kade tedre, aglke Pol di te, yegl digwa, Agro Pol, ene pro! Juda yoba tausand mere kide ye Jisas pre mediglkwa i, enene kaniwe digwa. Ye Jisas pre mediglsre, te, ye ama yobuglo ere, Moses lo norukwa i duglo boramnedi ere meglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21" />Yegl erikwa ba ene bage bage wan moglsre, Juda yoba tau ye yugobuno pere pere meglmara suna kipaigwa ene ka di tenga i, yoba tau ye ene di te, Moses lo norukwa i kide kodio didre, te ye gak kebra kiglkwa i Gagno puduo gagie boglkrio didre, nono kowano awano mabunono i, ene ye kide kodio di, yegl diniwe digo, pre mediglkwa yoba magigl i mudu prisre, kide primiwe digwa. <verse eid="ACT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22" />Ene erme ede Jerusalem unga i, yoba dibi, ye mudu praiglkwa. Yegl pre siragl eramne? digwa. No punga i, ene ka yegl ta dikitnga ba nono siragl ta eun, pre mediglkwa yoba nomane idre, Pol ka yegl ta kaima di wan moglkrukwa pamedi pribi, wakai panabuka. Yegl pre siragl eramne? di, yagl wagle i yegl digwa.<verse eid="ACT 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23" />Yegl didre, Pol di te, yegl digwa, No ene yegl eratnedi prumniwe digwa. No munara yagl 4-pela ta yene God kogonmo eramnedi God ka giglede di te padiglkwa meglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24" />Yegl pre ene ye bogl akie tawa teigwa yugu pi nono Juda yoba mabunono pamere God gumuglo mina deglbi yekramnedi taragl tau eraiglkwa i, ene bogl akie erio digwa. Ene yegl ersre, yagl 4-pela i tawa tenaiglkwa i, ene ta topo si ten, ye komono kana tawa tedre, okuo ye bitno yugo guko edenaiglkwa. Ene yegl etn, Juda yoba pre kan pogl sidre, yoba tau ene ka yegl diniwe digwa i ka kibi dimiwedi prisre, Pol ye ama nono lono duglo boglkwa pamiwe di, yegl kanaiglmiwe digwa.<verse eid="ACT 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25" />Yagl wagle i ka yegl didre, ama yegl digwa, Ana yoba yugobuno pere Jisas pre mediglkwa i pre no okna ka di koglsre, ye pepa bogl tomga ikra, pai moglmiwe digwa. Yoba taragl mie god kibi tawa tenaiglkwa i nekrio didre, bormai nekrio didre, te mie bormai pai morabuka i ama nekrio dumga. Yegl didre, te, yagl abu ye yagl abu ta bogl kunogl nekrio, di, yegl di tomgra we digwa.<verse eid="ACT 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26" />Ana Jerusalem pre mediglkwa yoba suglno yoba meglkwa i yeigo, Jems yogo, ye Pol yegl ero digwa pre Pol ye tagna mogl adigl, yagl 4-pela ikra bogl ye Juda yoba mabunono pamere ere, God gumuglo mina deglbi yekramnedi taragl tau erikwa. Ere kodigo, Pol ye ede pi tawa teigwa yugu yomara togl suna ogo, tawa teigwa yoba ta moglko, Pol ye di tedre, yegl dugwa, Yagl 4-pela i taragl tau God gumuglo mina deglbi yekramnedi ere kodigwa pre ye ege 7-pela de sugl moglsre, u tawa gagl tenaiglmiwe di, Pol ye yegl di togwa.<verse eid="ACT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Juda yoba Pol si goramnedi erikwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27" />Ana yagl 4-pela i ye ege 7-pela de sugl moglsre, tawa tenaiglkwa ege i, ede magigl ugo, Pol ede togl suna ogwa. Pi togl suna moglko, Juda yoba tau provins Esia meglkwa u ye Pol tawa teigwa yugu togl suna moglko, kanigwa. Kandre, ye Juda yoba togl suna u meglkwa mudu i Pol deno kubro tenaiglmedi kinano sidre, Pol ake gi di mogl, <verse eid="ACT 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28" />yoba di te, yegl digwa, Ene Israel yoba ta moratnga i, u no ake ple di noro! digwa. Yagl ta magigl ake munga i, ye ede uglo koglo koglo pi, yoba ka kane kane di togwa. Ye nono Juda yoba munga i kagno ere kide ersre, te God lomo ya yugumo magigl i, di kide yei tomiwe digwa. Yagl i yegl ersre, yoba pere, Juda yoba moglkrikwa i, agre i ede tawa yugu togl suna udre, nono tawa tomga yugu, God i pere edugwa i, si deglbi yei, ere kide erumiwe digwa. <verse eid="ACT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29" />Ye yegl digwa i siragl pre ye okna kanigwa, Pol ye yagl ta dumo Efesus nem ta moglkwa, kagie Trofimus we digwa i, ye Juda yoba ta moglkrukwa ba ye Jerusalem suna Pol bogl okna wanibriko, kanigwa pre ye prikwa i, Pol yagl i bogl akie ede togl suna ubre di, sugun pre, ka yegl digwa. <verse eid="ACT 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30" />Yegl digo, Jerusalem yoba magigl meglkwa i mudu prisre, deno kubro Pol teigwa. Deno kubro Pol tedre, muku di pi Pol sinamnedi ake gudu i pi tawa teigwa yugu yomara togl meda edigo, yoba tau togl dra yogugl kegl digwa.<verse eid="ACT 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rom soldia Pol akigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31" />Ana Jerusalem yoba i Pol agre i ede togl meda pi, ye si goramnedi ere sigwa. Ere sigo, yoba tau kandre, ye muku di ede pi yagl ta Rom soldia bitno moglmara i pidre, ye di te, yegl digwa, Jerusalem yoba mudu ka podo didre, kuda boramnedi erime digwa. <verse eid="ACT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32" />Digo, Rom soldia bitno moglkwa i oglade pi, soldia yoba kade tau meglkwa i di togo, ye pi soldiano tau igo, ye akie muku di ede atne u, yoba Pol ere simara i wigwa. Wigwa pre yoba ye soldia wigwa i kandre, Pol ere sigwa i kide kodigwa. <verse eid="ACT 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33" />Yegl eriko, soldia bitno moglkwa yagl i ede u Pol ake gi di mogl, ye soldiamo di te, Yagl i sen suo idre, ogo koglo koglo kane sio dugo, ye kane sigwa. Kane sigo, soldia bitno yagl i yoba meglkwa i kira pogl pre, Pol ye ira moglkwa ya te aglau siragl mere erukwa i, dibi pragledi kira pogl prukwa. <verse eid="ACT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34" />Kira pogl prukwa ba yoba mere kide meglkwa i, tau ka podo di, Pol aglau tau yegl mere erume digo, yoba tau ka podo didre, di pere ta edigwa pre soldia bitno moglkwa i ye aglau siragl mere erukwa doko inabuka i, kuno erekrukwa. Kuno erekrukwa pre ye soldiamo di tedre, Pol agre i ede pi soldia yugu ta paimara enaiglmedi di togo, ye Pol agre i ede eigwa. <verse eid="ACT 21:34" /><verse number="35-36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35-36" />Ye agre i ede pi yugu ta paimara i lada mina eigo, yoba mere kide ye eimara sika si pi, ka podo di, Yagl i si golo didre, Pol si, si goramnedi erikwa pre soldia i ere mogl, Pol boglo ere kobano mina padigl, lada mina boglo ere i ede kuglo pi, yugu ta paimara i ede yugugl enamnedi eigwa.<verse eid="ACT 21:35-36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pol Juda yoba ka di togwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37" />Ana soldia i ye Pol agre i ede pi ye yugu ta paimara ede yugugl enamnedi eriko, Pol ye soldia bitno moglkwa yagl i di pre, yegl dugwa, Ene pra we din, na ene ka ta di tenagledi priwe dugwa. Yegl dugo, yagl i, Aya, ene ka Grik dinga pamiwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38" />Ene Isip yagl ta okna kuda kogl, yagl 4,000 naif mina yoba si geglkwa i, agre i ede dumo wau yomara ogwa i, ene motnedi priwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39" />Rom soldia bitno yagl i ka yegl dugo, Pol ye di ikne ede te, I na ta mane dugwa. Na Juda yagl ta mogl, taun Tarsus nem moliwe dugwa. Taun Tarsus i, provins Silisia suna i yogwa. Taun i kagie paugwa yomiwe dugwa. Yegl didre, Ene pra we din, na yoba mudu i ka ta di tenagledi priwe dugo, <verse eid="ACT 21:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40" />soldia bitno yagl i pra we dugo, Pol lada mina adigl moglsre, yoba ka dikraiglmedi ogo wermane erukwa. Eruko, yoba i pra pra ka dikre, kiede meglko, Pol ka tau yene kano Aram ka mina ye di togwa.<verse eid="ACT 21:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1" />Ana Pol ye yoba u makai si meglkwa i ka yegl di togwa, Nina agrama wagle, na ka dinaglka i, ene prio! Na taragl kane kane etne digwa i, ene di tenagle dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2" />Yegl dugo, yoba ye kano Aram ka mina dugo, prisre, ka ta dikre, kiede kaima meglkwa. Kiede meglko, Pol ye ka yegl di togwa, <verse eid="ACT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3" />Na Juda yagl ta mole dugwa. Na mana provins Silisia, taun Tarsus we dimara suna i, na kugl yogwa ba na moglka, Jerusalem magigl i mogl, yakie dugwa. Na sule diga, yagl Gamaliel i sule di narukwa. Ye nono kowano awano lono mudu ake giglede beke naruko, priwe dugwa. Te, ene erme God kamo mudu duglo boramnedi erimere yegl, na okna God kamo i mudu duglo boragledi eriwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4" />Okna na God kogonmo eriedi pre, yoba Jisas kamo prisre, ye konbaunamo duglo beglkwa i yagl ya abu akie si kane sidre, ere kide ere te, tau ama si goglka. <verse eid="ACT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5" />Na ka diga i, tawa teigwa yoba bitno moglkwa i ya yagl kade wagle Kaunsil mina meglkwa i, na kaima dume dinaiglkwa. Ye ege swara ta na pepa tau bogl nare, i ede pi Juda yoba dumo Damaskus meglkwa i tedre, Jisas pre mediglkwa yoba ta moraiglkwa i, si kane si i ede u Jerusalem udre, ye ere kide ere tenaglka pre dedigo, eiwe di, Pol yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pol ye Jisas pre meduglkwa pre dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6" />Pol ka yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Na ede Damaskus enagledi eiwe dugwa. Ede pi Damaskus magigl eigo, belo igne mere yegl yogo, abuglage podo kide ta heven ibo yei, si atne, na moglmara edugo, <verse eid="ACT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7" />na yage makandigle sidre, prika i, yoba ta ka di nare, yegl dugwa, Sol yo, ene siragl pre na ere kide ere nare motne? dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8" />Yegl dugo, na di ikne ede kira pogl prika, Yagl Kade yo, ene ira motne? di, yegl diga. Yegl digo, ye na di nare, Na Jisas, dumo Nasaret nem, ene ere kide ere nare motnga i, moluwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9" />No yoba akie omga i, abuglage podo sugwa i ye kanigwa ba Jisas ka di narukwa i, ye pre pogl sikrimiwe dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10" />Ana ye Na Jisas moluwe dugo, na ye di pre, Yagl Kade yo, erme na siragl eragle? di, yegl diga. Yegl digo, ye na di nare, Ene adigl ede Damaskus suna po di, yegl dugwa. Ede Damaskus suna en, yagl ta ye na ene siragl mere eratnedi di padiglka i, ene di tenan, pratniwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11" />Yegl dugo, na abuglage podo kide sugo, kaniga ikra pre gumuglna si kin yogo, yagl wagle no akie omga ikra, na ogona ake i pi, Damaskus suna eimiwe di, Pol yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12" />Ana Pol ka yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Dumo Damaskus i, yagl ta moglkwa, kagie Ananaias we digwa. Ye God kuduglmo gogl, lomo duglo boragledi ere moglko, Juda yoba dumo Damaskus meglkwa i ye mabunomo kandre, yagl wakai ta moglmedi kanigwa. <verse eid="ACT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13" />Ana na i pi Damaskus edigwa moglko, yagl i u na moglmara magigl adigl, Agra Sol yo, ene gumugln kin yogwa i, erme kanatniwe! dugwa. Yegl dugo, na tabre kaima kan mitna ede, ye kanagledi eriko, gumuglna pene dugo, wakai kaniga. <verse eid="ACT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14" />Yegl eruko, ye na di nare, yegl dugwa, Nono kowano awano Godno i, ene kere i pere edugwa. Ye ene kere i pere edugwa i, God yoba siragl mere eraiglmedi prukwa i ene di tenan, ene pre kan eratnga pre ene kere i pere edidre, te, ene Jisas ye Yagl Du Kaima Moglkwa i kandre, Jisas ye ka ta ene di tenabuka i, pratnga pre ama ene kere i pere edumiwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15" />I siragl pre ene ye kamo yoba mudu di tedre, konbauna bage Jisas siragl mere eruko, kanga ya ka di togo, pitnga i, di nogugl ede tenatniwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16" />Yegl di nare, ama yegl dugwa, Erme ene sugl moglkre, tabre adigl, nigl buglo dugwa. Te, ene Yagl Kade Jisas tadaglmenen gugl edenabedi agle din, ye ene tadaglmenen gugl edenabiwe di, Ananaias yegl di narume di, Pol yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">God okna Pol dede, ede yugobuno pere pere meglmara enabedi dedugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17" />Ana Pol ka yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Taragl yegl plau di kodugo, okuo, na ede ikne Jerusalem igle udre, aglke ta ede tawa teigwa yugu togl suna pi kamage ere moglka. Kamage ere moglko, gumuglnamugl eruko, kaniga i, <verse eid="ACT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18" />Jisas na moglmara ugwa. Udre, ye na ka ta di nare, yegl dugwa, Ene na kana Jerusalem yoba magigl i di tenatnga i, ta prikraiglmiwe dugwa. Yegl pre ene tabre Jerusalem kide kodo, ede po! dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19" />Jisas yegl dugo, na ye di ikne ede te, yegl diga, Yagl Kade yo, na ene kanen Jerusalem magigl i yoba di tebo, ye praiglkwa kuno erabedi prika. I siragl pre okna na yoba siragl mere mogl, kogon siragl mere erika i ye kanigwa pre erme na ene kanen dinaglka i, ye pre kan eraiglkwa. Na okna ka mabuno yugu bage bage kei yeimara pi, yoba ene pre mediglkwa i ere sidre, si kane siga i, ye yene pre kan erikwa. <verse eid="ACT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20" />Te, yagl Stiven, ene kanen yoba di togwa pre ye kobuglo si, si geglkwa ikra, na ye wakai erimedi kan moglsre, yoba ye yagl Stiven kobuglo si goramnedi erikwa i, ir gaglno gugl edigo, na sugl kan moluwe di, na ye yegl di teiga. <verse eid="ACT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21" />Na yegl digo, Jisas aglke kor na di nare, Ene ede po! dugwa. Ene en, na ene dedibo, ede dumo eglke, yugobuno pere pere meglmara pidre, na kana di tenatnga pre dediwe di, Jisas yegl dumiwe di, Pol yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pol soldia di te, Na Rom yoba ta mole dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22" />Ana yoba ye Pol ka dugwa ikra pre meglkwa ba Pol ye ere mogl, Na ede yugobuno pere pere meglmara enatnedi dedumiwe di, yegl dugwa ege i, yoba pre meglkwa ikra mudu deno kubro, ka podo yegl digwa, Yagl i kor morabuka, kuno erekrumiwa. Si golo! di, yegl digwa. <verse eid="ACT 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23" />Ka podo yegl didre, ye deno podo kubro, ir gaglno gugl, makandigle sidre, makan kugane wobro pia si mitna edigwa. <verse eid="ACT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24" />Yoba mudu ikra yegl ere meglko, soldia bitno yagl i ye soldiamo tau di te, yegl dugwa, Ene yagl i agre i, pi nono pamnara yugugl edidre, ye duglnai sio! dugwa. Ye duglnai sibi, ye aglau siragl mere eruko, yoba deno kubro, ka podo digwa i, na di nogugl ede naran, praluwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25" />Yegl dugo, soldia tau ye agre i ede yugugl pi, ogo kagle kan sidre, duglnai sinamnedi erikwa. Duglnai sinamnedi eriko, Pol ye soldia 100-pela bitno moglkwa ta magigl moglko, kandre, ye kira pogl prukwa, Na Rom paiga dudugwa pre Rom yoba moglka. Yegl pre ene kot ere narekre, na duglnai sinaiglkwa i, lo yegl ta pamo? dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26" />Ana Pol yegl dugo, soldia 100-pela bitno moglkwa yagl ikra ede pi soldia yaglno kade moglmara i ogwa. Pidre, yegl di togwa, Yagl nono si kane si, duglnai sinamnedi erumga i, ye Rom yoba ta moglkwa pre ene siragl eratne? dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27" />Yegl dugo, soldia mudu sugl moglkwa yagl i u Pol moglmara udre, kira pogl pre, yegl dugwa, Ene na di naro. Ene kaima Rom pano? di, yegl dugwa. Dugo, Pol di ikne ede te, Na Rom paiga. Rom yoba ta moluwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28" />Pol yegl dugo, soldia bitno yagl i yegl dugwa, Na Rom yoba moragledi mige podo topo siwe dugwa. Dugo, Pol ye di te, Na topo ta tekrie dugwa. Na nina mana Rom padre, na kugl yebrika pre na Rom yoba moluwe di, Pol yegl dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29" />Ana Pol yegl dugwa pre soldia tau ye duglnai sidre, kira pogl pramnedi erikwa i kudugl gogl, tabre ede eglke eglke eigo, soldia mudu bitno yagl i ama Rom yoba ta mane pamara na sen mina si kane siedi prisre, kudugl goglkwa.<verse eid="ACT 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pol ye Juda yoba kade meglmara ka di togwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30" />Ana tagugo i, soldia bitno yagl i ye tawa teigwa yoba bitno meglkwa i ya Kaunsil mudu di makai sidre, Pol ye aglau siragl mere eruko, yoba digwa i, di nogugl edenan pragledi ye Pol i meda edidre, auro i pi yoba i gumanomugl edugwa.<verse eid="ACT 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1" />Ana soldia bitno yagl i ye Pol auro i pi Juda yoba Kaunsilno meglmara gumanomugl edugwa. Edugo, Pol ye kan Kaunsil meglmara edidre, yegl dugwa, Na agrama wagle, na okna ebrie mabuno siragl mere boglka ya erme ebrie mabuno siragl mere boglka i, God gumuglo mina ta agai goglkriwe di, Pol yegl dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2" />Yegl dugo, tawa teigwa yoba bitno moglkwa, ye kagie Ananaias we digwa i ye yoba tau Pol moglmara magigl adigl meglkwa i di te, Yagl ka dugwa i dra mina sio! dugo, sigwa. <verse eid="ACT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3" />Sigo, Pol ye yagl Ananaias i di tedre, yegl dugwa, God ene sinabiwe dugwa. Yoba ene nagin tebe kanigwa, ene yagl wakai ta motnedi kanigwa ba den mudn mina u kide kaima pi kodinga. Ene ame di moglsre, lo mina kot ere naragledi ersre, aglke lo mane dumara i yoba di te, yoba na sinaiglmedi di tenga i, kuno erekrumiwe di, Pol yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4" />Pol yegl dugo, yoba tau Pol moglmara magigl adigl meglkwa i Pol kira pogl pre, yegl digwa, Ene tawa teigwa yoba bitno i, God ye nono bitno morabedi dedugo, moglkwa i, siragl pre di kide yei tene? di, yegl digwa. <verse eid="ACT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5" />Yegl digo, Pol ye di ikne ede te, Agrama wagle, na aglau eriwe dugwa. Tawa teigwa yoba bitno moglkwa i, na pre kan erekriwe dugwa. Siragl pre God kamo mina beglkwa, Yoba ene bitno ta moraiglkwa i, di kide yei tekrio<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isip Kide Kodigwa 22.28</char></note> di, yegl beglme dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6" />Ana Pol ye pre kan erukwa i, Kaunsil mudu makai si meglkwa i, ye tau Sadyusi yoba meglko, tau Farisi yoba meglkwa. Yoba yegl makai si meglko, kandre, ye ka podo di, yegl dugwa, Na agrama wagle, na ninama okna Farisi yoba meglko, erme na moglka, ama Farisi yoba ta moluwe dugwa. Na erme kot ere narikwa i, yoba goglsre, adigl u kor enaiglkwa i na pre mediglsre, sugl moglka. Ka i pre mediglmara i pre ye na kot ere narimiwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7" />Yegl dugo, Kaunsil wagle u makai si meglkwa i, ye aglke si buno di ede u suo eigwa. Suo pidre, ye yene ikne ikne ka drano didre, nonga digwa. I siragl pre tau Sadyusi meglko, tau Farisi meglko, yegl erikwa. <verse eid="ACT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8" />Sadyusi yoba pre mediglkwa i, yoba goglsre, adigl u kor pikraiglmedi prisre, te angelo ya murubuglo ki ta moglkrimedi, yegl di prikwa ba Farisi yoba ye yoba goglsre, adigl u kor enaiglmedi prisre, te angelo ya murubuglo ki meglmedi prikwa pre ye yene ikne ikne nonga digwa. <verse eid="ACT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9" />Ana Kaunsil wagle ye nonga podo digo, God lomo beke teigwa yagl tau ye Farisi yoba mina suna meglkwa i adigl mogl, ka podo di, yegl digwa, Yagl wagle ene prio! digwa. No yagl i aglau ta erekrumedi prumga. Ye ka dugwa i, murubuglo mo angelo ta di tebi, dinan, nono pre pogl sikramga di, yegl digwa. <verse eid="ACT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10" />Yegl digo, yoba i nonga podo digo, soldia bitno yagl i kanugwa i, ye nonga di, Pol ake paka di ede pere pere enaiglkwa mere yegl kandre, kudugl goglsre, ye soldiamo di togo, ye ede suna pi, Pol ake i pi soldia paimara yugu i enaiglmedi di togo, ye dumere ere, i ede eigwa.<verse eid="ACT 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11" />Ana soldia ye Pol agre i ede ikne pi soldia paimara yugugl i edigo, moglko, eduer Yagl Kade ye Pol moglmara u magigl adigl mogl, yegl di togwa, Ene kudugl goglkro. Ene na kana yoba Jerusalem magigl i di tenere, kuno yegl ene ede pi dumo Rom pidre, na kana yoba di tenatnga pamiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Juda yoba Pol si goramnedi ka di keglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12" />Ana tagugo i, Juda yoba tau ye Pol si goramnedi pre, ka di kogl kodo, ka giglede ta ama di padigl yegl digwa, Nono nigl ya kaya mokna nekre, mawagl ere ede pi yagl Pol i si goglsre, okuo nigl ya kaya mokna nenamniwe di, yegl digwa. <verse eid="ACT 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13" />Ana yagl ka yegl di padiglkwa i, ye 40-pela mere yegl mogl ede mina eigwa. <verse eid="ACT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14" />Ye ka yegl di koglsre, ye ede pi tawa teigwa yoba bitno meglkwa i ya Juda yoba kade meglkwa i meglmara pidre, ye di te, yegl digwa, No erme ka giglede ta di padunga i, yegl dumniwe digwa, no nigl ya kaya mokna ta nekre, mogl ede pi yagl Pol i si goglsre, okuo nigl ya kaya mokna nenamnedi di paduniwe digwa. <verse eid="ACT 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15" />Yegl didre, ama ye di te, yegl digwa, ene ya te, Kaunsil mudu ene pi Rom soldia bitno yagl i moglmara pidre, bakagl tedre, yegl dio digwa, Ene Pol agre yun, no ye kotmo prumga i, aglke kor ka tau ama kira pogl pramnedi prumniwe dibi, no konbo bage teke pai mun, ye agre yunan, no yagl Pol i si goramniwe di, yegl digwa.<verse eid="ACT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16" />Ana yagl wagle i ka yegl di keglkwa ba Pol abauglo wam yoba tau digo, prisre, Pol abauglo wam i, ye u Pol soldia yuguno wagle yugugl pai moglmara udre, ye Pol di togwa. <verse eid="ACT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17" />Ye di togo, Pol ye ere mogl, soldia 100 sugl moglkwa yagl ta agle dugo, ugwa. Ugo, Pol ye di tedre, yegl dugwa, Ene kumugl i agre i pi yagl kade Rom soldia mudu bitno moglmara i en, kumugl magigl moglkwa i ka ta prukwa ye yagl kade i di tenabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18" />Dugo, soldia 100 bitno moglkwa yagl i ye Pol abauglo wam agre i pi yagl kade, Rom soldia mudu bitno yagl i moglmara pidre, ye di te, yegl dugwa, Yagl Pol, nono si kane sumgo, nono yuguno pai moglkwa i, ye na dede, kumugl i agre i en, ka ta prukwa ene di tenabedi di naruko, na ye agre i wiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19" />Ana soldia 100 bitno moglkwa yagl i ye kumugl i agre i pi yagl kade Rom soldia bitno yagl i moglmara pidre, ka yegl di togo, ana yagl kade Rom soldia bitno moglkwa i ye Pol abauglo wam ikra ogo ake i pi bina ta ogo, ye mudu miurko, ye kira pogl prukwa, Ene siragl ka pitnga na di naragledi une? di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20" />Yegl dugo, Pol abauglo wam i ye di te, yegl dugwa, Juda yoba kade ye ka di kogl, tagna ene motnara u ene bakagl tenamne digwa. Ye ene bakagl tedre, yegl dinamne digwa, Ene Pol agre yu no Kaunsil munara un, ye ka tau kira pogl pramniwe di yegl dinamnedi ka di keglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21" />Ye yegl dibi, ene pra we didre, Pol agre i bage un, yagl tau 40-pela mere yegl mogl ede mina eigwa ye u konbo bage teke pai mogl, yagl Pol i si goramnedi ka di keglmiwe dugwa. Te, ye ka giglede ta ama di padiglkwa i, ye nigl ya kaya mokna nekre, mogl ede pi yagl Pol si goglsre, okuo nigl ya kaya mokna nenamnedi ka giglede di padiglkwa. Yegl pre ye u ene ka di tenaiglkwa i, ene prikratnga pre na diwe di, Pol abauglo wam yegl dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22" />Yegl dugo, soldia bitno moglkwa yagl kade i ye di te, yegl dugwa, Ene erme u ka na di natnga i, yoba swara ta di tekro! didre, ye dedugo, Pol abauglo wam i, ede ogwa.<verse eid="ACT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ye Pol agre i pi Gavana Feliks moglmara eigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23" />Ana yagl kade Rom soldia bitno moglkwa i ye yagl suo, soldia 100-di pere pere sugl miurka agle dugo, ubrika. Ubriko, ye di tedre, yegl dugwa, Ene erme pi soldia tau bainet akidre, enaiglkwa i 200 idre, te soldia tau hos au sidre enaiglkwa i 70-pela idre, ama soldia kuglage akenaiglkwa i 200 idre, ye erme 9 klok eduer ede pi Sisaria, Gavana Feliks moglmara enaiglkwa pre ene ake kun eriro! di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24" />Yegl didre, ye yagl suo i ama yegl di togwa, Ene ama hos tau yagl Pol ye au sidre ede enabuka pre tedre, ye suglmo wakai mogl, agre i pi Gavana Feliks moglmara ede enabriwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25" />Ana soldia bitno yagl i ka yegl didre, ye ama pepa ta bogl, Gavana Feliks tedre, yegl dugwa, <verse eid="ACT 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26" />Yagl Kade Gavana Feliks yo, na Klodius Lisias pepa i ene bogl tedre, ene di wakai yei teiga. <verse eid="ACT 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27" />Na soldiana erme dediga, yagl ta agre yuigwa i, okna Juda yoba ye si ake gi di mogl, ye si goramnedi erikwa. Ye yegl erikwa ba yoba ta na di nare, Yagl i ye Rom yoba ta moglme digwa pre na soldia tau idre, ye ere simara pi, yagl i ere iga. <verse eid="ACT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28" />Ere idre, Juda yoba ye aglau siragl mere erume digwa i doko kanagledi yagl i agre i pi Juda yoba Kaunsilno wagle meglmara ediga. <verse eid="ACT 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29" />Edidre, na doko kaniga i, ye yene Juda yoba lono pre didre, yagl i aglau erume digwa ba kaima mabuno kide ta eran, nono ye si goramga mo si kane sinamga i ta kuno erekrukwa. <verse eid="ACT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30" />Te, Juda yoba tau yagl i si goramnedi ka di keglko, yoba ta u na di narukwa pre na yagl i tabre soldiana tedre, ye agre i pi ene motnga enaiglmedi dediga. Ye dedidre, te yoba ye kot ere tenamne digwa i, ye na di tedre, ye ene moratnara pi, kot ere tenaiglmedi di teiwe di, yagl kade Rom soldia bitno moglkwa i pepa mina yegl boglkwa.<verse eid="ACT 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31" />Ana eduer i, soldia ye yaglno kade dumere ere, Pol agre i pi taun ta konbo bage yogwa, Antipatris we dimara eigwa. <verse eid="ACT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32" />Eigo, tagna mogl soldia makandigle eigwa i ede ikne Jerusalem udre, ede pi yugu ta paimara i eigwa ba soldia tau hos au sidre eigwa i ye Pol kubu swara agre i pi taun Sisaria eigwa. <verse eid="ACT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33" />Pidre, ye yaglno kade pepa ta boglkwa ikra i pi gavana tedre, Pol ama i pi gavana moglmara gumamugl edigwa. <verse eid="ACT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34" />Edigo, gavana ye pepa ikra kere kan kodidre, Pol kira pogl pre, yegl dugwa, Ene provins aglo nem motne? dugo, Pol ye di te, Na provins Silisia nem ta moluwe di, yegl dugwa. Yegl dugo, gavana prisre, <verse eid="ACT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35" />ye Pol di te, yegl dugwa, Yoba tau ene kot ere tenamne digwa i wibi, na ene kotnen praluwe didre, ye soldia tau dedidre, ye Pol agre i pi kane yugu King Herot yugu ta okna kegwa yomara i, si kane sinaiglmedi dedugo, ye Pol i pi kane yugu edigo, moglkwa.<verse eid="ACT 23:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24" />
  <para style="s">Juda yoba kade ye Pol kot ere teigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1" />Ana ege 5-pela de Pol kane yugu pai moglko, tawa teigwa yoba bitno moglkwa yagl kagie Ananaias we digwa ikra yogo, te Juda yoba kade tau yeigo, te lo pre pogl sigwa yoba kagno loya we digwa, yagl swara ta kogon yegl erukwa kagie Tertulus we digwa ye akie ede u Gavana Feliks moglmara udre, ye gumamugl adigl, Pol kot ere tenamnedi wigwa. <verse eid="ACT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2" />Wigo, gavana ere mogl, soldia tau pi Pol kane yugu pai moglmara agre yunaiglmedi dedugo, eigwa. Pi agre yuigwa, moglko, loya Tertulus ye Pol kot ere tenagledi ugwa ikra ye ka ta gavana di te, yegl dugwa, Yagl kade gavana yo, no ene motnara atne kra munga pre ege olto kuda ta paikruko, wakai munga. Te, no kantrino okna u kide ogwa ba erme u wakai ogwa i, ene nomanen olto pai, wakai paugwa, ene no bitno motnga pre u wakai ogwa. <verse eid="ACT 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3" />Yegl pre no ege ege aglo mere wan munga i, ene no bitno motnga i no wakai prisre ene wakai pre tomga. <verse eid="ACT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4" />Ana na erme ka olto ta dikraglka ba na ene erme di praglka i, ene no wakai kan, ene egenen sugunagle ta no yagl Pol kot ere tenamnedi umga i norsre, ene no kotno pratnedi priwe dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5" />Ana loya Tertulus ikra ka yegl di tedre, ama ye Pol siragl mere erukwa i ye gavana di tedre, yegl dugwa, No kamga i, yagl Pol i ye kuda koglkwa yagl ta moglmiwe dugwa. Juda yoba ye dumo aglo mere ta meglmara i ye pidre, yene ikne ikne kuda boraiglmedi erumiwe dugwa. Te, Pol ye yugobuno pere ta ye yagl ta dumo Nasaret nem ta duglo beglkwa yoba meglmara suna i, ye yaglno kade ta moglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 24:5" /><verse number="6-8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6-8" />Te, ye ama no tawa tomga yuguno ere kide eragledi erukwa pre no ye si kane sumga. Ye aglau yegl erukwa i, ye yene di pitn, no kaima dimedi pratniwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 24:6-8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9" />Yegl dugo, Juda yoba tau ye bogl akie wigwa i ye kamo ake ple di, ye kaima dumiwe digwa.<verse eid="ACT 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pol ye Feliks gumamugl ka di togwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10" />Ana Juda yoba ikra ka yegl di kodigo, Gavana Feliks kan Pol moglmara ede, Pol ka dinabedi bre gima dugo, Pol ye di te, yegl dugwa, Yagl kade Feliks yo, na erme kana didre, aglau ta erekrie dinaglka i, na jas pere ta di tekre, ene di tenaglka i, na wakai prika, i siragl pre ene bugla yugu tau mere no kantrino jas motnga pre ene no ebrie mabunono pre pogl singa i, na pre kan eriwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11" />Ege 12-pela de mere yegl ede ogo, na ede pi Jerusalem suna pidre, God kagie kade tenagledi eiwe dugwa. Na ka kaima diga i, nogugl paugwa. Ene yoba tau di pitn, ye ama nogugl ene di tenaiglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12" />Na ede Jerusalem eiga i, na tawa teigwa yugu yomara mo taun suna mo ka mabuno yugu taun suna bage bage kei yeimara i, na ta yoba nonga didre, kuda boraiglmedi erekrika. Yoba magigl digwa i ta na aglau eriko, kandre, u dikrime dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13" />Na aglau kaima ta eribo, ye gumuglno mina ta kandre, u ene di nogugl ede tebi, ene ye ka kaima na erumere dimedi pratniwe dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14" />Ana Pol ka yegl didre, ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Na taragl swara ta ka kaima erimere ene di tenaglka i, no kowano awano Godno na kagie kade teiga i, Jisas konbauna sumara i mina kagie kade teiwe dugwa. Na mabuno yegl erimara i mina yoba i na yugobuno pere ta moglmiwe di, yegl digwa. Yegl digwa ba God lomo okna ibo beglkwa i ya te God kamo kep yoba okna ka beglkwa, Juda yoba pre mediglkwa i, na ama ka mudu i pre mediluwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15" />Ana okuo yoba God gumuglo mina du meglkwa ya ye gumuglo mina kide meglkwa i, mudu adigl u kor enaiglmedi erabuka ka i, na ye kaima erabedi priko, te nokanma wagle magigl di meglkwa i, ye ama God yegl erabedi primiwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16" />God yoba mudu adigl u kor enaiglmedi erabuka pre na ege ege God gumuglo mina ya yoba gumuglno mina mogl pai erika i, mabuno ta ere, agai goraglka mere yegl ta erekragledi eriwe dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17" />Na bugla yugu tau mere bage bage wan mogl, aglke kor ede ikne u Juda yoba tau goduglme meglkwa i, ake ple di tenagledi mige moni tau idre, te tawa ama gagl tenagledi wiwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18" />Na udre, no Juda yoba mabunono pamere God gumuglo mina deglbi yekragledi mabuno tau eraglka paugwa i na ersre, ede pi tawa teigwa yugu yomara togl suna pi, tawa gagl te moglka igne, Juda yoba tau provins Esia mogl wigwa i u na kanigwa. Na tawa tomga yugu togl suna moglmara i yoba mere ta moglkrumga. Te, yoba kuda ta bogl meglko, kankrime dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19" />Yegl pre Juda yoba tau u na kanigwa i, na aglau ta erumedi kanima, ye yene u ene motnara di nogugl ede teima, kuno eruko we dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20" />Mo, na tagl sedi Kaunsil wagle gumuglno mina adigl mogl, ka diga igne, aglau ta eribo, yagl magigl di meglkwa i, ye yene na aglau yegl erumedi ene di tebi, pratniwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21" />Na ye meglmara ka swara ta diga pre ye deno boglkwa pamiwe dugwa. Na ye meglmara suna moglsre, ka podo di, yegl diga, Na yoba geglkwa i adigl ede u kor enaiglmedi primara i pre ene kot ere narimiwe diga. Na yegl diga i pre ye kide prikwa pamiwe di, Pol yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22" />Ana Gavana Feliks i, ye Jisas konbaunamo duglo beglkwa yoba siragl mere pre mediglkwa i ye pre kan erukwa yagl ta moglkwa. Yegl pre ye Pol kotmo prukwa i pre yubu sinabuka kuno erukwa ba Pol ka di kodugo, ye ka digwa i pre yubu sikre, yegl dugwa, Soldia bitno yagl Lisias, Jerusalem moglkwa i u ka tau dinan, na prisre, ene kotno prika i, pre yubu sinaluwe di, yegl dugwa. Yegl didre, yoba yugugl meglkwa i di meda edugwa. <verse eid="ACT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23" />Di meda edidre, ye soldia 100 suglno moglkwa yagl ta di te, Pol i pi kane yugu edo dugwa. I pi kane yugu edinatnga ba ye kane yugu suna i yoko wan morabedi kanige ersre, te ye kabaglema tau u ye ake ple di tenamnedi eraiglkwa i ama kanige ero dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pol bugla yugu suo kane yugu pai moglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24" />Ana ege tau ede ogo, Feliks ye ebie Drusila, ye Juda abu ta moglkwa ye ebie i bogl ede yugugl ebriko, Feliks ye Pol ka tau dinan prabugledi agle dugo, ugwa. Pol udre, yoba Jisas, God Kere Yugwa Yagl pre mediglkwa i, mabuno siragl mere paugwa i di togo, pribrika. <verse eid="ACT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25" />Pre miurko, Pol ere mogl, mabuno du pamara eraiglkwa i pre didre, yoba mabuno gua gua eraiglkwa i mane dinaiglkwa paugwa pre di tedre, te God yoba okuo ka tage tenabuka pre di togo, Feliks ka dugwa i pre, kudugl gogl, Pol yegl di togwa, Pra dingo, priwa. Ege ta na yoko moglbo, na ene agle dibo, ene aglke kor u ka di noratniwe di, yegl dugwa. Yegl didre, Pol dedugwa. <verse eid="ACT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26" />Dedugo, ede ogwa ba yagl Feliks prukwa i, Pol ogo atne kogl, mige moni mo ki ta na kuduno erabedi prisre, sugl moglkwa. Yegl prukwa pre ye ege tau mere Pol bogl ka dinabugledi agle dugo, ugwa. <verse eid="ACT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27" />Ye ege tau mere Pol agle dugo, Pol ugo, ye ka denbi dibrika ba ye mige tau ogo atne kogl, na kuduno erabedi sugl mogl ede ogo, bugla yugu suo mere ede ogwa. Bugla yugu suo mere ede ogo, yagl ta kagie Porsius Festus we digwa i u Feliks agaimo yugo, Feliks ede ogwa. Feliks ede ogwa ba ye ede enagledi erukwa igne i ye Pol kotmo yubu sikrukwa ba ye Juda yoba wakai praiglmedi Pol kane yugu pai morabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25" />
  <para style="s">Pol Rom King na kotna prabiwe dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1" />Ana yagl ta kagie Festus we digwa, ye Feliks agaimo yugwa i, ede provins Judia udre, ede dumo Sisaria ogwa. Ye pi Sisaria ege 3-pela de mogl, aglke ede Jerusalem ogwa. <verse eid="ACT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2" />Ede pi Jerusalem ogo, tawa teigwa yoba bitno meglkwa i yeigo, Juda yoba kade bogl ye Gavana Festus moglmara u ye di te, Yagl Pol i, ye aglau kane kane erume digwa. Didre, ye ka giglede di te, yegl digwa, <verse eid="ACT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3" />Ene Pol agre i ede Jerusalem udre, kotmo pratniwe di, yegl digwa. Ye ka yegl digwa i, Festus ye Pol agre yunan, yoba tau konbo bage teke pai mogl, Pol si goraiglkwa pre ka yegl digwa. <verse eid="ACT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4" />Yegl eraiglkwa pre digwa ba Festus ye di ikne ede te, yegl dugwa, Pol ye Sisaria kane pai moglmiwe dugwa. Te, na ama ege olto ta moglkraglka. Ege sugunagle keme magigl i mogl, aglke ede ikne Sisaria enaluwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5" />Yegl pre yagl Pol i ye aglau ta erumedi pribi, ene yoba kade tau magigl meglkwa i bogl, nono akie ede pi Sisaria omun, ene ye kot ere tenaiglmiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6" />Ana yagl Festus ye pi Jerusalem 8-pela de mo 10-pela de mere ki yegl ta moglsre, aglke ede ikne Sisaria ogwa. Pi paugo, tagugo i, ye kot pragledi ame di mogl, yoba tau pi Pol auro yunaiglmedi dedugo, eigwa. <verse eid="ACT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7" />Ye pi Pol agre yuigo, Juda yoba kade wagle ikra ye Jerusalem mogl, Pol kot ere tenamnedi wigwa i, ye Pol moglmara mogl winabo di, ye Yagl Pol i aglau podo kane kane yegl erumiwe di, yegl digwa. Yegl digwa ba ye digwa i, mogo wakai ta paikrukwa. <verse eid="ACT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8" />Juda yoba kade wagle ka kane kane yegl digo, Pol yene kamo mina yegl dugwa, Na Juda yoba lono ta si biglke dikrie dugwa. Te, tawa teigwa yugu ere kide erekre, te Rom King ama aglau ta ere tekriwe, di, Pol yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9" />Ana Pol ka yegl dugwa ba Festus ye Juda yoba na gun yei naraiglmedi ye Pol di pre, yegl dugwa, Ene aglau kane kane etne dimara i, na Jerusalem mogl, ene kotnen praglka i, pra we di pitno? dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 25:9" /><verse number="10-11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10-11" />Yegl dugo, Pol ye di ikne ede te, yegl dugwa, Yugu erme makai sumnara magigl i, Rom King ye yugu i kot yugu yenabe dugwa pre ene magigl i na kotna pratnga i, pra we dugwa. Yoba magigl i, na aglau kane kane etniwe digwa ba na Juda yoba ta ere kide ere tekrika. Ye ka kibi digwa i, enene pre kan etniwe dugwa. Ene na si goratnga mere yegl ta aglau eribo, na goraglka i ta mane dikraglka, pra we dinaluwe dugwa. Ba yagl wagle magigl digwa i ka kibi digwa pre ene na i pi Juda yoba ogono wagle yenatnga i, kuno ta erekrumiwe dugwa. Yegl pre na Rom King kotna prabedi di priwe di, Pol yegl dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 25:10-11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12" />Yegl dugo, Festus ye nomane teigwa yoba meglkwa i bogl ka di priko, Festus ye Pol di te, yegl dugwa, Ene Rom King ene kotnen prabiwe dinga pre ene Rom King moglmara en, ye ene kotnen prabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Festus ye King Agripa di te, ene Pol kamo pratniwe dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13" />Ana Festus ka yegl di, Pol togo, ege tau ede ogo, King ta kagie Agripa we digwa i ye abauglo Bernaisi bogl ede u Festus dumo Sisaria moglmara udre, di wakai yei tenabugledi ubrika. <verse eid="ACT 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14" />Ye u ege tau mere pai miurko, Festus ye ege swara ta ere mogl, Pol kamo di, King Agripa te, yegl dugwa, Feliks okna gavana moglkwa igne i ye yagl ta si kane sugwa, erme kane yugu pai moglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15" />Na u ege sugunagle ta igle mogl, ede Jerusalem eiga ege i, tawa teigwa yoba bitno meglkwa i ya Juda yoba kade meglkwa i na moglmara u di nare, Yagl Pol i aglau kane kane erume didre, na ye kotmo pre yubu sidre, aglau kaima erume dinatne di, ka yegl dime dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16" />Ye yegl digwa ba na ye di te, yegl diga, No Rom yoba munga i, mabunono pere ta pame diga. No yoba ta kotno prikre, ere sinamga i, aglau pame diga. Yegl didre, na ye ama yegl di teiga, Yoba ere mogl, yoba ta kot ere tebi, yoba ta aglau erume digwa yoba i, ye yene ama mogl, prisre, ka tau di ikne edenan, no pre wakai ere, ere sinamga kuno erumiwe di, na ka yegl di teiwe dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17" />Ana Gavana Festus ka yegl di King Agripa ikra tedre, ka tau ama yegl dugwa, Ana Juda yoba ikra ye u makai sigo, na kandre, na sugl ta moglkrika. Tagugo i, tabre pi, kotno pragledi ame di moglsre, yoba tau ye pi yagl ikra agre yunaiglmedi dedigo, ye pi agre yuigwa. <verse eid="ACT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18" />Ye agre yuigo, Juda yoba kade wagle ikra adigl mogl, ka digo, na pre moglka i, yagl i lo podo ta si biglke dumiwe dinaiglmedi prika i, ta dikrikwa. <verse eid="ACT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19" />Ye Juda yoba siragl mere pre mediglmere i pre aglau ere dumiwe didre, te yagl ta Jisas we digwa, ye goglkwa ba adigl u kor omiwe di, yagl Pol i yegl dugwa i pre aglau ere dume di, yegl dimiwe dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 25:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20" />Ana Festus ka yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Juda yoba i ye yagl Pol pre ka yegl digo, na mabunomo kaima siragl mere paugwa i doko kanaglka kuno erekrumedi prika pre na yagl Pol i di pre, yegl diga, Ene aglau kane kane etne dimara i, nono ede dumo Jerusalem omun, ene kotnen praglka i, pra we di pitno? di yegl diga <verse eid="ACT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21" />ba yagl Pol i mane didre, Na kane yugu pai moglbo, Rom King na kotnana okuo prabiwe di, yegl dugwa. Yegl dugwa pre na pra ye dumere ere, kane yugu pai moran, okuo na ye Rom King moglmara enabedi dedenagle di, yegl di padiluwe di, Festus yegl dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22" />Ana Festus ka yegl di kodugo, King Agripa ikra prisre, ye di te, yegl dugwa, Ana yagl Pol i, ye u kamo i tau dinan, na pragledi priwe di, yegl dugwa. Yegl dugo, Ye tagna u dinan, ene pratniwe di, Gavana Festus yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23" />Ana Festus yegl dugwa pre tagugo i, King Agripa ye abauglo Bernaisi bogl eken wakai kaima gagl, yoba kade mabunono paugo, ere eimere yegl ere, ye ede pi yoba yugu ta makai si, si erimara i yugugl ebrika. Ye ede yugugl ebriko, soldia bitno yoba tau ya dumo Sisaria yoba kade meglkwa i ama akie ede yugugl eigwa. Ede yugugl eigo, Festus ye yoba tau pi Pol agre yunaiglmedi dedugo, ye pi agre yuigwa.<verse eid="ACT 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24" />Ana Pol ye agre yu yoba kade wagle ikra meglmara edigo, Gavana Festus yegl dugwa, King Agripa ya ene yoba mudu magigl meglkwa i, ene yagl Pol i kanimiwe dugwa. Yagl Pol i, Juda yoba Jerusalem meglkwa i yeigo, te Juda yoba dumo magigl i ta meglkwa i ama yeigo, ye mudu yagl Pol i aglau podo ta erumiwe didre, ka podo di, na ye si gorabedi na di primiwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25" />Yegl digwa ba na doko kaniga i, ye aglau podo ta eran, na ye si goraglka i, kuno ta erekrume dugwa. Ba yagl i yene na di narsre, Na Rom King kotna prabiwe dugwa pre na ye dumere ere, ye okuo dedenagle diga. <verse eid="ACT 25:25" /><verse number="26-27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26-27" />Yegl diga ba na ye dedibo, ye pi yaglna kade Rom King moglmara enan, ye kotmo prabuka i, na aglau siragl mere erukwa i pre pogl sikrika pre na ye aglau yegl erumedi pepa mina bogl tenaglka i, ta pre kan erekrie dugwa. I siragl pre na prika i, na kane yoba ta dedibo, pi Rom King moglmara enabuka i, na ye aglau siragl mere erukwa i pepa mina ta bogl tebo, kuno erabuka. Ta manan, kuno erekrabuka. Yegl pre King Agripa na yagl Pol i agre i ede u ene motnara ya te, ene mudu magigl meglkwa i meglmara ediga i, yene dinan, nono kamo prisre, kira wakai ere pun, na pepa siragl mere Rom King bogl tenaglka i pre pogl sidre, bogl tenaluwe di, Festus ka yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 25:26-27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26" />
  <para style="s">Pol ye King Agripa ka di togwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1" />Ana Festus ka yegl di kodugo, King Agripa ere mogl, ye Pol di te, Ene kanen do dugwa. Yegl dugo, Pol ye ogo koglo ake mina ede, ye ka yegl dugwa,<figure style="fig" alt="Paul before king Agrippa" file="Cn02146B.tif" size="span" loc="26.1-23" copy="David C. Cook" ref="26.1">King Agripa Pol kotmo prukwa</figure> <verse eid="ACT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2" />King Agripa yo, Juda yoba na aglau kane kane erume digwa pre ye dimara i na erme kana di ikne ede, ene di pogl tenaglka i, gun yeiwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3" />Na kana di, ene di tenaglka pre gun podo yeiga i, i siragl pre no Juda yoba mabunono ya te, no ka mabuno prumnara i pre ege ege nonga dumga i, ene pre kan etniwe dugwa. Yegl pre na ene di praglka i, na erme ka olto dinaglka ba ene oglka erekratnga pre na ene di priwe dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4" />Pol ka yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Na gak kebra mogl, Juda yoba yugobunono mina mogl, yake, te dumo Jerusalem siragl mere mogl pai erika i, Juda yoba mudu na pre kan erime dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5" />Juda yoba na kamun kuade pre kan erikwa pre na siragl mere moglka i ye di nogugl edinamnedi pribi, dinaiglkwa. No Juda yoba ka mabuno prumnara i, yoba tau God lomo duglo boramnedi erikwa ba Farisi yoba swara giglede kaima ere, lo duglo boramnedi erikwa. Na ama okna Farisi yoba meglmara i suna mogl, lono duglo boglka i, Juda yoba mudu pre kan erikwa pre yene ama di nogugl edenaiglkwa kuno erume dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6" />Ana na erme u guman mina adiglka i, no Juda yoba kowano awano ibo God ka kaima ta di te padigl, yoba okuo adigl u kor enaiglmiwe dugwa i, na kaima plau dinabedi primara pre ye na kot ere narimiwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7" />Juda yoba yugobunono 12-pela God kogonmo eramnedi kogon ermne ya eduer erikwa i, ye God okna ibo ka kaima di te paduglkwa i, ka kaima inamnedi kogon erikwa. Pro! God okna ibo no kowano awano ka kaima ta di te paduglkwa ka swara i ye inamnedi kogon eriko, te na ka swara i pre mediglka pre kot ere narikwa. I ta kuno erekrumedi priwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8" />Yegl didre, ye Juda yoba tau yugugl meglkwa i di pre, yegl dugwa, Yagl ta goglko, God ye ere i kor edugwa i, ene siragl pre God yegl ta erabuka kuno erekrumedi prime? dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9" />Ana Pol ka yegl didre, aglke kor King Agripa di te, yegl dugwa, Na okna prika i, na kogon kane kane ere, Jisas, dumo Nasaret nem moglkwa i kagie ake atne edenaglka pamedi priwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10" />Na yegl prisre, Jerusalem moglka igne kaima yegl erika. Tawa teigwa yoba bitno meglkwa i na dedigo, na Jisas yobama tau mere si kane siwe dugwa. Te, yagl kade wagle ye Jisas yobama tau si goramnedi ka tagigwa igne, na ama ye si goramniwe diwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11" />Na yegl ersre, te na ege mere ede pi Juda yoba ka mabuno yugu bage bage kei yeimara pidre, Jisas pre mediglkwa yoba ta meglkwa i ere kide ere tei, ye Jisas kagie kide tenaiglmedi giugl teiwe dugwa. Na yegl ersre, ama dena podo kubro ye teiga pre na ede pi kantri pere pere pidre, taun bage bage yeimara suna i wan u ikne ikne pi, Jisas pre mediglkwa yoba ere kide ere teiwe di, Pol yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pol ye siragl mere Jisas pre meduglkwa i, boglo kuglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12" />Ana Pol yegl didre, ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Ana aglke ta, tawa teigwa yoba bitno meglkwa i na dedidre, Jisas pre mediglkwa yoba Damaskus meglkwa i, ere kide ere tenatnedi na dedigo, na eiwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13" />Ana King yo, ene pro! No yoba tau bogl konbo bage omgo, ermine abuglage podo kide kaima ta heven ibo si atne no omnara i edugwa. Abuglage i, ade ta sikrumere mere podo sume dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14" />Ana abuglage podo yegl mere si makandigle edugo, no yoba tau omga i, mudu yage makandigle sumgo, na prika i, Yagl ta ka Aram mina didre, na kira poglme dugwa. Ye na kira pogl, Sol yo, ene siragl pre na ere kide ere nare motne? di, yegl dugwa. Na ere kide ere naragledi etn, enene giugl pratniwe di, yegl dugo, na prisre, <verse eid="ACT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15" />na ye kira pogl pre, Yagl Kade yo, ene irane? diga. Yegl digo, ye di nare, Na Jisas, ene na ere kide ere nare motnga i, moluwe di, yegl dumiwe di, Pol yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16" />Ana Jisas ka yegl di narsre, ka ta ama yegl di narumiwe dugwa, Ene adiglo dugwa. Na ene motnara plau diga i, ene na niglna kogona yoba motn, na ene dedenaglka pre plau diga. Na ene dedibo, ene ede pi na erme ene motnara plau diga i ya te, okuo moratnara plau dibo, kanatnga i, yoba di nogugl ede tenatniwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17" />Na ene dediga i, ene ede pi Juda yoba ya yoba yugobuno pere pere meglmara i enatnedi dediwe dugwa. Ene en, yoba ene ere kide ere te dinaiglmedi nana ene kugl bogl tenaluwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18" />Te, na ene dediga i, ene na kana i pi yoba di ten, ye nomane inaiglkwa pre ene dediga. Ye nomane idre, mim mina meglkwa i kide kodo, ede u abuglage sumara unaiglkwa. Te, ye Satan moglmara atne kra meglkwa i kide kodo, ede u God moglmara atne pi moraiglkwa. Te, na ye tadaglmeno gugl ede tebo, ye yoba tau ama na pre mediglkwa, God ye ere i ye yobama edugwa i bogl, taragl wakai wakai akie inaiglmiwe di, Jisas na yegl di narume di, Pol yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pol ye kogon siragl mere erukwa i, King Agripa di togwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19" />Ana Pol ye ka yegl didre, ka ta ama di King Agripa te, yegl dugwa, Na kaniga, abuglage podo ta heven ibo yei, si atne makandigle edugo, ege swara i mina Jisas na ye kamo i pi yoba tenatnedi di narukwa, prika ikra, na ta pre, kide kodokrika. <verse eid="ACT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20" />Na ye di narumere ere, dumo Damaskus mabuno bogl yoba di tedre, wan ede pi dumo Jerusalem pi di te, te distrik Judia suna bage bage Juda yoba meglmara i di tedre, ama yoba yugobuno pere pere meglmara i ka di teiwe dugwa. Na ka di teiga i, yoba nomane kor idre, God kamo pre medraiglmedi ka di teiga. Te, ye nomane kor idre, mabuno ta eraiglkwa kuno erukwa i, ama eraiglmedi ka di teiwe dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21" />Ana na kogon yegl ere moglka pre ege swara ta na ede tawa teigwa yugu yomara togl suna pi moglko, Juda yoba tau u, na si ake gi di mogl, na si goramnedi erikwa. <verse eid="ACT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22" />Ye yegl erikwa ba God ye na di narumere ere, okna ede u erme ugwa i pra na ake ple di naruko, na erme adigl moglsre, yoba kade meglkwa ya yoba yoko meglkwa i pra Jisas kamo di teiwe dugwa. Na yoba ka di teiga i, God ka kep yobama ya te Moses ama taragl tau plau dinabe dimere kuno yegl keme di teiga. <verse eid="ACT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23" />Ye okna digwa i, God Kere Yugwa Yagl ye komono kana giugl prisre, gogl, adigl u kor enan, okuo yoba goraiglkwa ama adigl u kor enaiglmiwe di, yegl digwa. Ka kep yoba i okna ka yegl didre, ama yegl digwa, God Kere Yugwa Yagl unan, ye God kamo, ken abuglage mere yogwa i, Juda yoba di tedre, yoba yugobuno pere pere meglkwa i ama di tenabiwe di, ka kep yoba okna yegl digwa. Ka kep yoba okna dimere kuno yegl na ama yoba di te wan moluwe dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pol ye King Agripa pre medrabedi ka di togwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24" />Pol yene pre ka tau yegl di moglko, Gavana Festus ikra ere mogl, ka podo di, Pol, ene du etniwe! dugwa. Ene sule di, ka tau mere beke motnga pre bitn kide erumiwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25" />Yegl dugo, Pol ye Festus di te, yegl dugwa, Yagl Kade Festus yo, na du ta erekrika. Na ka kaima pamara diwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26" />Na ka diga i, King Agripa ye pre kan erukwa pre na kudugl goglkre, nogugl diga. Na Jisas pre diga i, ye okna u kogon erukwa i, nogugl paugwa pre King Agripa pre kan erumedi priwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27" />Yegl didre, ye ere mogl, King Agripa di pre, Ene okna ka kep yoba ka beglkwa i ene ama pre mediglnedi priwe dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28" />Ana Pol ka yegl dugo, King Agripa di ikne ede te, yegl dugwa, Ene pitn, ene ka ege sugunagle ta dinara i, na kaima dinedi prisre, Kristen morabedi pitno? dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29" />Yegl dugo, Pol ye aglke kor di ikne te, yegl dugwa, Na ka ege sugunagle ta dinaglka mo olto dinaglka i, na God agle di prika, ene king motnga i ya te, yoba mudu magigl mogl, ka diga pre meglkwa i, na moglmere mere yegl moraiglmedi God agle di priwe dugwa. Na ka diga i, na kane paimere yegl panaiglkwa pre dikrika ba na Kristen moglmere yegl moraiglkwa pre diwe di, Pol yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30" />Ana Pol ka yegl di kodugo, King Agripa ye abauglo Bernaisi bogl yebriko, te Gavana Festus yogo, yoba mudu akie ame di mogl, Pol ka dugo, pre meglkwa ikra adigl, <verse eid="ACT 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31" />ede meda eigwa. Ede meda pidre, ye yene di ibor ya ede, yegl digwa, Yagl i ye aglau podo ta eran, nono ye si goramga mo si kane sinamga yegl mere ta erekrume digwa. <verse eid="ACT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32" />Yegl digo, King Agripa ama ye Gavana Festus di tedre, Yagl i ye Rom King na kotna prabe di, yegl ta dikruma, ye i meda edinamgo ba ye di kodugwa pre Rom King moglmara enabuka pamiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27" />
  <para style="s">Pol sip mina edidre, ede dumo Rom enabedi dedigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1" />Ana okuo Gavana Festus ere mogl, na Luk yeigo, Pol ya kane yoba tau ye sip mina ede kantri Itali, Rom King moglmara enaiglmedi di paduglkwa. Yegl di paduglko, Pol yogo, kane yoba tau yoba ye i pi soldia ta kagie Julius we digwa i ogo mina yeigwa. Yagl Julius i, ye Rom soldia 1,000 mere ye kagno Rom King Soldiama we digwa i meglmara suna moglkwa ba ye soldia 100 mere yegl ama bitno moglkwa.<figure style="fig" alt="Map - Paul's Journey to Rome" file="Map_Paul 4_Kuman.jpg" size="span" loc="27.1-40" copy="FMOsoft" ref="27.1" /> <verse eid="ACT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2" />Ana yoba tau ye kane yoba i pi yagl Julius i ogo mina yeigo, sip ta dumo Adramitium padre, ugwa sip i mina no ede kuglo omga. Sip i, ede pi provins Esia pidre, taun nigle bina bage bage yeimara i enabuka pre no sip i mina ede kuglo pidre, ede omga. Ana no yagl ta kagie Aristarkus we digwa i bogl akie ede omga. Ye taun Tesalonaika, provins Masedonia suna i nem ta moglkwa.<verse eid="ACT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3" />Ana no sip mina pi mungo, tagugwa. Tagugo i, no ede pi taun ta Saidon we dimara plau dumga. No pi taun Saidon i plau dumgo, yagl Julius i ye mabuno wakai ere, Pol tedre, Pol ede pi kabaglema meglmara enan, ye ake ple di tenaiglmedi pra we dugo, Pol ye ede makandigle pidre, kabaglema meglmara ogwa. <verse eid="ACT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4" />Pol pi kabaglema meglmara wan kandre, ede ikne ugo, no aglke kor sip mina ede omga. No sip mina nigle ede omgo, ir podo magugwa pre sip i aglke ede u ailan ta Saiprus we dimara i mokomugl kra pidre, ede omga. <verse eid="ACT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5" />Ana no sip i mina ede pi provins suo Silisia ya Pamfilia bina pidre, ede pi provins Lisia suna i taun ta Maira we dimara omga. <verse eid="ACT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6" />Sip i no i pi taun Maira edugo, soldia bitno yagl i kanugwa, sip ta Aleksandria padre, ede Itali enagledi ugo, kandre, soldia bitno yagl i no i pi sip i mina edugo, sip i mina ede omga.<verse eid="ACT 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7" />Ana no sip ta i mina ede omgo, ir podo mage, sip guma ake nu si ikne edugwa pre yoba sip mina kogon erikwa i kogon podo eriko, no ege tau mere nigle kie kiede wan ede omga. No wan ede pi taun ta Nidus we dimara enamnedi ede magigl omga ba ir podo kaima mage, sip guma ake nu si ikne ede pai moglkwa pre no taun Nidus i enamga kuno erekrukwa. Kuno erekrukwa pre no ede pi dumo ta nigle suna yogwa Krit we dimara i ede u mokomugl pi, dumo kamun ta Salmone we digwa i yade, ede omga. <verse eid="ACT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8" />Sip mina kogon erikwa yoba i kogon podo ere pai meglko, no ailan Krit nigle bina wan ede pi dumo ta kagie Sip Panaiglkwa Dumo Wakai we dimara pi pamga. Dumo i, taun ta Lasea yomara magigl yogwa.<verse eid="ACT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9" />Ana no sip mina ede dumo igle omga ba no ege tau mere nigle suna kie kiede omga pre Juda yoba egeno kade ta kaya mokna mawagl erikwa ege i dudugwa. Ege i dudugo, ir podo magenabuka ege magigl erukwa pre sip mina wanamga kuno erekrabuka paugwa. Yegl paugwa pre Pol ye ka giglede di, no yoba sip mina akie omga i, di te, yegl dugwa, <verse eid="ACT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10" />Yagl wagle, na prika, nono erme sip mina ede nigle suna omun, sip ake yake tenan, bonagana wau boran, te nono yoba mudu goramniwe dugwa. Yegl pre nono pikre, dumo igle mogl pai moramniwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11" />Pol yegl dugwa ba soldia bitno yagl ta no sugl moglkwa i, ye Pol ka dugwa prikrukwa. Ye sip kan nogwa yagl ya sip akugwa yagl ye taragl yegl ta plau dikrabe dibrika pre soldia bitno yagl i, ye ka dibrika prukwa.<verse eid="ACT 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12" />Ana no sip mina pi dumo ta pamnara i, Pol moramniwe dugwa ba yoba kanigwa i, ir podo unabuka ege dumo i moramga, wakai paikrabuka. Yegl pre yoba mere sip mina meglkwa i ka di kogl, kuno eran, no dumo pamnara i kide kodo, ede pi taun ta Finiks we dimara i pidre, ir podo unabuka ege i dumo Finiks moramnedi ka di keglkwa. Dumo Finiks i, ailan Krit suna i yogo, sip pi pai, pai erikwa dumo ama yogwa. Dumo i sip ede suna enaiglkwa i, ye ede pi nigl beye kra pidre, kuri ta ede ida u ade beimara kra pidre, ede suna unaiglkwa yogo, te ye ede nigl bre kra pidre, ama kuri ta ede ime u ade beimara kra udre, ede suna unaiglkwa yogo, erukwa.<verse eid="ACT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ir waga podo ta ugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13" />Ana no dumo ta kagie Sip Panaiglkwa Dumo Wakai we dimara ikra pai mungo, ir kuri ta nigl beye kra mage ede ida ugo, yoba prikwa i, ede dumo Finiks enamga kuno erumedi prisre, anka gudu yu sip bolamugl edigo, no ailan Krit nigle bina wan ede dumo Finiks enamnedi omga. <verse eid="ACT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14" />Wan ede omga ba ede eglke pikungo, ir waga podo ta ailan Krit yomara mogl ugwa. Ir waga i, kagie Nigl Bre ya Ade Umara Ir Waga we digwa. <verse eid="ACT 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15" />Ir waga podo ugwa pre yoba sip guma akenaiglkwa kuno erekrukwa. Kuno erekrukwa pre ir u sip ake nu si, i ede aglo mere enabuka i, i ede enabedi kanige eriko, no ede omga.<verse eid="ACT 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16" />Ir waga podo i no ake nu si ede pi ailan kebra ta kagie Kauda we dimara i, aket kra edugo, ake ede omga. Ailan i ede aket omgo, ir kuri ta ede atne ogwa. Ir kuri ta ede atne ogo, yoba sip mina kogon erikwa i kogon podo kaima ersre, ye baglkugl kebra ta sip mina kan kogl padiglkwa i aglke gudu yu magigl edidre, <verse eid="ACT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17" />yu sip bolamugl edigwa. Yegl ersre, te ye ama nigl si pepigl di, sip si buko di dinabedi sip atne kra i, kan kogl winabo di, si ake gigledi padiglkwa. Yegl ersre, ama ir u sip ake nu si pi, wesan tau dumo Sirtis we dimara mudi nigl suna moglmara i edenan, sip wesan mina pai moran, nigl si pepigl di, sip si buko di dinabedi kudugl gogl, sel kogl padiglkwa i ama i atne edigo, no yoko nigle yaudomugl ir aglo mere no ake nu si i ede ogwa i, ede omga.<verse eid="ACT 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18" />Ana tagugo i, nigl podo kide si pepigl di, sip mina sugwa pre yoba sip mina kogon erikwa i ere mogl, sip yubun de dinabedi bonagana tau yuigwa i pia si nigle edigwa. <verse eid="ACT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19" />Yegl erikwa ba tagna ta i, nigl podo ama si pepigl di, sip mina si pai moglkwa pre kogon erikwa taragl sip mina yogwa i ama pia si nigle edigwa. <verse eid="ACT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20" />Ana igne i no ere mogl, sip mina i, kor moglkramga mere prumga. Siragl pre no ege olto kaima ade mo kugl kuri ta kankrumgo, te, ir waga podo ikra aimadi u pai moglkwa pre no prumga i, sip mina i wau bogl, goramga keme pamedi prumga.<verse eid="ACT 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21" />Ana ir waga podo ugwa ikra ege mere kide aimadi kamin u moglko, yoba sip mina kogon erikwa ikra, kogon podo ere meglkwa. Ye ege ta yenan, kaya mokna ne, yoko moraiglkwa i ta manga pre ye ege tau mere kaya mokna nekre, kogon keme ere meglkwa. Ye kogon podo yegl ere meglko, ege swara ta Pol ye melgmara suna adigl mogl, ye yegl di togwa, Yagl wagle, na ene ka okna di teiga ikra pre meglmo? dugwa. Na ene di tei, nono ailan Krit dumo ta moramne diga ikra muna, kuno eruko ba ene na ka diga sedigwa pre nono umga. Erme taragl kane kane kide eruko, bonagana mere nigle wau boglkwa i, ene kanimiwe di, Pol yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22" />Ana Pol ka yegl di tedre, ama yegl dugwa, Ene na ka diga sedigwa pre aglau erikwa ba erme ene kudugl goglkrio! dugwa. Nono erme umga i, sip kide erabuka ba ene swara ta goglkraiglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23" />Siragl pre na Godna, ye na bitna moglko, na ye kogonmo ere teiga i, ye angelomo swara ta eduer u na gumanamugl adigl mogl, yegl di narumiwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24" />Pol yo, ene kudugl goglkro! Ene nigle i ta wau bogl, goglkratniwe di, yegl di narukwa. Siragl pre God ene suglnen moran, ene ede pi Rom King gumamugl adigl, kot eratnga paugwa pre God ene suglnen morabiwe di, yegl di narukwa. Ene suglnen morabara i ama yoba mudu ene sip mina akie wigwa i ama ta goglkraiglmiwe di, angelo i yegl di narumiwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25" />Yegl di narukwa pre ene erme kudugl goglkrio! God kamo angelo u di narukwa i, na kaima pai inabedi pre mediluwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26" />Nono kaima ta goglkramga ba sip pi, ailan dumo makan ta yenabara pi, bina kide ere panabiwe di, Pol yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27" />Ana ir waga podo ikra ege 14-pela de mere yegl u pai mogl, no ake nu sugo, no mudi nigl Mediterenian we dimara suna i ede pi munga. No pi mungo, ege 13-pela de yogo, ana ege 14 mina i, eduer suna yoba sip mina kogon erikwa i prikwa, dumo makan ta yomara ede nigle bina u dumnedi prisre, <verse eid="ACT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28" />ye ain ta kane kogl, pia si nigle ede, aglke kor gudu i meda ede, kanigwa i, nigl mur yogwa i, 37 mita mere yegl yogo, kanigwa. Ye kandre, kuri ta mogl, ede ido pidre, ain ikra aglke kor ede atne ede kanigwa i, 27 mita mere yegl, nigl mur yogo, <verse eid="ACT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29" />kandre, ye prikwa i, Ede magigl u kodumga pre kobuglo kade kade ta nigle bina panan, sip pi kobuglo mina ake pai dinabedi pre, kudugl gogl, anka 4-pela sip mokomugl ede nigl atne ede padigl, ye kamun tagenabedi kamage ere meglkwa.<verse eid="ACT 27:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30" />Ana okuo, yoba sip mina kogon erikwa i, sip kide kodo, baglkugl mina teke ede enamnedi baglkugl sip bolamugl yogwa i, kane kogl, pia si nigle edigwa. Yegl ersre, ye yoba tau sip mina meglkwa i ka kibi di te, No anka tau baglkugl mina i pi sip gumamugl korauniwe di, yegl digwa. <verse eid="ACT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31" />Yegl digwa ba Pol ye erikwa i pre kan ersre, yagl ta soldia bitno moglkwa i ya soldia mudu sip mina meglkwa i di te, yegl dugwa, Yoba i ye sip ta kide kodo, ede ebi, nono mudu kor moramne diga ikra, na prika, kuno erekrabiwe dugwa. Ene tau ama goraiglkwa pamiwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32" />Yegl dugwa pre soldia ere mogl, sip kogon erikwa yoba ikra ede pikraiglmedi mane di tedre, baglkugl ede atne edigwa kan i mudu si bugl di edigo, baglkugl nigl tebe ede ogwa.<verse eid="ACT 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33" />Ana ege i kamun tagenagledi eruko, Pol ye yoba sip mina akie umga i kaya mokna nenaiglmedi di te, yegl dugwa, Ene ege 14-pela de nomane sidre, kaya mokna nekrikwa <verse eid="ACT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34" />pre na erme ene ka giglede di teiga i, Ene kaya mokna neo! di, yegl dugwa. Siragl pre nono kaya mokna nedre, keme kor moramga paugwa. Ene nomane sidre, kaya mokna nekrikwa i, kide kodo, neo! Nono mudi nigl suna i, swara ta wau bogl, goglkramga. Mudu kor moramniwe di, Pol yegl dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35" />Yegl didre, ye yoba mudu sip mina munga i gumuglnomugl bret ta idre, God di wakai yei tedre, buko di nogwa. <verse eid="ACT 27:35" /><verse number="36-37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36-37" />Buko di nogo, yoba mudu 276 mere sip mina munga i kandre, nomane sikre, kaya mokna i nomga. <verse eid="ACT 27:36-37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38" />Ana yoba kaya mokna neigwa, dano eruko, ye sip yubun dekre, u dinabedi wit mogo tau sip mina yuigwa i, pia si mudi nigl edigwa.<verse eid="ACT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sip wesan mina ake padre, buko dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39" />Kamun tagugo, yoba sip mina kogon erikwa i dumo makan ta yogo, kanigwa ba ye dumo makan aglo mere wigwa i kan pogl sikrikwa. Ye kan pogl sikrikwa ba ye kanigwa i, nigl tau pa si ede dumo makan yomara suna ogwa mere kandre, ye prikwa i, kuno eran, sip ake i pi, nigl pa si ede suna omara, wesan wakai yomara i padramniwe di, ka di keglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40" />Ka yegl di koglsre, ye sip mokomugl anka edigwa i mudu si bugl di nigle edidre, ye sip guma akenamnedi sip guma akigwa taragl suo okna i mitna ede kan kogl padiglkwa i, kan poko ede, taragl suo i ede nigle ede padiglko, yoba tau ama sel ta ake mina ede, sip gumamugl keglkwa. Yegl ere, ede wesan yomara enamnedi ere eigwa <verse eid="ACT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41" />ba nigl i mur yeikrukwa. Nigl tebe yogwa pre sip ogwa, wesan mina ake gi di paugo, sip ede enagledi erukwa kuno erekruko, sip mokomugl nigl podo si, kuri kuri di, si buko di moglkwa.<verse eid="ACT 27:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42" />Ana sip mokomugl i, nigl si pepigl di, sip kuri kuri di, si buko di moglko, soldia wagle prikwa i, kane yoba ta nigl kuba si, teke ede ebi we di pre, ye ka di kogl, Kane yoba mudu si goramniwe digwa. <verse eid="ACT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43" />Yegl digwa ba soldia bitno moglkwa yagl i ye Pol si goglkraiglmedi pre, Kane yoba swara ta si goglkrio! di, mane dugwa. Yegl didre, ye yoba sip mina meglkwa i di te, tau nigl kuba sinaiglkwa kuno erabuka mere i, okna kana puglo di ede nigle pidre, kuba si ede meda enaiglmedi di tedre,<figure style="fig" alt="Shipwreck" file="cn02045B.tif" size="span" loc="27.42-43" copy="David C. Cook" ref="27.43" /> <verse eid="ACT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44" />Te, yoba nigl kuba si kankrikwa i, ede paglkane mo sip bage ta, nigl si buko di ede enabuka i idre, nigl yaudomugl wan ede meda enaiglmedi di togo, no pra pra yegl ere, swara ta goglkunga. Mudu ede meda pi, kor munga.<verse eid="ACT 27:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28" />
  <para style="s">Pol ailan ta Malta we dimara moglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1" />Ana no yoba mudu sip mina umga i nigl kuba si ede meda omgo, makan nem yoba u, no di noro, yegl digwa, Dumo magigl i, kagie Malta we dimiwe digwa. <verse eid="ACT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2" />Yegl didre, makan nem yoba i no ere wakai ere norikwa. Kamun sugo, ir erukwa pre ye ede ere gagl, no agre i pi, ede ere gaiglmara edigwa. <verse eid="ACT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3" />Edigo, no ede pre mungo, Pol ye pi, ede nagl tau suku yu gaglkwa. Suku yu gaglmara i, toki kide ta pai moglko, akie yu gaglkwa pre ede de, niga dugo, toki i tabre si pglkai si, Pol ogo mina kagl budu paugwa. <verse eid="ACT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4" />Yegl eruko, makan nem yoba i Pol kandre, yene di ikne ikne ede pre, yegl digwa, Yagl i, ye yoba ta si goglkwa pamiwe digwa. Ye nigle suna iro gorabuka goglkrukwa pre nono godno ta yoba mabuno kide erimara ere ikne ede togwa god i, ye erme gorabedi prisre, toki kide dedugo, u ye sumiwe di, yegl digwa. <verse eid="ACT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5" />Yegl digwa ba Pol ye ogo ake pia sugo, toki i yage doga mina si, de goglko, Pol yoko moglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6" />Pol yoko moglko, makan nem yoba i kandre, prikwa i, Toki kide ikra ye kaglkwa pre ogo nagie yakenabo mo ta manan, tabre yage si gorabo mo di, kan meglkwa ba Pol moglmara taragl swara ta plau dikrukwa pre ye kandre, nagino kogl, aglke kor yegl digwa, Yagl i god ta moglkwa pamiwe di, yegl digwa.<verse eid="ACT 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7" />Ana ailan Malta i, gavana ta moglkwa, kagie Publius we digwa. Publius kipaugwa i, no pi, munara i kuri ta magigl dagl yogwa. Yegl erukwa pre yagl Publius i u no di idre, no agre i ede kipamara ogo, ege suota ye bogl mungo, ye kaya mokna gagl norukwa. <verse eid="ACT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8" />Yegl ere noruko, no ye bogl moglsre, kamga i, ye nem kidagl kide sugo, bogl mina ugl pai moglkwa. Kide ye sugwa i, ye ogo nagie ake niga dugo, de kuno, yegl erukwa. Yegl eruko, Pol kandre, ye pi pai moglmara pidre, God ye ere wakai ere tenabedi agle di pre, ogo i pi yagl i akugo, yagl kidagl i aragan erukwa. <verse eid="ACT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9" />Yegl erukwa pre ka i di wai digo, yoba ailan suna i meglkwa mudu prisre, yoba kide sigwa ailan suna i ta meglkwa i mudu agre yu Pol moglmara wigwa. Wigo, Pol ye mudu ere wakai ere togwa. <verse eid="ACT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10" />Yegl erukwa pre makan nem yoba mudu ailan meglkwa i ye gun yedre, no taragl kane kane norikwa. Te, no okuo dumo Malta kide kodo, ede enamnedi erumga igne, ye ama taragl kane kane no ta inamga paugwa i, noriko, no idre, ede omga.<verse eid="ACT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pol dumo Rom pi plau dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11" />Ana okna sip ta taun Aleksandria padre, ugwa ba ir podo erukwa ege yogwa pre dumo Malta pai moglkwa. Pai moglko, okuo no ede u ailan Malta i plau didre, ba suota mere munga. Ba suota mere mungo, okuo sip i ede Itali enagledi erukwa pre no ede sip i mina kuglo omgo, akie ede omga. Ana sip gumamugl i, Rom yoba godno Sus we digwa i wam suo pikagl miuriwe didre, kiano beke padiglkwa. <verse eid="ACT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12" />Ana no sip i mina ede pi taun ta Sirakyus we dimara pidre, ege suota pai munga. <verse eid="ACT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13" />Ege suota padre, aglke dumo i kide kodo, sip mina wan ede pi taun ta Regium we dimara pi pamga. Pamgo, ir ta nigl beye mogl ugo, kandre, no aglke dumo Regium kide kodo, ede omga. Pi munga, ege ta ede ogo, taun ta Puteoli we digwa kantri Itali suna yogwa, igle plau dumga.<verse eid="ACT 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14" />Ana no dumo Puteoli omgo, ye wakan swara mere moramne digwa pre no mungo, pre mediglkwa yoba tau u no tegigl yeigwa. No tegigl yedre, wakan swara i ye bogl akie moramniwe digo, no ye bogl akie pai munga. Ana no pai munga, wakan swara i dudugo, aglke kor makandigle wan ede pi dumo Rom enamnedi ede omga. <verse eid="ACT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15" />Ana no pi mungo, pre mediglkwa yoba dumo Rom suna meglkwa i, no wimiwe digo, prisre, u, no agre i ede suna enamnedi taun ta Apius Maket we dimara i suglno meglko, no pi ye tegigl yomgo, no akie ede pi taun ta ama kagie Haus Pasindia Suota we dimara i omgo, pre mediglkwa yoba tau ama u igle suglno meglko, tegigl yomga. Tegigl yomgo, Pol ye pre mediglkwa yoba meglkwa i kandre, gun yei, God di wakai yei togwa.<verse eid="ACT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16" />Ana no ede dumo kade Rom suna omgo, soldia swara ta Pol suglmo moran, Pol ye kane yugu paikre, yene yugu ta meda dokidre, panabedi kane yoba suglno meglkwa i pra we digwa.<verse eid="ACT 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Juda yoba dumo Rom meglkwa i, Pol ka beke togwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17" />Ana no dumo Rom ege suota mungo, Pol ye Juda yoba kade tau Rom suna meglkwa i agle dugo, u makai sigwa. U makai sigo, Pol ye di te, yegl dugwa, Agrama wagle, na erme kane yoba moglka i, na nono yugobunono ere kide ere tekre, te nono kowano awano mabunono siragl mere paugwa i ama mane dikrika. Yegl erika ba Juda yoba tau Jerusalem meglkwa i, ye na si kane si i pi Rom yoba meglmara ogono mina edigo, na kane paiwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18" />Ba Rom yoba i na kotna prikwa i, na aglau ta eribo, ye kandre, na si goraiglkwa mere yegl ta paikrukwa pre Rom yoba i na i meda edinamniwe digwa. <verse eid="ACT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19" />Yegl digwa ba Juda yoba ye na ede meda pikrabe digwa pre na konbauna swara keme ta yogo, kandre, Rom King na kotna prabiwe di, yegl diwe dugwa. Na ka yegl diga i, nono yugobuno Juda yoba i, kot mina di kide yei tekraglka ba na nana kana dinaglka i pre diwe dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20" />Yegl pre na ene ka yegl di tebo, ene pre pogl sinaiglkwa pre ene di makai siga. Nono Israel yoba munga i, nono Ere Inabuka Yagl unabedi sugl munga i, u kodugwa. Yegl pre na ye kogonmo erimara i, yoba kide kan, na si kane sigo, kane yoba moluwe di, Pol yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21" />Ana Pol ka yegl di, Juda yoba kade makai si meglkwa i, di te kodugo, Juda yoba kade ikra ye di ikne ede te, yegl digwa, Juda yoba tau distrik Judia suna meglkwa i, ene mabuno siragl mere etnga i, no ta pepa bogl noro, di norokrikwa. Te, no agroma tau Judia mogl, no munara wigwa i ama ene kagn kide ta yei teigo, prikrumga. <verse eid="ACT 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22" />Yegl ta dikrikwa ba no prumga i, yoba uglo koglo koglo meglkwa i, ene yugobuno ta motnara i, yoba kide meglmedi kagno kide yei teigo, prumne digwa. Yegl pre ene yugobuno ta meglmara i, siragl mere pre mediglkwa i, okuo ene di notn, pramniwe di, Juda yoba kade ikra yegl digwa.<verse eid="ACT 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23" />Ana Juda yoba kade ikra ka yegl didre, ye ege ta Pol bogl u, makai kor sinamnedi di padiglkwa. Ege ta padiglsre, ede pere pere eigo, ege ta padiglkwa i ugo, tagna mogl Juda yoba mere kide ede u Pol yugu ta pamara i, u makai sigwa. U makai sigo, Pol ye ka giglede di te, God yoba kingno mogl, ye suglno morabuka i pre di togwa. Di tedre, te ye Moses buk tau okna boglkwa i bage tau kere tedre, te ama ka kep yoba pere pere okna buk tau beglkwa i bage tau kere tedre, yoba Jisas pre medraiglmedi ka beke togwa. Pol ka yegl di ede ogo, min paugwa. <verse eid="ACT 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24" />Min paugo, Juda yoba makai si mogl, Pol ka dugwa prikwa i, tau kaima dumedi pre mediglkwa ba tau ka dugwa i prikwa ba pre medrakiurikwa.<verse eid="ACT 28:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25" />Ana Pol ka yegl di togo, Juda yoba u makai si mogl, prikwa ikra, yene swarade meglmara i nomane pere pere idre, ede pere pere enamnedi erikwa. Ye ede pere pere enamnedi eriko, Pol ka swara ta di te, yegl dugwa, Ene prio! dugwa. Mudu Murubuglo okna ibo ka swara ta di, ka kep yagl Aisaia togo, Aisaia bogl atne ede, ene kowano awano togwa i, kuno kaima dume dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26" />Ye yegl dugwa, Ene pi, Israel yoba yegl di to! dugwa, Ene na kana ege mere praiglkwa ba pre pogl sikraiglkwa. Te, ene na kogon eraglka i, ege mere kanaiglkwa ba kan pogl sikraiglmiwe di, yegl di to dugwa. <verse eid="ACT 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27" />Ene yegl dinatnga i, siragl pre Israel yoba nomano i, gigle di kodugwa. Te, ye kinano gi dinagledi erukwa pre ye ka ta pre pogl sikraiglkwa. Te, ye gumuglno kiglkwa pre kan pogl sikraiglkwa. Yegl ta erekribi, ye gumuglno mina kandre, kinano mina prisre, nomano mina pre pogl sidre, ede ikne u na moglka wibi, na ye ere wakai ere tenaluwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aisaia 6.9-10</char></note> di, Mudu Murubuglo yegl di Aisaia togo, Aisaia bogl atne edume di, Pol yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28-29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28-29" />Ana Pol yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Ene prio! dugwa. God yoba ere yugwa kamo i, ene Israel yoba prakiurikwa. Yegl pre God no ede pi yoba yugobuno pere pere meda meglmara i di tenaiglmedi dedugwa. Yegl pre no ye kamo i pi yoba i di tomun, ye praiglmiwe di, Pol yegl dugwa.<verse eid="ACT 28:28-29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30" />Ana Pol bugla yugu suo mudu ye yugu ta Rom topo si pamara i pai moglkwa. Pai moglko, yoba ye ta kanamnedi wigwa i, ye mudu di idre, <verse eid="ACT 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31" />God yoba kingno mogl, ye suglno morabuka pre ka beke tedre, nono Yaglno Kade Jisas, God Kere Yugwa yagl moglkwa i kamo ama beke tedre, erukwa. Yoba swara ta ye ka yegl dugwa i, si kegl dikruko, Pol kudugl goglkre, ka beke te pai moglkwa.<verse eid="ACT 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28" />
</usx>